(325999, 24997, 8701, '<td valign="top">A different time of day could have brought a better light which would be more visually pleasing, the background could have been something more home like, maybe a lawn or a pond with lillies, 4</td>', 'A different time of day could have brought a better light which would be more visually pleasing, the background could have been something more home like, maybe a lawn or a pond with lillies, 4', '2003-06-16 01:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
