(326006, 25014, 4159, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and color.  I know you''re anticipating complaints about the grain, to which you''ll respond that it was intentional - but I think it''s overly grained.</td>', 'I like the composition, and color.  I know you''re anticipating complaints about the grain, to which you''ll respond that it was intentional - but I think it''s overly grained.', '2003-06-16 01:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
