(326016, 24965, 8701, '<td valign="top">Maybe crop the bottom to make it look like the biker is higher then he actually is, panning would have created more of an effect of motion, but other then that the photo is ok. 5</td>', 'Maybe crop the bottom to make it look like the biker is higher then he actually is, panning would have created more of an effect of motion, but other then that the photo is ok. 5', '2003-06-16 01:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
