(326075, 24792, 7242, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. I don''t like the choice of border color though it seems to subtract from the picture.</td>', 'This is a nice shot. I don''t like the choice of border color though it seems to subtract from the picture.', '2003-06-16 02:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326076, 24677, 4159, '<td valign="top">Really weird crop on this one.  Are you sitting on your knees? I''d''ve liked it if there was more contrast between you and the background.</td>', 'Really weird crop on this one.  Are you sitting on your knees? I''d''ve liked it if there was more contrast between you and the background.', '2003-06-16 02:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
