(326164, 24833, 8701, '<td valign="top">This photo doesnt have much appeal, theres a sign on a barn. if it was taken from a different angle, say, next to the barn with the camera tilted upwards, that would be more visually pleasing. also why was this photo taken in such weather conditions? you should have waited until there was a sunny day and taken the photo then at around sunrise or sunset. also another subject may have added to the effect of the photo say a rooster or chicken. 4</td>', 'This photo doesnt have much appeal, theres a sign on a barn. if it was taken from a different angle, say, next to the barn with the camera tilted upwards, that would be more visually pleasing. also why was this photo taken in such weather conditions? you should have waited until there was a sunny day and taken the photo then at around sunrise or sunset. also another subject may have added to the effect of the photo say a rooster or chicken. 4', '2003-06-16 03:21:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(326165, 24728, 4159, '<td valign="top">I really like the muted colors and afternoon quality of this shot.  Good luck.</td>', 'I really like the muted colors and afternoon quality of this shot.  Good luck.', '2003-06-16 03:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
