(326180, 24675, 8953, '<td valign="top">Nice Job! This was My first chalenge. And lots of great entries...I have felt inclined to rate so many images with high marks. Yours is one of the best. If you dont see a ribbon you would have to be very close. You got My vote! Thanks<br/> <br/>Richard</td>', 'Nice Job! This was My first chalenge. And lots of great entries...I have felt inclined to rate so many images with high marks. Yours is one of the best. If you dont see a ribbon you would have to be very close. You got My vote! Thanks Richard', '2003-06-16 03:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(326181, 24469, 8701, '<td valign="top">Great idea, very original but the trees in the window distract me although i dont know how that could have been avoided, but the lighting too, it looks industrialized a warmer time of day would have been better. 7</td>', 'Great idea, very original but the trees in the window distract me although i dont know how that could have been avoided, but the lighting too, it looks industrialized a warmer time of day would have been better. 7', '2003-06-16 03:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
