(326185, 24950, 8701, '<td valign="top">Amazing vibrant color, I love how you can see so far into the hole, and the lighting is perfect as well, and the flowers also add to the effect. 10</td>', 'Amazing vibrant color, I love how you can see so far into the hole, and the lighting is perfect as well, and the flowers also add to the effect. 10', '2003-06-16 04:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(326186, 24585, 8701, '<td valign="top">Great angle, 7</td>', 'Great angle, 7', '2003-06-16 04:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(326187, 24792, 2780, '<td valign="top">I strongly disagree with your choice of border colour.</td>', 'I strongly disagree with your choice of border colour.', '2003-06-16 04:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326188, 24971, 6349, '<td valign="top">you shouldn''t have called this trampoline.  it would have been funny to try to figure out how this was achieved.  it''s funny that it looks like he''s almost standing on the roof, or maybe jumping off it, but he''s way too big.  lol</td>', 'you shouldn''t have called this trampoline.  it would have been funny to try to figure out how this was achieved.  it''s funny that it looks like he''s almost standing on the roof, or maybe jumping off it, but he''s way too big.  lol', '2003-06-16 04:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(326189, 24926, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like the feeling this photo conveys but somethings seems slighlty off with the composition.  I''m no expert or anything, but maybe it''s the drastic switch between the tree-line and the mountains behind it, or the fact that the red thing behind the tractor, which contrasts very nicely with the green btw, is cut off in the frame.  Other suggestions would be to make it slightly less sharp and lower the brightness on the highlights.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I like the feeling this photo conveys but somethings seems slighlty off with the composition.  I''m no expert or anything, but maybe it''s the drastic switch between the tree-line and the mountains behind it, or the fact that the red thing behind the tractor, which contrasts very nicely with the green btw, is cut off in the frame.  Other suggestions would be to make it slightly less sharp and lower the brightness on the highlights.  Keep up the good work.', '2003-06-16 04:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(326190, 24521, 6349, '<td valign="top">very interesting perspective and composition with the branch.  Shots like this are really tough to expose everything correctly since some parts are a lot closer than others.  You did a good job of it, but it still doesn''t look spot on.  The best way to do something like this, I''ve found, is to take 2 pictures and then combine them.  Of course, that isn''t allowed for the challenges, but I recommend you give it a try, it could really make this interesting image pop some more.</td>', 'very interesting perspective and composition with the branch.  Shots like this are really tough to expose everything correctly since some parts are a lot closer than others.  You did a good job of it, but it still doesn''t look spot on.  The best way to do something like this, I''ve found, is to take 2 pictures and then combine them.  Of course, that isn''t allowed for the challenges, but I recommend you give it a try, it could really make this interesting image pop some more.', '2003-06-16 04:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(326193, 24978, 6349, '<td valign="top">This photo of Christopher looks like it belongs in one of those big hairstyle books you see in the waiting area of hairsalons.  That''s just what I thought of it.  It''s a good image.  The highlights are slightly bright for my taste, but it does give it a magazine like feel and a smoother tone to the face.</td>', 'This photo of Christopher looks like it belongs in one of those big hairstyle books you see in the waiting area of hairsalons.  That''s just what I thought of it.  It''s a good image.  The highlights are slightly bright for my taste, but it does give it a magazine like feel and a smoother tone to the face.', '2003-06-16 04:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(326194, 25003, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice lighthouse shot.  I would have either gone with a b+w or boosted the colors, esp the blue in the sky, a bit to give the image more feel.  I would also crop out the puddle on the bottom which distracts from the rest of the photo.  Good photo, nice find, focus, and lighting.</td>', 'Nice lighthouse shot.  I would have either gone with a b+w or boosted the colors, esp the blue in the sky, a bit to give the image more feel.  I would also crop out the puddle on the bottom which distracts from the rest of the photo.  Good photo, nice find, focus, and lighting.', '2003-06-16 04:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(326196, 24984, 6349, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and focus.  Not sure I care for the crop, but not your fault, just the way the boats are behind the other boats, etc, it doesn''t crop smoothly.  I''m sure you deliberated for a while on the crop, and this was probablly the best you could get with what you were working with without moving immovable things.  Oh, and that little thing in the bottom left...should have cropped that out for sure.  Other than that, which I seem to have just written so much about, but really isn''t terrible at all, this shot is excellent.</td>', 'Lovely colors and focus.  Not sure I care for the crop, but not your fault, just the way the boats are behind the other boats, etc, it doesn''t crop smoothly.  I''m sure you deliberated for a while on the crop, and this was probablly the best you could get with what you were working with without moving immovable things.  Oh, and that little thing in the bottom left...should have cropped that out for sure.  Other than that, which I seem to have just written so much about, but really isn''t terrible at all, this shot is excellent.', '2003-06-16 04:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(326198, 24965, 6349, '<td valign="top">This kicks @$$ (not at money money!)  Great capture.  Focus is excellent and the texture and muddiness give it a great feel.  The only problem I have with it is the background.  Ideally, I would like the background blurred, but since you can''t do that I would have at least desaturated or lightened up or done something with the green.  Great job.  One of my favorites so far.</td>', 'This kicks @$$ (not at money money!)  Great capture.  Focus is excellent and the texture and muddiness give it a great feel.  The only problem I have with it is the background.  Ideally, I would like the background blurred, but since you can''t do that I would have at least desaturated or lightened up or done something with the green.  Great job.  One of my favorites so far.', '2003-06-16 04:32:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326201, 24951, 6349, '<td valign="top">for a sec I thought buddha was flipping someone the bird!  lol.  I really like the composition with the three plants coming up on the left (i know it''s really more than three, but the last group blends together) and the light and texture from the pine needles is really cool.  That said, the lighting and exposure was better chosen for your excellent choice of foreground than it was for the statue itself which has rather sharp highlights and the tree in the back would be best blackened out imo.  It would be interesting to play with this in levels a bit.  Nice work.</td>', 'for a sec I thought buddha was flipping someone the bird!  lol.  I really like the composition with the three plants coming up on the left (i know it''s really more than three, but the last group blends together) and the light and texture from the pine needles is really cool.  That said, the lighting and exposure was better chosen for your excellent choice of foreground than it was for the statue itself which has rather sharp highlights and the tree in the back would be best blackened out imo.  It would be interesting to play with this in levels a bit.  Nice work.', '2003-06-16 04:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326203, 24516, 6349, '<td valign="top">2 already dead trees and some living ones.  jk.  nice silhouette and sunset.  is that a really small bird in the tree or just my imagination? (wait, that might be the last remaining leave, you''re right it is dying and not dead!)</td>', '2 already dead trees and some living ones.  jk.  nice silhouette and sunset.  is that a really small bird in the tree or just my imagination? (wait, that might be the last remaining leave, you''re right it is dying and not dead!)', '2003-06-16 04:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326204, 24728, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, tones, textures.  Excellent work.</td>', 'Great lighting, tones, textures.  Excellent work.', '2003-06-16 04:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326205, 24639, 6349, '<td valign="top">oh boy oh boy.  we have a winner.  my favorite so far.  Praying Mantis''s are so incredibly bizarre.  I haven''t seen one in years.  Your lucky to have this photo op.  Even if I had the chance I wouldn''t be able to get shots like this.  Amazing focus on this macro.  Just superb.  10</td>', 'oh boy oh boy.  we have a winner.  my favorite so far.  Praying Mantis''s are so incredibly bizarre.  I haven''t seen one in years.  Your lucky to have this photo op.  Even if I had the chance I wouldn''t be able to get shots like this.  Amazing focus on this macro.  Just superb.  10', '2003-06-16 04:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326206, 24985, 6349, '<td valign="top">Cool angle.</td>', 'Cool angle.', '2003-06-16 04:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(326207, 24455, 6349, '<td valign="top">great capture.  for some reason it looks like he''s trying to eat the background though, not singing.  lol.  really cute shot.  i''m a sucker for animals! 9</td>', 'great capture.  for some reason it looks like he''s trying to eat the background though, not singing.  lol.  really cute shot.  i''m a sucker for animals! 9', '2003-06-16 04:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(326208, 24962, 6349, '<td valign="top">Now this I like alot.  Something that pushes the boundaries with the challenge topic and turns out something artistically as well as photographically intriguing, clear, and concise.  Excellent work. Love the clouds, they look like a fresco painting.   Good luck.</td>', 'Now this I like alot.  Something that pushes the boundaries with the challenge topic and turns out something artistically as well as photographically intriguing, clear, and concise.  Excellent work. Love the clouds, they look like a fresco painting.   Good luck.', '2003-06-16 04:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326209, 24979, 6349, '<td valign="top">Oh man.  This photo makes me so angry!  You wouldn''t believe, I spent about 2 hours the other day trying to take pictures of the humming birds in front of my house and they were just to fast.  I got NOTHING.  this is a great shot, esp. because I appreciate how difficult it is to get.  You should be very proud.</td>', 'Oh man.  This photo makes me so angry!  You wouldn''t believe, I spent about 2 hours the other day trying to take pictures of the humming birds in front of my house and they were just to fast.  I got NOTHING.  this is a great shot, esp. because I appreciate how difficult it is to get.  You should be very proud.', '2003-06-16 04:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(326210, 24559, 6349, '<td valign="top">Catepillars frighten me too!  really great colors on focus.</td>', 'Catepillars frighten me too!  really great colors on focus.', '2003-06-16 04:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(326211, 24839, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice composition (nice pool/fountain area too)!</td>', 'Nice composition (nice pool/fountain area too)!', '2003-06-16 04:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(326212, 24948, 6349, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  I''m a big fan of solitary trees.  Like the shades of green and blue and the clouds are windows perfect.  only flaw to this marvelous photo is that your border is uneven and distracting.  great work.</td>', 'Lovely.  I''m a big fan of solitary trees.  Like the shades of green and blue and the clouds are windows perfect.  only flaw to this marvelous photo is that your border is uneven and distracting.  great work.', '2003-06-16 04:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(326213, 24792, 6349, '<td valign="top">wooah.  wierd colors.  don''t like the border color, although it is interesting.  Perhaps if the light blue was pure white it would be better.  Was that the natural texture of the sculpture or did you use some sort of filter on it?  It looks like a really fascinating piece of art and you did a nice job photographing it.</td>', 'wooah.  wierd colors.  don''t like the border color, although it is interesting.  Perhaps if the light blue was pure white it would be better.  Was that the natural texture of the sculpture or did you use some sort of filter on it?  It looks like a really fascinating piece of art and you did a nice job photographing it.', '2003-06-16 04:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326214, 24950, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed.  The idea of it reminds me of my square entry.  Ironically, I think this would be better on-center, but it''s still very nice.  I just don''t care for the fence and small bit of flowers on the right, which if cropped would move the hole pretty close to the center.  Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice indeed.  The idea of it reminds me of my square entry.  Ironically, I think this would be better on-center, but it''s still very nice.  I just don''t care for the fence and small bit of flowers on the right, which if cropped would move the hole pretty close to the center.  Nice work.', '2003-06-16 04:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(326215, 24973, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is the third person I''ve seen in the air so far this challenge.  Some sort of challenge within a challenge huh, this site is getting complex.  jk<br/>Really cool perspective and nice motion bluring on the arms and feet while keeping the rest of the body in focus.</td>', 'This is the third person I''ve seen in the air so far this challenge.  Some sort of challenge within a challenge huh, this site is getting complex.  jkReally cool perspective and nice motion bluring on the arms and feet while keeping the rest of the body in focus.', '2003-06-16 05:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(326216, 24725, 6349, '<td valign="top">AHHHHahaha.  Awesome.  This attests to my believe that animal shots are getting better and better on here.  It''s good to see photographers taking a lot of shots and waiting for the perfect moment rather than just snapping a shot of a chipmunk they happen to see.  this is just awesome and it makes me smile.</td>', 'AHHHHahaha.  Awesome.  This attests to my believe that animal shots are getting better and better on here.  It''s good to see photographers taking a lot of shots and waiting for the perfect moment rather than just snapping a shot of a chipmunk they happen to see.  this is just awesome and it makes me smile.', '2003-06-16 05:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(326217, 24404, 6349, '<td valign="top">STRANGER!  Leave those kids alone!  I like the composition alot, but those other people have got to go...</td>', 'STRANGER!  Leave those kids alone!  I like the composition alot, but those other people have got to go...', '2003-06-16 05:04:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(326218, 24829, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like the post processing you did on this to make it pop everywhere except for on the ground, which looks a bit oversharpened.</td>', 'I like the post processing you did on this to make it pop everywhere except for on the ground, which looks a bit oversharpened.', '2003-06-16 05:07:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(326219, 24958, 8760, '<td valign="top">off center...really ?</td>', 'off center...really ?', '2003-06-16 05:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(326220, 24941, 6349, '<td valign="top">lol.  That''s really funny.  For some reason it makes me think of curious george and the man with the yellow hat.  i really have no idea why, mind you.  The shot could use something to really make it stand out, im not really sure what, just more clarity and crispness (better camera perhaps?  im in the same boat)/  Or maybe it would look good if you desaturated everything but yellow like in mavriks april fools day entry.</td>', 'lol.  That''s really funny.  For some reason it makes me think of curious george and the man with the yellow hat.  i really have no idea why, mind you.  The shot could use something to really make it stand out, im not really sure what, just more clarity and crispness (better camera perhaps?  im in the same boat)/  Or maybe it would look good if you desaturated everything but yellow like in mavriks april fools day entry.', '2003-06-16 05:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(326221, 24890, 6349, '<td valign="top">Really nice.  Infrared?  Just about a perfect image.  Can''t find much to critique about it.  I would fix that patch of grass in the front for use outside of the challenge.</td>', 'Really nice.  Infrared?  Just about a perfect image.  Can''t find much to critique about it.  I would fix that patch of grass in the front for use outside of the challenge.', '2003-06-16 05:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(326222, 25010, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like it.  Good use of duotone.  Really love the focus and mixture of softness and contrast, esp on the eyebrow.  Not sure how well this meets the challenge, sine the subject is pretty much right in the center, but you decided to use lights to cover it up.  Still an 8 from me.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like it.  Good use of duotone.  Really love the focus and mixture of softness and contrast, esp on the eyebrow.  Not sure how well this meets the challenge, sine the subject is pretty much right in the center, but you decided to use lights to cover it up.  Still an 8 from me.', '2003-06-16 05:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(326223, 24904, 6349, '<td valign="top">I''m very confused about what I''m looking at here.</td>', 'I''m very confused about what I''m looking at here.', '2003-06-16 05:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(326224, 24687, 6349, '<td valign="top">Nice tones.  Where is this?  it looks familiar.  I would have cropped off the right side to get rid of the dark trees.</td>', 'Nice tones.  Where is this?  it looks familiar.  I would have cropped off the right side to get rid of the dark trees.', '2003-06-16 05:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
