(326233, 25017, 6349, '<td valign="top">Wow great colors.  It really pops.  Like everything except the sky which seems too grainy.</td>', 'Wow great colors.  It really pops.  Like everything except the sky which seems too grainy.', '2003-06-16 05:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
