(326235, 25007, 6349, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  awesome colors and focus.  How do you get so close without scaring it away?</td>', 'Great capture.  awesome colors and focus.  How do you get so close without scaring it away?', '2003-06-16 05:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(326236, 24768, 6349, '<td valign="top">cool idea.  great red lighting, not sure how you got the spotlight so tight.  This really hits the mark for marketablilty.  I could see putting this on my wall.  Great job.  I think this is ribbon material.  10</td>', 'cool idea.  great red lighting, not sure how you got the spotlight so tight.  This really hits the mark for marketablilty.  I could see putting this on my wall.  Great job.  I think this is ribbon material.  10', '2003-06-16 05:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(326238, 24441, 6349, '<td valign="top">You mean ladybug, but i''m sure many others will also tell you that!  this needs more focus on the lady bug and not on the background.  The lighting doesn''t seem right for maximum color, which is something that one would like in a ladybug shot.  The texture of the background is nice.</td>', 'You mean ladybug, but i''m sure many others will also tell you that!  this needs more focus on the lady bug and not on the background.  The lighting doesn''t seem right for maximum color, which is something that one would like in a ladybug shot.  The texture of the background is nice.', '2003-06-16 05:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(326239, 24880, 6349, '<td valign="top">This looks much too grainy, sharpened, or pixelized, or something.  Interesting lines and forms though.</td>', 'This looks much too grainy, sharpened, or pixelized, or something.  Interesting lines and forms though.', '2003-06-16 05:38:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(326240, 24765, 6349, '<td valign="top">Fortune?  Did you find money on a seat!?  Really nice lighting and focus, interesting crop.</td>', 'Fortune?  Did you find money on a seat!?  Really nice lighting and focus, interesting crop.', '2003-06-16 05:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
