(326245, 24944, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very nice, like the window design and the textures outside. The model''s hair works well in silhouette. 10</td>', 'Very nice, like the window design and the textures outside. The model''s hair works well in silhouette. 10', '2003-06-16 05:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
