(326247, 24395, 6349, '<td valign="top">im trying to figure out if this is in water, on the ground, or being tossed in the air.  nice subtle shades of blue.</td>', 'im trying to figure out if this is in water, on the ground, or being tossed in the air.  nice subtle shades of blue.', '2003-06-16 05:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326248, 24978, 8522, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting, good expression... I like the angle, adds good character. Very professional portrait. 10</td>', 'Excellent lighting, good expression... I like the angle, adds good character. Very professional portrait. 10', '2003-06-16 05:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326249, 25012, 6349, '<td valign="top">Those are sick looking birds!  By sick I mean extraordinarily crazy and fascinating.  Are they some sort of vulture?  Where are they found?  See, good pictures make you curious and you have to ask a lot of questions.  This is georgeous.  10</td>', 'Those are sick looking birds!  By sick I mean extraordinarily crazy and fascinating.  Are they some sort of vulture?  Where are they found?  See, good pictures make you curious and you have to ask a lot of questions.  This is georgeous.  10', '2003-06-16 05:43:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(326250, 24639, 8522, '<td valign="top">Wow! Stunning! Great composition, colours, subject, etc. 10</td>', 'Wow! Stunning! Great composition, colours, subject, etc. 10', '2003-06-16 05:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(326251, 24761, 6349, '<td valign="top">the drifting eye is only bugging me out slightly.  With a little lighting work this would have been really great for black on black.  Good tones</td>', 'the drifting eye is only bugging me out slightly.  With a little lighting work this would have been really great for black on black.  Good tones', '2003-06-16 05:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(326252, 24985, 8522, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, gives a sense of speed although nothing is moving. Great idea for a shot, the chequered foreground works very well. 10</td>', 'I like the angle, gives a sense of speed although nothing is moving. Great idea for a shot, the chequered foreground works very well. 10', '2003-06-16 05:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(326253, 24672, 6349, '<td valign="top">is that a really tiny cricket or a really big rose?  Somehow this reminds me of James and the Giant Peach.</td>', 'is that a really tiny cricket or a really big rose?  Somehow this reminds me of James and the Giant Peach.', '2003-06-16 05:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326254, 24873, 6349, '<td valign="top">Woah.  Intense macro!  Great idea and execution.</td>', 'Woah.  Intense macro!  Great idea and execution.', '2003-06-16 05:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(326255, 24873, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, this must finish in the top 3! Love the lighting, brings out the delicate textures here. Great colours. Nice composition. Very effective dof. 10</td>', 'Beautiful, this must finish in the top 3! Love the lighting, brings out the delicate textures here. Great colours. Nice composition. Very effective dof. 10', '2003-06-16 05:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(326256, 24823, 6349, '<td valign="top">very nice classical looking photo.</td>', 'very nice classical looking photo.', '2003-06-16 05:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(326257, 24953, 6349, '<td valign="top">this needs a color boost.</td>', 'this needs a color boost.', '2003-06-16 05:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(326258, 24758, 8522, '<td valign="top">One of my favourite subjects! Shame about the nick on your guitar to the left of the picture. Lighting is just a tad on the harsh side for my taste, but only just. Very nice cropping, very effective. 9</td>', 'One of my favourite subjects! Shame about the nick on your guitar to the left of the picture. Lighting is just a tad on the harsh side for my taste, but only just. Very nice cropping, very effective. 9', '2003-06-16 05:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(326259, 24879, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus, textures, colors.  Don''t really care for the composiotion, especially the thing on the ground which I can''t tell what it is.  If it''s a shadow it should be black and not the same color as the spikes.</td>', 'Very nice focus, textures, colors.  Don''t really care for the composiotion, especially the thing on the ground which I can''t tell what it is.  If it''s a shadow it should be black and not the same color as the spikes.', '2003-06-16 05:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(326260, 24758, 6349, '<td valign="top">bet your pissed that you can''t remove that pesky speck!  Nice tones and crop.</td>', 'bet your pissed that you can''t remove that pesky speck!  Nice tones and crop.', '2003-06-16 05:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326262, 24857, 6349, '<td valign="top">what the heck is that dental floss doing in the picture?</td>', 'what the heck is that dental floss doing in the picture?', '2003-06-16 05:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(326263, 24634, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like what you''re doing.  keep it up.  hope you do well.</td>', 'I like what you''re doing.  keep it up.  hope you do well.', '2003-06-16 05:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(326264, 24736, 8522, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, I recognise this theme from somewhere (person blowing bubbles)...!<br/>Think you needed a less cluttered background. There''s too much going on in the picture, it''s hard to know where to focus. Other than that, nice! Perhaps some more bubbles as well?  6</td>', 'Hmmm, I recognise this theme from somewhere (person blowing bubbles)...!Think you needed a less cluttered background. There''s too much going on in the picture, it''s hard to know where to focus. Other than that, nice! Perhaps some more bubbles as well?  6', '2003-06-16 05:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326265, 24991, 6349, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen so many dollar coins all in one place!   Cool shot.</td>', 'I''ve never seen so many dollar coins all in one place!   Cool shot.', '2003-06-16 05:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(326266, 24675, 6349, '<td valign="top">wierd.  2 entries titled self-centered.  Really great line work and the border is just right.</td>', 'wierd.  2 entries titled self-centered.  Really great line work and the border is just right.', '2003-06-16 05:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(326267, 24784, 6349, '<td valign="top">lol.  how bizarre.  the other siames in this challenge was slightly cross-eyed too.  Cute cat.</td>', 'lol.  how bizarre.  the other siames in this challenge was slightly cross-eyed too.  Cute cat.', '2003-06-16 05:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(326268, 24969, 8522, '<td valign="top">I love this photo, great textures, colours, composition, lighting. The only thing that bothers me is the dof... I know you were probably after this effect, but it bothers me that the house isn''t in focus. I love the detail in the foreground rocks though, if the rocks AND house were in focus I''d have given this a 10 and it would have been my favouite picture. 9</td>', 'I love this photo, great textures, colours, composition, lighting. The only thing that bothers me is the dof... I know you were probably after this effect, but it bothers me that the house isn''t in focus. I love the detail in the foreground rocks though, if the rocks AND house were in focus I''d have given this a 10 and it would have been my favouite picture. 9', '2003-06-16 05:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(326269, 24592, 6349, '<td valign="top">i like it, i like it i do.  keep doing what you''re doing.  i fear it might not score that well, but it has style dammit, it has style.</td>', 'i like it, i like it i do.  keep doing what you''re doing.  i fear it might not score that well, but it has style dammit, it has style.', '2003-06-16 05:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(326271, 24861, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. Great textures, lighting, colours. 9</td>', 'Nice concept. Great textures, lighting, colours. 9', '2003-06-16 05:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(326272, 25000, 6349, '<td valign="top">that''s not yur mom that''s a man baby!</td>', 'that''s not yur mom that''s a man baby!', '2003-06-16 05:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
