(326298, 24816, 6349, '<td valign="top">nice feeling to this.  good clarity for the most part, but i really don''t like the pink flare.</td>', 'nice feeling to this.  good clarity for the most part, but i really don''t like the pink flare.', '2003-06-16 06:17:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326299, 24508, 6349, '<td valign="top">I think this would look awesome just as a silhouette.</td>', 'I think this would look awesome just as a silhouette.', '2003-06-16 06:17:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(326300, 24799, 6349, '<td valign="top">love the softness and the colors</td>', 'love the softness and the colors', '2003-06-16 06:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(326307, 24949, 6349, '<td valign="top">hmm...can i assume that this was taking during the nyc gtg?  I''m from NY myself, and in all my years I''ve taken many photos of the empire state building, but NEVER in fog.  It''s a very interesting view of it and I like the feeling it conveys.  I''ve heard it''s been raining non-stop there for about a month now.  It must have been a fun but wet experience.  I''d love to see more NYC fog and rain shots.</td>', 'hmm...can i assume that this was taking during the nyc gtg?  I''m from NY myself, and in all my years I''ve taken many photos of the empire state building, but NEVER in fog.  It''s a very interesting view of it and I like the feeling it conveys.  I''ve heard it''s been raining non-stop there for about a month now.  It must have been a fun but wet experience.  I''d love to see more NYC fog and rain shots.', '2003-06-16 07:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(326311, 24984, 6913, '<td valign="top">Good. Might look better if you cropped the foreground a bit.</td>', 'Good. Might look better if you cropped the foreground a bit.', '2003-06-16 07:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(326316, 24735, 8643, '<td valign="top">Not off center enough for me and I would have cropped the bottom off.</td>', 'Not off center enough for me and I would have cropped the bottom off.', '2003-06-16 08:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(326319, 24978, 8643, '<td valign="top">Forehead is blown out - maybe intended but I would prefer it less xposed.</td>', 'Forehead is blown out - maybe intended but I would prefer it less xposed.', '2003-06-16 08:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(326321, 24784, 8643, '<td valign="top">His fur is overexposed on his chest.  You could have exposed this less and kept the other darker detail.</td>', 'His fur is overexposed on his chest.  You could have exposed this less and kept the other darker detail.', '2003-06-16 08:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326324, 24816, 8643, '<td valign="top">The glints are overdone for me.</td>', 'The glints are overdone for me.', '2003-06-16 08:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(326325, 24890, 8643, '<td valign="top">How did you get the building so bright compared to the sky?  I like the photo, compelling.</td>', 'How did you get the building so bright compared to the sky?  I like the photo, compelling.', '2003-06-16 08:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(326328, 24821, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice photo and positioning... I like the way the bird looks like its waiting for another to arrive. Nice DOF, good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice photo and positioning... I like the way the bird looks like its waiting for another to arrive. Nice DOF, good luck with it.', '2003-06-16 08:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326329, 24965, 7857, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture, good sharp focus on the bike and rider, nice colours. All in all, a great shot.</td>', 'Very nice capture, good sharp focus on the bike and rider, nice colours. All in all, a great shot.', '2003-06-16 08:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326331, 24675, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, good colours. If you''d been able to get the plumb (thats what it is isn''t it?) in focus too that would have been great.</td>', 'Nice subject, good colours. If you''d been able to get the plumb (thats what it is isn''t it?) in focus too that would have been great.', '2003-06-16 08:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(326332, 24735, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good sports grab. I would have preferred it with either more of the ground in frame, or none at all... though I don''t know what effect this would have on the over-all postition. Good luck.</td>', 'Nice shot, good sports grab. I would have preferred it with either more of the ground in frame, or none at all... though I don''t know what effect this would have on the over-all postition. Good luck.', '2003-06-16 08:49:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(326336, 25007, 342, '<td valign="top">so, is this a real butterfly, or one of those papaer do-hickeys?,  anyway, this is a very nice picture, well composed, with nice vivid colors, the bottom of the butterfly seems a little bit out of focus to me, but that could be my eyes,</td>', 'so, is this a real butterfly, or one of those papaer do-hickeys?,  anyway, this is a very nice picture, well composed, with nice vivid colors, the bottom of the butterfly seems a little bit out of focus to me, but that could be my eyes,', '2003-06-16 08:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(326337, 24768, 7857, '<td valign="top">I think the thing that puts me off this picture is the complete lack of structure from the lamp... IMHO I think it would look quite good with some soft light to shot the stem and base of the lamp so that it wasn''t so disembodied. The shadow from the dice looks good. Mitonski</td>', 'I think the thing that puts me off this picture is the complete lack of structure from the lamp... IMHO I think it would look quite good with some soft light to shot the stem and base of the lamp so that it wasn''t so disembodied. The shadow from the dice looks good. Mitonski', '2003-06-16 08:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(326344, 24776, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good lighting. I know her body is off-centre, but it just doesn''t feel off-centred to me - my problem I know, just picky I guess - a little less of a tight crop on the left would look good IMO.</td>', 'Nice shot, good lighting. I know her body is off-centre, but it just doesn''t feel off-centred to me - my problem I know, just picky I guess - a little less of a tight crop on the left would look good IMO.', '2003-06-16 08:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(326345, 24985, 8829, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great shot. The angle is perfect. 10</td>', 'I think this is a great shot. The angle is perfect. 10', '2003-06-16 08:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(326349, 24952, 8829, '<td valign="top">Oh man, great shot. 10.</td>', 'Oh man, great shot. 10.', '2003-06-16 09:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(326352, 24592, 8829, '<td valign="top">Did you set this shot up or catch it? This is great. It seems slightly out of focus, but it works anyway. Perhaps the focus was intentionally a little off. Only thing that could make it better would be no trashcan, but I agree that you needed to leave the extra space in on the left. 9.</td>', 'Did you set this shot up or catch it? This is great. It seems slightly out of focus, but it works anyway. Perhaps the focus was intentionally a little off. Only thing that could make it better would be no trashcan, but I agree that you needed to leave the extra space in on the left. 9.', '2003-06-16 09:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(326354, 24873, 8829, '<td valign="top">What lens did you use for this?</td>', 'What lens did you use for this?', '2003-06-16 09:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(326355, 24677, 8829, '<td valign="top">Dude, that is funny. Great border work too. 10.</td>', 'Dude, that is funny. Great border work too. 10.', '2003-06-16 09:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(326360, 24735, 2634, '<td valign="top">o.k. I just have to ask the question...why did you leave inthe kids head? i''m thinking you wanted a drop of land for perspective, but it will get lower scores because of the half of a head.<br/>Excellent focus, colors and stopped motion on this.</td>', 'o.k. I just have to ask the question...why did you leave inthe kids head? i''m thinking you wanted a drop of land for perspective, but it will get lower scores because of the half of a head.Excellent focus, colors and stopped motion on this.', '2003-06-16 09:16:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(326361, 24412, 2634, '<td valign="top">good idea...unfortunately it lacks focus. Do you have auto focus? If so, it might have focused on the middle instead of the subject.</td>', 'good idea...unfortunately it lacks focus. Do you have auto focus? If so, it might have focused on the middle instead of the subject.', '2003-06-16 09:19:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(326362, 24761, 6202, '<td valign="top">This could be a  very amazing photo if not for the overprocessing,  The shadows created from the processing take away from the photo and make it look like a copy of a newspaper photo.</td>', 'This could be a  very amazing photo if not for the overprocessing,  The shadows created from the processing take away from the photo and make it look like a copy of a newspaper photo.', '2003-06-16 09:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326363, 24923, 2634, '<td valign="top">The idea is good. The pic is either pixelated or oversharpened though. It is also too dark.</td>', 'The idea is good. The pic is either pixelated or oversharpened though. It is also too dark.', '2003-06-16 09:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(326364, 24840, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. The colors, DOF and composition are all good. In fact it looks like the same shots I take. The only thing that would improve it would be if the lady bugs head was not shaded.</td>', 'Nice shot. The colors, DOF and composition are all good. In fact it looks like the same shots I take. The only thing that would improve it would be if the lady bugs head was not shaded.', '2003-06-16 09:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(326366, 24918, 2634, '<td valign="top">What a cutie...I would have liked to see this with out the background(fense and sky). It is very distracting because of the sky being blown out. Your DOF, color and focus are great.</td>', 'What a cutie...I would have liked to see this with out the background(fense and sky). It is very distracting because of the sky being blown out. Your DOF, color and focus are great.', '2003-06-16 09:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(326367, 24952, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice angle and perspective. I would love to see this rotated a touch, with the blades going into the corners. I like your use of B&amp;W here.</td>', 'Nice angle and perspective. I would love to see this rotated a touch, with the blades going into the corners. I like your use of B&W here.', '2003-06-16 09:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(326368, 24911, 2634, '<td valign="top">Nice use of sepia...</td>', 'Nice use of sepia...', '2003-06-16 09:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(326370, 24918, 4285, '<td valign="top">Great pic. If you''d only cropped out the overexposed sky and fence. 7 (cudda been an 8).</td>', 'Great pic. If you''d only cropped out the overexposed sky and fence. 7 (cudda been an 8).', '2003-06-16 09:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326372, 24643, 4400, '<td valign="top">off center  hmmm</td>', 'off center  hmmm', '2003-06-16 09:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(326377, 24735, 4400, '<td valign="top">very good!  need to cropped the boy off, 8pt</td>', 'very good!  need to cropped the boy off, 8pt', '2003-06-16 09:59:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326378, 24945, 4400, '<td valign="top">I just like this on, nice photo 10 pt</td>', 'I just like this on, nice photo 10 pt', '2003-06-16 10:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(326382, 24761, 1041, '<td valign="top">Your daughter is so beautiful and you take wonderful portraits of her, Rey :)  Perfect for the challenge, too!</td>', 'Your daughter is so beautiful and you take wonderful portraits of her, Rey :)  Perfect for the challenge, too!', '2003-06-16 10:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326384, 24901, 1041, '<td valign="top">A very courageous entry for DPC considering everything is blurred :-P  Love the colors and the motion, perfect capture, and the frame sets it off nicely.  I wouldn''t change a thing!</td>', 'A very courageous entry for DPC considering everything is blurred :-P  Love the colors and the motion, perfect capture, and the frame sets it off nicely.  I wouldn''t change a thing!', '2003-06-16 10:10:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(326395, 24952, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot and excellent choice for black and white.  I wish we had windmills like this in the US.  Maybe there are some but I just don''t know where they are :)  I particularly like the perspective you chose on this one.  I think this is my favorite shot in this challenge... = 10</td>', 'beautiful shot and excellent choice for black and white.  I wish we had windmills like this in the US.  Maybe there are some but I just don''t know where they are :)  I particularly like the perspective you chose on this one.  I think this is my favorite shot in this challenge... = 10', '2003-06-16 10:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(326396, 24735, 1041, '<td valign="top">Well, I think you are going to beat my motorcycle photo :-P  I like that you''ve left in that little corner of soil to kind of anchor your shot, but would''ve probably cropped even more from the bottom to get the partial head out.  Am envious of your blue sky (we had clouds all day) but your clouds give away that you did some major rotating here ... but it works reall well for the motorbike.  Cool shot :)</td>', 'Well, I think you are going to beat my motorcycle photo :-P  I like that you''ve left in that little corner of soil to kind of anchor your shot, but would''ve probably cropped even more from the bottom to get the partial head out.  Am envious of your blue sky (we had clouds all day) but your clouds give away that you did some major rotating here ... but it works reall well for the motorbike.  Cool shot :)', '2003-06-16 10:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(326397, 24559, 1041, '<td valign="top">Having the second flower in the shot just makes the shot.  Incredible detail and focus, wonderful shot.  Possibly a contender for a ribbon.</td>', 'Having the second flower in the shot just makes the shot.  Incredible detail and focus, wonderful shot.  Possibly a contender for a ribbon.', '2003-06-16 10:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(326407, 24973, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent shot... the title fits perfectly :) = 10</td>', 'excellent shot... the title fits perfectly :) = 10', '2003-06-16 10:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(326414, 24865, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice work!  I wonder how many people will something like "I think it might be tilted a little bit."  Anyway...  I think you did a great job with the exposure here.</td>', 'Nice work!  I wonder how many people will something like "I think it might be tilted a little bit."  Anyway...  I think you did a great job with the exposure here.', '2003-06-16 11:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326416, 24784, 3102, '<td valign="top">An interesting twist to the challenge...!  The coat of fur below the chin seems a bit blown out.</td>', 'An interesting twist to the challenge...!  The coat of fur below the chin seems a bit blown out.', '2003-06-16 11:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(326419, 24637, 3102, '<td valign="top">Dang... that''s a big fan!  Interesting concept... nice composition.  I may have preferred it in color, but I''m sure an equal number of people will say "nice use of B&amp;W"... so that''s just a personal preference.</td>', 'Dang... that''s a big fan!  Interesting concept... nice composition.  I may have preferred it in color, but I''m sure an equal number of people will say "nice use of B&W"... so that''s just a personal preference.', '2003-06-16 11:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(326422, 24758, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great!  I like the curves and the simplicity of it.  This is a good example of a shot that could be improved slightly by relaxed editing rules -- I''m sure that one little hot pixel in the bottom left is driving you nuts :)</td>', 'Great!  I like the curves and the simplicity of it.  This is a good example of a shot that could be improved slightly by relaxed editing rules -- I''m sure that one little hot pixel in the bottom left is driving you nuts :)', '2003-06-16 11:05:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(326423, 24977, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of it.  The red seems a little "too red"... but still a nice job.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of it.  The red seems a little "too red"... but still a nice job.', '2003-06-16 11:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(326425, 24378, 3102, '<td valign="top">An interesting abstract-ish image... I''m honestly not quite sure I get it, or how it quite fits into the challenge, though.</td>', 'An interesting abstract-ish image... I''m honestly not quite sure I get it, or how it quite fits into the challenge, though.', '2003-06-16 11:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(326426, 24890, 3102, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I just love scenes like this, and the use of B&amp;W is just great here (and it''s not often I say that).  Great job of bringing the clouds out, too!</td>', 'Awesome!  I just love scenes like this, and the use of B&W is just great here (and it''s not often I say that).  Great job of bringing the clouds out, too!', '2003-06-16 11:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(326429, 24702, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here, and the use of DOF.  I''ll be honest in saying that it''s not the most exciting of subjects, but that''s a lot of what photography is all about -- taking things we see every day and turning them into art! -6</td>', 'I like the colors here, and the use of DOF.  I''ll be honest in saying that it''s not the most exciting of subjects, but that''s a lot of what photography is all about -- taking things we see every day and turning them into art! -6', '2003-06-16 11:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(326431, 25012, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I have no idea what kinds of birds those are, but I''d say I wouldn''t want to meet them in a dark alley :)  Excellent sharpness/detail, and nice composition as well.  Nice work!  - 8</td>', 'Nice!  I have no idea what kinds of birds those are, but I''d say I wouldn''t want to meet them in a dark alley :)  Excellent sharpness/detail, and nice composition as well.  Nice work!  - 8', '2003-06-16 11:10:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326434, 24999, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice experiment with desaturating the colors, even though it left a few remants in some of the flowers in the shrubbery, and in the trees and roof.</td>', 'Nice experiment with desaturating the colors, even though it left a few remants in some of the flowers in the shrubbery, and in the trees and roof.', '2003-06-16 11:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(326435, 24636, 3102, '<td valign="top">Could be a teeny bit sharper, but I still enjoy shots of the moon.  Definitely meets the challenge :)</td>', 'Could be a teeny bit sharper, but I still enjoy shots of the moon.  Definitely meets the challenge :)', '2003-06-16 11:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(326437, 24523, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great subject!  To me, it feels like it could have been panned down just a touch -- it seems like there is just a little too much headroom.  But otherwise, it''s a great, relaxing shot.</td>', 'Great subject!  To me, it feels like it could have been panned down just a touch -- it seems like there is just a little too much headroom.  But otherwise, it''s a great, relaxing shot.', '2003-06-16 11:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326439, 24854, 3102, '<td valign="top">I don''t like too many playground shots, but this is a good one.  I like his expression and the reflection in the slide is great!  Nice job with the diagonal composition, too.</td>', 'I don''t like too many playground shots, but this is a good one.  I like his expression and the reflection in the slide is great!  Nice job with the diagonal composition, too.', '2003-06-16 11:14:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(326441, 24857, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice &amp; simple!  Interesting lines on this one.</td>', 'Nice & simple!  Interesting lines on this one.', '2003-06-16 11:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(326442, 25003, 3102, '<td valign="top">I love lighthouse shots!  I like the composition here.  It looks like it could be just a teeny bit sharper, particularly in the foreground, but it''s still a nice shot.</td>', 'I love lighthouse shots!  I like the composition here.  It looks like it could be just a teeny bit sharper, particularly in the foreground, but it''s still a nice shot.', '2003-06-16 11:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(326444, 24969, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow!  That''s a beautiful landscape!  I''ll look forward to seeing where this is.  Looks like they might have a long way to travel to get to the grocery store!  :) -9</td>', 'Wow!  That''s a beautiful landscape!  I''ll look forward to seeing where this is.  Looks like they might have a long way to travel to get to the grocery store!  :) -9', '2003-06-16 11:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(326445, 24609, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective -- looks like they''re 10 feet tall!  Interesting colors, too.</td>', 'I like the perspective -- looks like they''re 10 feet tall!  Interesting colors, too.', '2003-06-16 11:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(326447, 24933, 3102, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky!  Nice job on the exposure here -- it''s not easy to capture just a dramatic sky while still getting some detail in the landscape.</td>', 'Beautiful sky!  Nice job on the exposure here -- it''s not easy to capture just a dramatic sky while still getting some detail in the landscape.', '2003-06-16 11:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(326450, 24744, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice subject -- good idea!  It seems like the wood in the bench gets a little lost in the river.  I''m not sure how I''d suggest getting around that -- perhaps by shooting from a lower angle upward so that the trees are in the background of the bench? - 6</td>', 'Nice subject -- good idea!  It seems like the wood in the bench gets a little lost in the river.  I''m not sure how I''d suggest getting around that -- perhaps by shooting from a lower angle upward so that the trees are in the background of the bench? - 6', '2003-06-16 11:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(326452, 24861, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice &amp; sharp &amp; simple... although perhaps not the most exciting of subjects.  There seems to be a little excessive grain (just a teeny bit), and the reflection in the clock is a little distracting.</td>', 'Nice & sharp & simple... although perhaps not the most exciting of subjects.  There seems to be a little excessive grain (just a teeny bit), and the reflection in the clock is a little distracting.', '2003-06-16 11:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(326453, 25007, 3102, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and awesome details!  Great job overall -- I can easily see this as a top 10 this week.  It may have been interesting to even make the DOF even more shallow, although it''s certainly nicely done here! - 10</td>', 'Beautiful colors and awesome details!  Great job overall -- I can easily see this as a top 10 this week.  It may have been interesting to even make the DOF even more shallow, although it''s certainly nicely done here! - 10', '2003-06-16 11:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(326454, 24997, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice job with the DOF here!  I like the coloring as well.</td>', 'Nice job with the DOF here!  I like the coloring as well.', '2003-06-16 11:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(326455, 24741, 3102, '<td valign="top">I actually tried something similar with a stop light this week, and I also encountered the same lens flares.  Too bad we can''t edit those things out, eh?</td>', 'I actually tried something similar with a stop light this week, and I also encountered the same lens flares.  Too bad we can''t edit those things out, eh?', '2003-06-16 11:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(326457, 24395, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like it!  One thing that immediately makes it interesting to me is that I can''t tell whether this is sitting in the water, being thrown in the air, or is just sitting on a blue background.  Neat, simple shot.</td>', 'I like it!  One thing that immediately makes it interesting to me is that I can''t tell whether this is sitting in the water, being thrown in the air, or is just sitting on a blue background.  Neat, simple shot.', '2003-06-16 11:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(326458, 24673, 3102, '<td valign="top">I always enjoy getting skies that are just right for shots like this.  It''s fun to get a great contrast on a building like this when the sky is just right.  The face of the church looks just a little too bright to me, but otherwise I like it a lot.</td>', 'I always enjoy getting skies that are just right for shots like this.  It''s fun to get a great contrast on a building like this when the sky is just right.  The face of the church looks just a little too bright to me, but otherwise I like it a lot.', '2003-06-16 11:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(326459, 24670, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field here!  The overall image seems just a teeny bit dark, but still good.  I like the fact that you used nearly the full image size available, too!</td>', 'Nice depth of field here!  The overall image seems just a teeny bit dark, but still good.  I like the fact that you used nearly the full image size available, too!', '2003-06-16 11:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326460, 24404, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cute shot!  I''m not sure that the people in the background add to the image, though.  It seems like they don''t really serve a purpose as far as the shot is concerned -- it would have been interesting to see this without them (no offense to them, of course :)</td>', 'Cute shot!  I''m not sure that the people in the background add to the image, though.  It seems like they don''t really serve a purpose as far as the shot is concerned -- it would have been interesting to see this without them (no offense to them, of course :)', '2003-06-16 11:28:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(326461, 24910, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great macro -- nice details on Mr. Slug!  And he is indeed off-center :)</td>', 'Great macro -- nice details on Mr. Slug!  And he is indeed off-center :)', '2003-06-16 11:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(326462, 24944, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  This could certainly land in the Top 10, I would think.  I love shots like this... ones that almost tell a story without saying a word :)</td>', 'Wonderful!  This could certainly land in the Top 10, I would think.  I love shots like this... ones that almost tell a story without saying a word :)', '2003-06-16 11:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(326463, 24736, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice &amp; clear -- good use of DOF too!</td>', 'Nice & clear -- good use of DOF too!', '2003-06-16 11:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(326466, 24962, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  I''m assuming you desaturated all of the colors except for the yellows in the building.  Makes for an interesting, dramatic shot.  My only nitpick would be that the desaturation kinda added the element of excessive grain to the sky, but it''s still interesting.</td>', 'Cool shot!  I''m assuming you desaturated all of the colors except for the yellows in the building.  Makes for an interesting, dramatic shot.  My only nitpick would be that the desaturation kinda added the element of excessive grain to the sky, but it''s still interesting.', '2003-06-16 11:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(326467, 24905, 3102, '<td valign="top">If I hadn''t been in a bit of a hurry last night, my submission would have been a windmill also!  Now I''m kinda glad I didn''t submit it, because yours would have kicked my butt!  :)  Beautiful composition -- I love the landscape aroud it, and the subtle colors in the sky.  - 10!</td>', 'If I hadn''t been in a bit of a hurry last night, my submission would have been a windmill also!  Now I''m kinda glad I didn''t submit it, because yours would have kicked my butt!  :)  Beautiful composition -- I love the landscape aroud it, and the subtle colors in the sky.  - 10!', '2003-06-16 11:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(326471, 24792, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m afraid the border just about ruined a really interesting shot here.  I really like the subject, even though I don''t quite know what it is.  The detail in the metal (?) is really nice, and I like the color of the sky.  The green was just not the best choice of border, in my opinion :(</td>', 'Well, I''m afraid the border just about ruined a really interesting shot here.  I really like the subject, even though I don''t quite know what it is.  The detail in the metal (?) is really nice, and I like the color of the sky.  The green was just not the best choice of border, in my opinion :(', '2003-06-16 11:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(326473, 24973, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wheeee!  Looks like fun!  Nice job of capturing the leap at a great point... and without falling in yourself!</td>', 'Wheeee!  Looks like fun!  Nice job of capturing the leap at a great point... and without falling in yourself!', '2003-06-16 11:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326474, 25010, 3102, '<td valign="top">Kinda spooky :)  I suppose it meets the challenge, but in kind of a weird way.  In other words, I''m guessing that your intent was to highlight the left side of the face ("the subject") while leaving the other side dark.  But since the other half of the face is "implied," it still seems centered to me... but that''s just my rambling.  It''s still an interesting shot with a cool mood to it.</td>', 'Kinda spooky :)  I suppose it meets the challenge, but in kind of a weird way.  In other words, I''m guessing that your intent was to highlight the left side of the face ("the subject") while leaving the other side dark.  But since the other half of the face is "implied," it still seems centered to me... but that''s just my rambling.  It''s still an interesting shot with a cool mood to it.', '2003-06-16 11:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326478, 24772, 3102, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject, and interesting experiment with desaturation.  I''m not sure this was the best use of the color desaturation method, to be honest.  I would probably try to use that technique to highlight the subject of a shot, but I''m not sure that the guy''s shirt (or whatever it is he is wearing) is really the "subject" here that you want to highlight.  But it''s definitely interesting to experiement with this kind of thing.  - 6</td>', 'An interesting subject, and interesting experiment with desaturation.  I''m not sure this was the best use of the color desaturation method, to be honest.  I would probably try to use that technique to highlight the subject of a shot, but I''m not sure that the guy''s shirt (or whatever it is he is wearing) is really the "subject" here that you want to highlight.  But it''s definitely interesting to experiement with this kind of thing.  - 6', '2003-06-16 11:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326479, 24984, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection - great colors!  I might have tried cropping out the tiny round thing at the bottom left, but as a boat lover, it''s still a nice shot.  :)</td>', 'Nice reflection - great colors!  I might have tried cropping out the tiny round thing at the bottom left, but as a boat lover, it''s still a nice shot.  :)', '2003-06-16 11:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(326480, 24672, 3102, '<td valign="top">Seems like it could be a teeny bit more crisp overall, but it''s a nice macro nonetheless.</td>', 'Seems like it could be a teeny bit more crisp overall, but it''s a nice macro nonetheless.', '2003-06-16 11:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(326481, 24687, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. Sky is dead with clouds like so often here in Oregon. Hate that but not a thing ya can do. This is a good shot, interesting to the eye with lots to look at. It''s got lonely feel.</td>', 'I like this shot. Sky is dead with clouds like so often here in Oregon. Hate that but not a thing ya can do. This is a good shot, interesting to the eye with lots to look at. It''s got lonely feel.', '2003-06-16 11:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(326482, 25015, 3102, '<td valign="top">Good eye!  I like the patterns created by the fence.  And nice job spotting the lone flower in the scene.</td>', 'Good eye!  I like the patterns created by the fence.  And nice job spotting the lone flower in the scene.', '2003-06-16 11:43:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(326483, 24748, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity!  I''m honestly not crazy about the background color (maybe black would have been more dramatic?) but I still like this a lot.</td>', 'I like the simplicity!  I''m honestly not crazy about the background color (maybe black would have been more dramatic?) but I still like this a lot.', '2003-06-16 11:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326485, 24687, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice toning!  The sky is quite grainy, but I think it adds to the mood in this case. - 8</td>', 'Nice toning!  The sky is quite grainy, but I think it adds to the mood in this case. - 8', '2003-06-16 11:45:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(326486, 24592, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot, like this. Done well in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Neat shot, like this. Done well in B&W.', '2003-06-16 11:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(326489, 24469, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid it''s hard to pinpoint the intended subject of this one.  It looks like it must be a neat room of the house, I''ll admit!</td>', 'I''m afraid it''s hard to pinpoint the intended subject of this one.  It looks like it must be a neat room of the house, I''ll admit!', '2003-06-16 11:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(326490, 24949, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. I think this also would of worked for the black on black.</td>', 'Neat shot. I think this also would of worked for the black on black.', '2003-06-16 11:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326491, 24993, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice touch of motion on the child!  :)</td>', 'Nice touch of motion on the child!  :)', '2003-06-16 11:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(326492, 24958, 327, '<td valign="top">Very cool building I don''t think I''ve seen this before...different and then some. Nice photo, great sky.</td>', 'Very cool building I don''t think I''ve seen this before...different and then some. Nice photo, great sky.', '2003-06-16 11:47:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(326493, 24931, 3102, '<td valign="top">You''ve taken an otherwise dull subject and made it interesting!  I like the perspective here.  The colors are really dramatic here, too.  And I can''t help but make the wise crack that this could be the new emblem of the 4H Club!  - 8</td>', 'You''ve taken an otherwise dull subject and made it interesting!  I like the perspective here.  The colors are really dramatic here, too.  And I can''t help but make the wise crack that this could be the new emblem of the 4H Club!  - 8', '2003-06-16 11:47:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(326494, 24780, 3102, '<td valign="top">Would have been a great choice for the "black on black" challenge, too, eh?  Funny expression!  :)</td>', 'Would have been a great choice for the "black on black" challenge, too, eh?  Funny expression!  :)', '2003-06-16 11:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(326495, 24558, 327, '<td valign="top">Like this one.</td>', 'Like this one.', '2003-06-16 11:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326497, 24573, 3102, '<td valign="top">Well, it''s a bit on the small side to make a good judgement.  Please try to submit bigger images -- you''ll do much better just for that reason!  It looks like you used the flash here, too, which is making for some unusually shiny features in the plants, too.</td>', 'Well, it''s a bit on the small side to make a good judgement.  Please try to submit bigger images -- you''ll do much better just for that reason!  It looks like you used the flash here, too, which is making for some unusually shiny features in the plants, too.', '2003-06-16 11:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(326498, 24675, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  Looks like it could have been focused just a teeny bit better, but I love the idea.</td>', 'Great concept!  Looks like it could have been focused just a teeny bit better, but I love the idea.', '2003-06-16 11:50:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(326500, 24359, 3102, '<td valign="top">This one reminds me a lot of the "negative space" challenge from several months ago.  Neat concept.</td>', 'This one reminds me a lot of the "negative space" challenge from several months ago.  Neat concept.', '2003-06-16 11:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(326502, 24643, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s a neat shot, but I''m not sure it''s the most appropriate one for the challenge.  In other words, it''s a little hard to identify a single "off-center" subject here...</td>', 'It''s a neat shot, but I''m not sure it''s the most appropriate one for the challenge.  In other words, it''s a little hard to identify a single "off-center" subject here...', '2003-06-16 11:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(326503, 24931, 327, '<td valign="top">Really nice color (saturation)..super. Love the perspective view.</td>', 'Really nice color (saturation)..super. Love the perspective view.', '2003-06-16 11:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
