(326509, 24516, 3102, '<td valign="top">Interesting sky colors!  I''m assuming you did a bit of adjusting with the hue on ''em?  Very cool.</td>', 'Interesting sky colors!  I''m assuming you did a bit of adjusting with the hue on ''em?  Very cool.', '2003-06-16 11:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(326510, 24771, 1280, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting!</td>', 'Lovely lighting!', '2003-06-16 11:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(326511, 24602, 3102, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, although I''m not quite sure how to feel about it.  I think I might have liked it better if she had been singing at the time.</td>', 'Interesting shot, although I''m not quite sure how to feel about it.  I think I might have liked it better if she had been singing at the time.', '2003-06-16 11:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(326513, 24958, 3102, '<td valign="top">This is also an awesome place to shoot at night if you have the chance!  One of the most interesting pieces of architecture I''ve ever visited.  And I might also add that there''s an entire corner dedicated to Alan Freed in there (seriously!).</td>', 'This is also an awesome place to shoot at night if you have the chance!  One of the most interesting pieces of architecture I''ve ever visited.  And I might also add that there''s an entire corner dedicated to Alan Freed in there (seriously!).', '2003-06-16 11:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(326515, 24954, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- now THAT is a macro!  That''s amazing!  I like the toning, and pretty much everything about it.  Very impressive!  - 10</td>', 'Wow -- now THAT is a macro!  That''s amazing!  I like the toning, and pretty much everything about it.  Very impressive!  - 10', '2003-06-16 11:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(326516, 24913, 3102, '<td valign="top">Whoa -- are we back on the Matrix kick again...?  :)  Nice, simple image.  A tad blown out for my tastes, but still cool.</td>', 'Whoa -- are we back on the Matrix kick again...?  :)  Nice, simple image.  A tad blown out for my tastes, but still cool.', '2003-06-16 11:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326517, 24759, 3102, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and serene!  Nice shot and great color variations.</td>', 'Beautiful and serene!  Nice shot and great color variations.', '2003-06-16 11:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(326518, 24873, 3102, '<td valign="top">A little abstracty for my tastes, to be honest... but at the same time it''s an interesting variety of reds.</td>', 'A little abstracty for my tastes, to be honest... but at the same time it''s an interesting variety of reds.', '2003-06-16 11:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(326519, 24953, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective!  I like the colors here, too.  Nice work!</td>', 'Nice perspective!  I like the colors here, too.  Nice work!', '2003-06-16 11:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(326520, 24971, 3102, '<td valign="top">Would have been even better without the house in the background!  I like the still action here.  Super!</td>', 'Would have been even better without the house in the background!  I like the still action here.  Super!', '2003-06-16 11:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326521, 24941, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cute!  It might be a tad bit busy, but it still effectively tells a story here.</td>', 'Cute!  It might be a tad bit busy, but it still effectively tells a story here.', '2003-06-16 12:00:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326522, 24923, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, although it looks like the subject could be a little sharper.</td>', 'Nice DOF, although it looks like the subject could be a little sharper.', '2003-06-16 12:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326524, 24901, 3102, '<td valign="top">Fun colors!  The motion tells a nice story here, too!</td>', 'Fun colors!  The motion tells a nice story here, too!', '2003-06-16 12:00:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(326525, 25014, 3102, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a drawing... nice use of grain!</td>', 'Almost looks like a drawing... nice use of grain!', '2003-06-16 12:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(326527, 24816, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot.  I like the colors.  It would have been nice to see a little more detail of the lighthouse itself, but you probably would have needed some sort of light to brighten it up.</td>', 'Nice night shot.  I like the colors.  It would have been nice to see a little more detail of the lighthouse itself, but you probably would have needed some sort of light to brighten it up.', '2003-06-16 12:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(326529, 24925, 3102, '<td valign="top">May have been a bit stronger had the foreground been a little sharper.  But if you''re falling through several flights of stairs, it''s probably hard to concentrate on that :)</td>', 'May have been a bit stronger had the foreground been a little sharper.  But if you''re falling through several flights of stairs, it''s probably hard to concentrate on that :)', '2003-06-16 12:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(326530, 24950, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great scene!  Looks like a beautiful, enchanted sort of place.  Nice job!</td>', 'Great scene!  Looks like a beautiful, enchanted sort of place.  Nice job!', '2003-06-16 12:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(326531, 24965, 3102, '<td valign="top">Weeee!  My biking-enthusiast neighbor has told me in the past how hard it is to capture these shots, so I''ll have to bump you up a point for that alone!  Great work.</td>', 'Weeee!  My biking-enthusiast neighbor has told me in the past how hard it is to capture these shots, so I''ll have to bump you up a point for that alone!  Great work.', '2003-06-16 12:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(326532, 24469, 6630, '<td valign="top">I dont get it</td>', 'I dont get it', '2003-06-16 12:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(326533, 24765, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great work!  I was searching for something similiar in our area, but couldn''t find one this week.  :)</td>', 'Great work!  I was searching for something similiar in our area, but couldn''t find one this week.  :)', '2003-06-16 12:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(326534, 24508, 3102, '<td valign="top">Clever -- good eye!  The DOF really brings out the little guy.</td>', 'Clever -- good eye!  The DOF really brings out the little guy.', '2003-06-16 12:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(326535, 24952, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice use of B&amp;W... nice, crisp shot!</td>', 'Nice use of B&W... nice, crisp shot!', '2003-06-16 12:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(326540, 24657, 4856, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2003-06-16 12:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(326551, 24771, 1041, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, fits the challenge well.  Overall just a tad dark I think.</td>', 'Beautiful composition, fits the challenge well.  Overall just a tad dark I think.', '2003-06-16 12:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(326554, 24674, 1041, '<td valign="top">This photo looks to me like it would be nicer in color ... aren''t children''s toys made for that?  I like the composition and that you used a towel as the backdrop, it adds nice texture.</td>', 'This photo looks to me like it would be nicer in color ... aren''t children''s toys made for that?  I like the composition and that you used a towel as the backdrop, it adds nice texture.', '2003-06-16 12:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326561, 24974, 1041, '<td valign="top">Interesting combination, the record and the guitar go well together.  I wonder if it had worked even better if the label had a totally different color to set the label and the reflection apart more.  But maybe you wanted to have them similar.  Plus, I''m no big fan of Bob Dylan but I won''t deduct points for that ;)</td>', 'Interesting combination, the record and the guitar go well together.  I wonder if it had worked even better if the label had a totally different color to set the label and the reflection apart more.  But maybe you wanted to have them similar.  Plus, I''m no big fan of Bob Dylan but I won''t deduct points for that ;)', '2003-06-16 12:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(326566, 24941, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m very indecisive about the points to give you.  The image fits the challenge, the title is cute, the fact that you captured this is great, but still, somehow there''s too much extraneous stuff here.  I know you need some to set things off, but I wonder if you could''ve cropped a little closer around what matters if you''d moved more to the right.  Of course there could''ve been stuff in the way or the opportunity could''ve been gone ... who knows.</td>', 'I''m very indecisive about the points to give you.  The image fits the challenge, the title is cute, the fact that you captured this is great, but still, somehow there''s too much extraneous stuff here.  I know you need some to set things off, but I wonder if you could''ve cropped a little closer around what matters if you''d moved more to the right.  Of course there could''ve been stuff in the way or the opportunity could''ve been gone ... who knows.', '2003-06-16 12:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(326588, 24768, 3724, '<td valign="top">very good title..... and superb idea.......</td>', 'very good title..... and superb idea.......', '2003-06-16 13:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(326591, 24918, 7800, '<td valign="top">You''ve lost a lot of detail in the white dress; the highlights are blown. Perhaps you can meter on the dress and then back up and shoot the scene.</td>', 'You''ve lost a lot of detail in the white dress; the highlights are blown. Perhaps you can meter on the dress and then back up and shoot the scene.', '2003-06-16 13:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326632, 24745, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s quite a neat idea, but I''m afraid the execution falls a bit short here.  The image as a whole is blurred, and the bookshelves make it a bit busy.</td>', 'It''s quite a neat idea, but I''m afraid the execution falls a bit short here.  The image as a whole is blurred, and the bookshelves make it a bit busy.', '2003-06-16 13:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(326633, 24833, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like farm shots.  I might have tried boosting the saturation just a teeny bit to bring out the red a little more, but still a very nice shot.</td>', 'Nice!  I like farm shots.  I might have tried boosting the saturation just a teeny bit to bring out the red a little more, but still a very nice shot.', '2003-06-16 13:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(326635, 24558, 3102, '<td valign="top">Clever title!  I like the shot -- simple and well done.</td>', 'Clever title!  I like the shot -- simple and well done.', '2003-06-16 13:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(326636, 25016, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not sure what the intent of the blurring is...</td>', 'Not sure what the intent of the blurring is...', '2003-06-16 13:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326648, 25018, 3102, '<td valign="top">That''s an interesting abstract!  Don''t have a clue what I''m looking at, but it''s an interesting composition :)</td>', 'That''s an interesting abstract!  Don''t have a clue what I''m looking at, but it''s an interesting composition :)', '2003-06-16 13:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(326649, 24990, 3102, '<td valign="top">All together now... "Awwwww."  :)  A cute, touching shot, especially for those of us who are dads.  I like this perspective -- It would also be interesting to see a version of this shot down at her level too.</td>', 'All together now... "Awwwww."  :)  A cute, touching shot, especially for those of us who are dads.  I like this perspective -- It would also be interesting to see a version of this shot down at her level too.', '2003-06-16 13:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(326651, 24926, 3102, '<td valign="top">Geez, it''s funny how many different shots I took for this challenge, and how often I see one that is very similar to something I shot!  I took something very similar to this yesterday afternoon, but didn''t submit it.  I like the shot, and the terrain surrounding it!  Nice work.</td>', 'Geez, it''s funny how many different shots I took for this challenge, and how often I see one that is very similar to something I shot!  I took something very similar to this yesterday afternoon, but didn''t submit it.  I like the shot, and the terrain surrounding it!  Nice work.', '2003-06-16 13:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(326655, 24674, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice &amp; simple.  Not a lot of "wow" factor, in all honesty, but it''s nicely composed, and crisp.</td>', 'Nice & simple.  Not a lot of "wow" factor, in all honesty, but it''s nicely composed, and crisp.', '2003-06-16 13:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(326656, 24911, 3102, '<td valign="top">An interesting panoroma!  I''m curious as to why there''s a vertical line in the cloud in the upper left...?  I like the overall tone of the shot.  Looks like an interesting place to visit.</td>', 'An interesting panoroma!  I''m curious as to why there''s a vertical line in the cloud in the upper left...?  I like the overall tone of the shot.  Looks like an interesting place to visit.', '2003-06-16 13:59:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(326658, 25000, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great and unusual!  You did a great job with the skin tones, and it''s an interesting pose.  Very sharp focus here, too.</td>', 'Great and unusual!  You did a great job with the skin tones, and it''s an interesting pose.  Very sharp focus here, too.', '2003-06-16 14:01:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(326660, 24768, 3102, '<td valign="top">May have worked well for the black/black challenge, too!  Nice set up here.</td>', 'May have worked well for the black/black challenge, too!  Nice set up here.', '2003-06-16 14:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326661, 24879, 3102, '<td valign="top">Ouch -- it almost poked me in the eye!  Great DOF here -- it certainly reaches right out of the picture!</td>', 'Ouch -- it almost poked me in the eye!  Great DOF here -- it certainly reaches right out of the picture!', '2003-06-16 14:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326663, 24829, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow -- great colors!  I love the yellow on the dark sky -- quite dramatic!  Great example of taking an everyday scene and turning it into art.</td>', 'Wow -- great colors!  I love the yellow on the dark sky -- quite dramatic!  Great example of taking an everyday scene and turning it into art.', '2003-06-16 14:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(326664, 24639, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great macro!  I really feel like I''m being watched!  :)  Nice job overall... great DOF.</td>', 'Great macro!  I really feel like I''m being watched!  :)  Nice job overall... great DOF.', '2003-06-16 14:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(326666, 24677, 3102, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing -- I think it adds a lot to the shot, which itself is interesting.</td>', 'Interesting framing -- I think it adds a lot to the shot, which itself is interesting.', '2003-06-16 14:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326668, 24634, 3102, '<td valign="top">Interesting, dreamy feel... I would have liked to have seen a crisper focus on the rose though.  I think this could have been an awesome shot with a little closer view of the rose, with a bit more color with the "fog" swirling in.  This looks like a very interesting setup that would be fun to experiment with.</td>', 'Interesting, dreamy feel... I would have liked to have seen a crisper focus on the rose though.  I think this could have been an awesome shot with a little closer view of the rose, with a bit more color with the "fog" swirling in.  This looks like a very interesting setup that would be fun to experiment with.', '2003-06-16 14:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326669, 24978, 3102, '<td valign="top">Overall I like this quite a bit.  I think the blown out portions of the forehead and right cheek detract a little from it, though.</td>', 'Overall I like this quite a bit.  I think the blown out portions of the forehead and right cheek detract a little from it, though.', '2003-06-16 14:05:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326670, 24493, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice job of removing all of the other background elements to provide a nice clean shot of this... well done!</td>', 'Nice job of removing all of the other background elements to provide a nice clean shot of this... well done!', '2003-06-16 14:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(326672, 24916, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good use of DOF.  Not a lot of "wow" here, in all honesty, but a well-done shot.</td>', 'Nice shot, good use of DOF.  Not a lot of "wow" here, in all honesty, but a well-done shot.', '2003-06-16 14:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326673, 24559, 3102, '<td valign="top">This has to be a Top 10, perhaps Top 3 shot!  The colors are just awesome here.  The subjects are great -- this is one of those rare instances where I could easily see this hanging on the wall.  Great job!  - 10</td>', 'This has to be a Top 10, perhaps Top 3 shot!  The colors are just awesome here.  The subjects are great -- this is one of those rare instances where I could easily see this hanging on the wall.  Great job!  - 10', '2003-06-16 14:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326675, 24799, 3102, '<td valign="top">Seems a little overly cropped to me as far as the flower itself goes.  The stem at the left seems to detract a little, too.  Not bad overall, though.</td>', 'Seems a little overly cropped to me as far as the flower itself goes.  The stem at the left seems to detract a little, too.  Not bad overall, though.', '2003-06-16 14:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(326676, 24441, 3102, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge quite well.  Lacks a bit of "wow" factor for me though, in all honesty.</td>', 'Meets the challenge quite well.  Lacks a bit of "wow" factor for me though, in all honesty.', '2003-06-16 14:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(326678, 24771, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of flower shots in general, but I DO like them when they''re well done!  And this is indeed well done.  I love the blue gradient in the background, and the softness of the light on the flowers.  I can almost feel them.  - 9</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of flower shots in general, but I DO like them when they''re well done!  And this is indeed well done.  I love the blue gradient in the background, and the softness of the light on the flowers.  I can almost feel them.  - 9', '2003-06-16 14:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326679, 24657, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid this is a little too busy for my tastes.  It would have been nice to see her with a little less-busy background.  Hope you didn''t fry your camera in the rain!  :)</td>', 'I''m afraid this is a little too busy for my tastes.  It would have been nice to see her with a little less-busy background.  Hope you didn''t fry your camera in the rain!  :)', '2003-06-16 14:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(326680, 24559, 2125, '<td valign="top">awesome just awesome 1st place for sure!!!!<br/></td>', 'awesome just awesome 1st place for sure!!!!', '2003-06-16 14:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(326681, 24821, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great job -- nice use of depth of field to draw the attention to the bird, too!</td>', 'Great job -- nice use of depth of field to draw the attention to the bird, too!', '2003-06-16 14:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(326683, 24823, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice use of lines -- well done!</td>', 'Nice use of lines -- well done!', '2003-06-16 14:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(326684, 24974, 3102, '<td valign="top">I might have liked it better without the reflection, actually.  It just seems a little unnatural for a guitar to be suspended above a record, I guess...?  Was this shot upside-down, by chance?  It has a weird angle effect to it that makes me think this was shot upside-down and rotated...?</td>', 'I might have liked it better without the reflection, actually.  It just seems a little unnatural for a guitar to be suspended above a record, I guess...?  Was this shot upside-down, by chance?  It has a weird angle effect to it that makes me think this was shot upside-down and rotated...?', '2003-06-16 14:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(326686, 24917, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid it just doesn''t reach out &amp; grab me too much... it just doesn''t strike me as an interesting subject, I guess.  There''s also a distracting blob up in the upper left hand corner... not sure what that''s there for.</td>', 'I''m afraid it just doesn''t reach out & grab me too much... it just doesn''t strike me as an interesting subject, I guess.  There''s also a distracting blob up in the upper left hand corner... not sure what that''s there for.', '2003-06-16 14:14:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(326688, 24932, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great!  I love his expression -- he must have known he was being photographed!  Nice use of DOF too.</td>', 'Great!  I love his expression -- he must have known he was being photographed!  Nice use of DOF too.', '2003-06-16 14:15:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(326690, 24963, 3102, '<td valign="top">That looks like an awesome place to have a camera -- cool!  Love the iceberg, although it seems a bit blown out at the top and side.  I may have liked seeing more (or none at all) of the land. - 7</td>', 'That looks like an awesome place to have a camera -- cool!  Love the iceberg, although it seems a bit blown out at the top and side.  I may have liked seeing more (or none at all) of the land. - 7', '2003-06-16 14:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(326691, 24881, 3102, '<td valign="top">Seems just a bit *too* red for my tastes, even though that appears to be intentional.</td>', 'Seems just a bit *too* red for my tastes, even though that appears to be intentional.', '2003-06-16 14:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326692, 24734, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and great use of DOF, too!</td>', 'Nice colors and great use of DOF, too!', '2003-06-16 14:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(326693, 24606, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  My only gripe would be that she seems to blend in a little too well with the background.  It would have been cool to see her with a white outfit, or something else that would have provided more contrast with the surroundings. - 8</td>', 'Wonderful!  My only gripe would be that she seems to blend in a little too well with the background.  It would have been cool to see her with a white outfit, or something else that would have provided more contrast with the surroundings. - 8', '2003-06-16 14:17:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(326694, 24839, 3102, '<td valign="top">A neat shot.  I must admit, though, that without the title, it would have been hard to say what exactly the subject was.  That makes this just a little bit of a stretch for the challenge, in my opinion, but I still like it a lot.</td>', 'A neat shot.  I must admit, though, that without the title, it would have been hard to say what exactly the subject was.  That makes this just a little bit of a stretch for the challenge, in my opinion, but I still like it a lot.', '2003-06-16 14:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(326695, 24998, 3102, '<td valign="top">Cute kid, or at least half a cute kid :)  Nice detail of her face, and good use of DOF to bring her out.</td>', 'Cute kid, or at least half a cute kid :)  Nice detail of her face, and good use of DOF to bring her out.', '2003-06-16 14:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(326696, 24945, 3102, '<td valign="top">Looks like something that fell off a passing jet!  Or possibly this is art :)  Nice composition.</td>', 'Looks like something that fell off a passing jet!  Or possibly this is art :)  Nice composition.', '2003-06-16 14:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(326698, 25017, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great use of available lighting -- I like it!  I like the way the church rises above the scene.  Would have been interesting to see it closer up, too.</td>', 'Great use of available lighting -- I like it!  I like the way the church rises above the scene.  Would have been interesting to see it closer up, too.', '2003-06-16 14:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(326699, 24725, 3102, '<td valign="top">How funny!  The little guy sure knows how to stuff himself full -- much like I do!  Great shot -- and great DOF to emphasize his face.</td>', 'How funny!  The little guy sure knows how to stuff himself full -- much like I do!  Great shot -- and great DOF to emphasize his face.', '2003-06-16 14:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(326700, 24735, 3102, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Great shot!  I would have cropped out the ground (and head) entirely, though.</td>', 'Wow!  Great shot!  I would have cropped out the ground (and head) entirely, though.', '2003-06-16 14:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(326702, 24966, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, although the lighting seems a little harsh.</td>', 'Nice macro, although the lighting seems a little harsh.', '2003-06-16 14:21:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326703, 24840, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF to bring out the subject!</td>', 'Nice DOF to bring out the subject!', '2003-06-16 14:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(326705, 24948, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very serene scene!  I like it a lot.  The lop-sided border seems a little awkward to me, though.</td>', 'Very serene scene!  I like it a lot.  The lop-sided border seems a little awkward to me, though.', '2003-06-16 14:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(326706, 24880, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great lines -- fun shot!</td>', 'Great lines -- fun shot!', '2003-06-16 14:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(326707, 24798, 3102, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have any idea what the sun looks like!  It hasn''t been sunny much in our neck of the woods lately...!  Thanks for reminding me what it looks like.  Nice work on a tricky exposure.</td>', 'I wouldn''t have any idea what the sun looks like!  It hasn''t been sunny much in our neck of the woods lately...!  Thanks for reminding me what it looks like.  Nice work on a tricky exposure.', '2003-06-16 14:23:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(326708, 24992, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice work -- I like the toning, and the lines of the steps.</td>', 'Nice work -- I like the toning, and the lines of the steps.', '2003-06-16 14:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(326710, 24776, 3102, '<td valign="top">I may have liked it slightly sharper, but it''s a nicely done image!</td>', 'I may have liked it slightly sharper, but it''s a nicely done image!', '2003-06-16 14:24:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(326711, 24949, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice capture!  It''s not all that easy to get a good shot in fog.</td>', 'Nice capture!  It''s not all that easy to get a good shot in fog.', '2003-06-16 14:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(326714, 24985, 3102, '<td valign="top">That''s cool!  I like the angle, and you did a great job of keeping the whole thing in perfect focus.  Well done!</td>', 'That''s cool!  I like the angle, and you did a great job of keeping the whole thing in perfect focus.  Well done!', '2003-06-16 14:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(326715, 24647, 3102, '<td valign="top">Gotta be honest... this doesn''t grab me.  I''m not entirely sure what I''m looking at, I guess.  It''s just not a very compelling subject, I suppose.</td>', 'Gotta be honest... this doesn''t grab me.  I''m not entirely sure what I''m looking at, I guess.  It''s just not a very compelling subject, I suppose.', '2003-06-16 14:26:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(326716, 24412, 3102, '<td valign="top">Would have been great had it been in sharper focus!</td>', 'Would have been great had it been in sharper focus!', '2003-06-16 14:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(326717, 24991, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice composition -- do you really play with $1 coins...?  :)</td>', 'Nice composition -- do you really play with $1 coins...?  :)', '2003-06-16 14:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(326718, 24761, 3102, '<td valign="top">I might have saved this gem for the black on black competition -- great work!</td>', 'I might have saved this gem for the black on black competition -- great work!', '2003-06-16 14:27:49.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(326719, 24951, 3102, '<td valign="top">It''s a technically ok shot... just doesn''t strike me as a compelling subject.</td>', 'It''s a technically ok shot... just doesn''t strike me as a compelling subject.', '2003-06-16 14:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326720, 25013, 3102, '<td valign="top">You must have worked hard to get the DOF just right on that one... nicely done!</td>', 'You must have worked hard to get the DOF just right on that one... nicely done!', '2003-06-16 14:28:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(326721, 24915, 3102, '<td valign="top">Good job of capturing her at a decisive moment.  You also did a nice job of "giving her room" to move through the shot.  Nice work!</td>', 'Good job of capturing her at a decisive moment.  You also did a nice job of "giving her room" to move through the shot.  Nice work!', '2003-06-16 14:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(326722, 24592, 3102, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear creepy music, as though she''s the subject of a film and a creature is about to pop out of the woods :)  Nice crisp B&amp;W here... well done!</td>', 'I can almost hear creepy music, as though she''s the subject of a film and a creature is about to pop out of the woods :)  Nice crisp B&W here... well done!', '2003-06-16 14:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(326724, 24918, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  She''s in perfect focus -- that''s great.  Nice use of DOF to bring her out.</td>', 'Very cute!  She''s in perfect focus -- that''s great.  Nice use of DOF to bring her out.', '2003-06-16 14:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(326725, 24956, 3102, '<td valign="top">Could have been a good candidate for the black/black challenge too!  Nice &amp; crisp and simple.</td>', 'Could have been a good candidate for the black/black challenge too!  Nice & crisp and simple.', '2003-06-16 14:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(326726, 24996, 3102, '<td valign="top">Great job with the lighting -- that must have taken some work!</td>', 'Great job with the lighting -- that must have taken some work!', '2003-06-16 14:31:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(326727, 24904, 3102, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but not the most compellingly interesting subject, I''m afraid.  The lighting seems a little harsh on the front of the bottle, too...</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but not the most compellingly interesting subject, I''m afraid.  The lighting seems a little harsh on the front of the bottle, too...', '2003-06-16 14:32:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(326728, 24866, 3102, '<td valign="top">A nice, crisp shot!  Good use of DOF to bring out the flower, too.</td>', 'A nice, crisp shot!  Good use of DOF to bring out the flower, too.', '2003-06-16 14:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(326730, 24961, 3102, '<td valign="top">Might have been a little stronger without so many distracting elements.  A good idea, though!</td>', 'Might have been a little stronger without so many distracting elements.  A good idea, though!', '2003-06-16 14:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(326731, 24979, 3102, '<td valign="top">Good job getting the hummingbird''s head in focus!  I might have broadened the DOF a bit to get a little bit more in focus, but this is still very well done.  Not an easy thing to capture.</td>', 'Good job getting the hummingbird''s head in focus!  I might have broadened the DOF a bit to get a little bit more in focus, but this is still very well done.  Not an easy thing to capture.', '2003-06-16 14:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326734, 24728, 3102, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot!  I can almost smell that "musty basement smell" as I look at this.  Great work.</td>', 'I like this a lot!  I can almost smell that "musty basement smell" as I look at this.  Great work.', '2003-06-16 14:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(326735, 24455, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!  Good job getting the bird in good focus while blurring out the background.</td>', 'Nice shot!  Good job getting the bird in good focus while blurring out the background.', '2003-06-16 14:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(326736, 24985, 7778, '<td valign="top">Exciting shot! Marvellous emptiness! <br/> <br/>Composition, perspective, colour and light (the fading tonality toward the distance) are so smoothly integrated. The first and overall impression, to me, is one of an ''easy, casual'' shot premissing a fair degree of skill and a very good eye.</td>', 'Exciting shot! Marvellous emptiness!  Composition, perspective, colour and light (the fading tonality toward the distance) are so smoothly integrated. The first and overall impression, to me, is one of an ''easy, casual'' shot premissing a fair degree of skill and a very good eye.', '2003-06-16 14:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(326737, 24914, 3102, '<td valign="top">Nice of him to pose for you :)  Nice composition, great colors and focus!</td>', 'Nice of him to pose for you :)  Nice composition, great colors and focus!', '2003-06-16 14:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326738, 24639, 2716, '<td valign="top">wow!  one of the best macros I''ve seen in a while.  Funny how they look like they''re smiking.  Great shot.  Jacko.  10</td>', 'wow!  one of the best macros I''ve seen in a while.  Funny how they look like they''re smiking.  Great shot.  Jacko.  10', '2003-06-16 14:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326739, 24956, 2716, '<td valign="top">Excellent tones.  The mushroom really stands out.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9</td>', 'Excellent tones.  The mushroom really stands out.  Good luck.  Jacko.  9', '2003-06-16 14:36:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(326740, 25013, 2716, '<td valign="top">Dang how did you get DOF controle like that.  Good job.  Cute bird.</td>', 'Dang how did you get DOF controle like that.  Good job.  Cute bird.', '2003-06-16 14:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(326745, 24559, 7778, '<td valign="top">Obviously a very good macro and photo, which leaves little room for criticism :-).<br/>The carefully chosen title, IMO, introduces a personal viewpoint without being explanatory in any way. Well done!</td>', 'Obviously a very good macro and photo, which leaves little room for criticism :-).The carefully chosen title, IMO, introduces a personal viewpoint without being explanatory in any way. Well done!', '2003-06-16 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(326750, 24378, 8488, '<td valign="top">Hrm. Looks fairly centered to me, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Hrm. Looks fairly centered to me, I''m afraid.', '2003-06-16 14:49:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(326751, 24913, 8488, '<td valign="top">The exposure''s kind of blown out - the whitish bits of the spoon blend into the white background. Which, now that I look at the title again, may be what you intended.</td>', 'The exposure''s kind of blown out - the whitish bits of the spoon blend into the white background. Which, now that I look at the title again, may be what you intended.', '2003-06-16 14:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(326752, 24918, 8488, '<td valign="top">The high-key exposure robs the white dress of details.</td>', 'The high-key exposure robs the white dress of details.', '2003-06-16 14:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(326754, 25014, 8488, '<td valign="top">I wish it weren''t so grainy. :-/ The contrast is nice, the lighting pretty. I actually thought of aiming down at a flight of stairs myself, though I went with a different concept. :-&gt;</td>', 'I wish it weren''t so grainy. :-/ The contrast is nice, the lighting pretty. I actually thought of aiming down at a flight of stairs myself, though I went with a different concept. :->', '2003-06-16 14:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(326755, 24359, 5982, '<td valign="top">I''M sorry, I don''t understand your point:  the topic if off-center and you submit a centered subject??  If you wish to explain, I''ll revise my scoring.</td>', 'I''M sorry, I don''t understand your point:  the topic if off-center and you submit a centered subject??  If you wish to explain, I''ll revise my scoring.', '2003-06-16 14:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326756, 24585, 8488, '<td valign="top">It''s high-key enough that the highlights on the tree and the bike seem almost to be holes cut in the picture, revealing the white sky. A very odd effect.</td>', 'It''s high-key enough that the highlights on the tree and the bike seem almost to be holes cut in the picture, revealing the white sky. A very odd effect.', '2003-06-16 14:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(326759, 24643, 5982, '<td valign="top">Difficult to know where is the off-centered subject, won''t you agree? Nice sky though!</td>', 'Difficult to know where is the off-centered subject, won''t you agree? Nice sky though!', '2003-06-16 14:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(326760, 24636, 8488, '<td valign="top">WOW. You must have an amazing lens, I can never get the moon anywhere near that big!</td>', 'WOW. You must have an amazing lens, I can never get the moon anywhere near that big!', '2003-06-16 14:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326761, 24971, 5982, '<td valign="top">IMHO the house should have been cropped out, nice idea, different.</td>', 'IMHO the house should have been cropped out, nice idea, different.', '2003-06-16 14:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(326762, 24890, 8488, '<td valign="top">I must admit a soft spot for sculpted clouds. I hope that didn''t sway my vote *too* far from what it would have been otherwise. :-&gt;</td>', 'I must admit a soft spot for sculpted clouds. I hope that didn''t sway my vote *too* far from what it would have been otherwise. :->', '2003-06-16 14:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326764, 24412, 5982, '<td valign="top">sorry but this shot is out of focus, composition would have been good otherwise.</td>', 'sorry but this shot is out of focus, composition would have been good otherwise.', '2003-06-16 14:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(326765, 24969, 8488, '<td valign="top">This would make a great jigsaw puzzle, 450-1000 pieces or so. :-&gt;</td>', 'This would make a great jigsaw puzzle, 450-1000 pieces or so. :->', '2003-06-16 14:59:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(326766, 24469, 5982, '<td valign="top">you''re right!</td>', 'you''re right!', '2003-06-16 15:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(326769, 24725, 8488, '<td valign="top">Not really off-center (or not nearly as much as some others in the competition), so I have to grade it a little lower than I would if the topic were, say, Hunger, Animals, Thrift, or Caught in the Act. In any of those this might well be a 9 or 10-point shot; focus is lovely, DOF just right for my tastes, colors varied enough not to bore, expression and pose very cute. However, as it is, 5.</td>', 'Not really off-center (or not nearly as much as some others in the competition), so I have to grade it a little lower than I would if the topic were, say, Hunger, Animals, Thrift, or Caught in the Act. In any of those this might well be a 9 or 10-point shot; focus is lovely, DOF just right for my tastes, colors varied enough not to bore, expression and pose very cute. However, as it is, 5.', '2003-06-16 15:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(326772, 24657, 8488, '<td valign="top">The shot is busy enough, and the focus still sharp past the main subject, that the eye isn\''t drawn anywhere in particular, wandering instead over the table behind the girl.</td>', 'The shot is busy enough, and the focus still sharp past the main subject, that the eye isn\''t drawn anywhere in particular, wandering instead over the table behind the girl.', '2003-06-16 15:02:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(326775, 24998, 8488, '<td valign="top">I love the shape of her lips/smile, and the wry curve of cheek in her half-grin. Good choice to blur out the background.</td>', 'I love the shape of her lips/smile, and the wry curve of cheek in her half-grin. Good choice to blur out the background.', '2003-06-16 15:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(326776, 24609, 8488, '<td valign="top">This feels very centered, though somewhat asymmetrical. Good colors and focus, but have to grade it down on theme-matching. 4.</td>', 'This feels very centered, though somewhat asymmetrical. Good colors and focus, but have to grade it down on theme-matching. 4.', '2003-06-16 15:02:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326777, 24865, 8488, '<td valign="top">It''s cockeyed, but not particularly off-center, IMHO.</td>', 'It''s cockeyed, but not particularly off-center, IMHO.', '2003-06-16 15:04:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(326779, 24780, 8488, '<td valign="top">Are you sure you didn''t mean to save this for black on black? :-&gt;</td>', 'Are you sure you didn''t mean to save this for black on black? :->', '2003-06-16 15:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(326781, 24573, 8488, '<td valign="top">It''s only very barely off-center, making it look accidental. A graphic design book I recently read had some useful things that I keep in mind for photography, too, among them, "If you''re going to be the same, be *the same*. And if you''re going to be different, be *really different*." Something that''s on the ''almost'' line between feels strange, whereas a strong push one way or the other would feel bolder, more finished.</td>', 'It''s only very barely off-center, making it look accidental. A graphic design book I recently read had some useful things that I keep in mind for photography, too, among them, "If you''re going to be the same, be *the same*. And if you''re going to be different, be *really different*." Something that''s on the ''almost'' line between feels strange, whereas a strong push one way or the other would feel bolder, more finished.', '2003-06-16 15:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(326782, 24861, 8488, '<td valign="top">I like the window/door reflection in the clock.</td>', 'I like the window/door reflection in the clock.', '2003-06-16 15:06:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(326783, 24881, 8488, '<td valign="top">The exposure''s bright enough that the definition on his head is completely shot, making it hard to find somewhere to look that isn''t either the curve of his body or the slanting line with screw-holes in it, neither of which are wonderfully appealing subjects, aesthetically.</td>', 'The exposure''s bright enough that the definition on his head is completely shot, making it hard to find somewhere to look that isn''t either the curve of his body or the slanting line with screw-holes in it, neither of which are wonderfully appealing subjects, aesthetically.', '2003-06-16 15:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(326784, 25016, 8488, '<td valign="top">A little too centered to score my highest, themewise, in this particular contest.</td>', 'A little too centered to score my highest, themewise, in this particular contest.', '2003-06-16 15:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(326785, 24951, 8488, '<td valign="top">It''s very almost-centered. A bolder stance towards meeting the topic would have gotten a better score from me.</td>', 'It''s very almost-centered. A bolder stance towards meeting the topic would have gotten a better score from me.', '2003-06-16 15:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(326786, 24558, 8488, '<td valign="top">A slightly different angle, so the faucet-vertical were more like real-vertical (or perhaps so the lines on the bricks were precisely 45-degrees from our up) might have given it a more definite sort of feel, compositionally.</td>', 'A slightly different angle, so the faucet-vertical were more like real-vertical (or perhaps so the lines on the bricks were precisely 45-degrees from our up) might have given it a more definite sort of feel, compositionally.', '2003-06-16 15:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(326787, 24643, 8488, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, for all the beauty of this image, it''s very centered. The bluish divider line is very, very close to the centerline, and therefore I must mark it down somewhat on topic. 5.</td>', 'Unfortunately, for all the beauty of this image, it''s very centered. The bluish divider line is very, very close to the centerline, and therefore I must mark it down somewhat on topic. 5.', '2003-06-16 15:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(326790, 24879, 8488, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t feel very off-center to me (though it''s not Symmetrically Centered Right In The Middle). It does feel balanced, though, with about the same weight on both sides.</td>', 'It doesn''t feel very off-center to me (though it''s not Symmetrically Centered Right In The Middle). It does feel balanced, though, with about the same weight on both sides.', '2003-06-16 15:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(326791, 24997, 8488, '<td valign="top">A little too close to centered for me to give it my highest marks on theme. Yes, it''s asymmetrical, but it''s not very off-center.</td>', 'A little too close to centered for me to give it my highest marks on theme. Yes, it''s asymmetrical, but it''s not very off-center.', '2003-06-16 15:12:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(326793, 24816, 8488, '<td valign="top">It''s balanced enough to feel centered.</td>', 'It''s balanced enough to feel centered.', '2003-06-16 15:12:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(326794, 24675, 5475, '<td valign="top">Nice plumb bob!</td>', 'Nice plumb bob!', '2003-06-16 15:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(326795, 24798, 8488, '<td valign="top">The composition is symmetrical enough that it doesn''t feel all that off-center, honestly.</td>', 'The composition is symmetrical enough that it doesn''t feel all that off-center, honestly.', '2003-06-16 15:13:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(326796, 24765, 9295, '<td valign="top">First of all, you have managed to capture the romance of the ferris wheel in a very beautiful way. I love the red and amber colors against the black sky and the fact that the cars are void of passengers is interesting to me.  Look at how you captured the individual lights slong the spokes of the wheel. Your subject is so sharp and clean I can even read the numbers on the cars. As a side note, I also appreciate the creativity of your title. This is a perfect shot for this season of weekend festivals and carnivals.</td>', 'First of all, you have managed to capture the romance of the ferris wheel in a very beautiful way. I love the red and amber colors against the black sky and the fact that the cars are void of passengers is interesting to me.  Look at how you captured the individual lights slong the spokes of the wheel. Your subject is so sharp and clean I can even read the numbers on the cars. As a side note, I also appreciate the creativity of your title. This is a perfect shot for this season of weekend festivals and carnivals.', '2003-06-16 15:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(326797, 24784, 8488, '<td valign="top">This is a very centered composition. I can''t give it my highest marks for the challenge topic, I''m afraid.</td>', 'This is a very centered composition. I can''t give it my highest marks for the challenge topic, I''m afraid.', '2003-06-16 15:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(326798, 25017, 8488, '<td valign="top">The church is darn close to centered, and the circular path certainly is, so I''ll have to grade this down a bit on theme grounds. :-/</td>', 'The church is darn close to centered, and the circular path certainly is, so I''ll have to grade this down a bit on theme grounds. :-/', '2003-06-16 15:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326799, 24954, 8488, '<td valign="top">This composition is very balanced, and because of that doesn''t feel ''off-center'' to me, particularly. It''s a GORGEOUS crisp macro, beautifully lit, though.</td>', 'This composition is very balanced, and because of that doesn''t feel ''off-center'' to me, particularly. It''s a GORGEOUS crisp macro, beautifully lit, though.', '2003-06-16 15:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(326802, 24915, 8488, '<td valign="top">This shot''s subject is very centered, IMHO, so I can''t grade it quite as highly on theme as I might otherwise.</td>', 'This shot''s subject is very centered, IMHO, so I can''t grade it quite as highly on theme as I might otherwise.', '2003-06-16 15:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(326804, 24958, 8488, '<td valign="top">It feels more centered than un- to me, though I grant it is highly asymmetric.</td>', 'It feels more centered than un- to me, though I grant it is highly asymmetric.', '2003-06-16 15:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(326813, 24523, 9295, '<td valign="top">I really love this shot. I''m glad you kept it in black and white.  It wouldn''t be the same in color.  You captured your subject''s expression beautifully. It''s just so pleasant.</td>', 'I really love this shot. I''m glad you kept it in black and white.  It wouldn''t be the same in color.  You captured your subject''s expression beautifully. It''s just so pleasant.', '2003-06-16 15:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326815, 24953, 4159, '<td valign="top">Colors seem a bit washed out on this.</td>', 'Colors seem a bit washed out on this.', '2003-06-16 15:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326818, 24963, 4159, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a miniature boat.</td>', 'Almost looks like a miniature boat.', '2003-06-16 15:23:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(326822, 24772, 4159, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what your desat work is doing for this picture, it just looks odd and out of place.</td>', 'I don''t understand what your desat work is doing for this picture, it just looks odd and out of place.', '2003-06-16 15:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(326823, 24592, 9295, '<td valign="top">This thumbnail captured my attention and, although I''m not allowed to vote, I just had to let you know how wonderful I think it is.  The light is almost as much of a focal point as  your subject on the park bench.  Lighting up that whole side of the picture while leaving the left cast  in shadow really emphasizes the theme of the challenge. My only regret is I do wish the trash weren''t there. It can detracts just a little bit. But that''s a very minor issue. If I were voting, this would surely be a 9 or 10 for me.</td>', 'This thumbnail captured my attention and, although I''m not allowed to vote, I just had to let you know how wonderful I think it is.  The light is almost as much of a focal point as  your subject on the park bench.  Lighting up that whole side of the picture while leaving the left cast  in shadow really emphasizes the theme of the challenge. My only regret is I do wish the trash weren''t there. It can detracts just a little bit. But that''s a very minor issue. If I were voting, this would surely be a 9 or 10 for me.', '2003-06-16 15:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(326829, 24657, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like the way you got so much color from your subject while the rest of the  backdrop, although colorful, is much more muted.  With her red coat and bright blue umbrella, she really stands out.</td>', 'I like the way you got so much color from your subject while the rest of the  backdrop, although colorful, is much more muted.  With her red coat and bright blue umbrella, she really stands out.', '2003-06-16 15:27:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(326831, 24728, 9295, '<td valign="top">All I can say is that I like this.  A lot.</td>', 'All I can say is that I like this.  A lot.', '2003-06-16 15:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(326833, 24792, 7908, '<td valign="top">Love the lines ... such sharp transitions. It looks almost computer-generated.</td>', 'Love the lines ... such sharp transitions. It looks almost computer-generated.', '2003-06-16 15:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(326835, 24606, 7908, '<td valign="top">Great composition and excellent timing. Would like a slightly sharper focus on her though.</td>', 'Great composition and excellent timing. Would like a slightly sharper focus on her though.', '2003-06-16 15:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(326838, 24744, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is the third park bench shot I''ve seen in this challenge and I like it just as well as the other two, but for a different reason. Although similar to the others in that it is the park bench theme and you kept it in black and white, it is very different as well.  In the other picures, the bench itself was the off-center subject. In yours, you centered the bench but made the man the off-center focal point. I love this because it caused me to realize an act of human nature, that whenever we sit on a park bench, we almost always choose to sit on one side or the other, not the center.  Why is that?  To me, photography is much more than the picture--it is how you capture the essense of what you are photographing.  I like how you did that here.  Thank you for this wonderful picture. I can''t vote on this challenge, but if I could, you''d be among my highest marks.</td>', 'This is the third park bench shot I''ve seen in this challenge and I like it just as well as the other two, but for a different reason. Although similar to the others in that it is the park bench theme and you kept it in black and white, it is very different as well.  In the other picures, the bench itself was the off-center subject. In yours, you centered the bench but made the man the off-center focal point. I love this because it caused me to realize an act of human nature, that whenever we sit on a park bench, we almost always choose to sit on one side or the other, not the center.  Why is that?  To me, photography is much more than the picture--it is how you capture the essense of what you are photographing.  I like how you did that here.  Thank you for this wonderful picture. I can''t vote on this challenge, but if I could, you''d be among my highest marks.', '2003-06-16 15:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(326842, 24990, 9295, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites.  Because there is only one small patch of flowers in the garden, they feel like a continuation of her dress.  She stands out beautifully against the green of the grass.</td>', 'One of my favorites.  Because there is only one small patch of flowers in the garden, they feel like a continuation of her dress.  She stands out beautifully against the green of the grass.', '2003-06-16 15:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326844, 24905, 9295, '<td valign="top">A brighter time of day and this would not have been nearly as effective. I like it.</td>', 'A brighter time of day and this would not have been nearly as effective. I like it.', '2003-06-16 15:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326846, 24973, 3579, '<td valign="top">Great stop-motion shot. The composition shows just enough of the land to give perspective, and make me hope that he cleared whatever''s below! Love the bits of sand/rock coming away on the jump too. Good work. 9</td>', 'Great stop-motion shot. The composition shows just enough of the land to give perspective, and make me hope that he cleared whatever''s below! Love the bits of sand/rock coming away on the jump too. Good work. 9', '2003-06-16 15:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(326847, 24944, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is very artisitc and beautiful.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This is very artisitc and beautiful.  Nicely done.', '2003-06-16 15:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(326850, 24953, 9295, '<td valign="top">HAH!  I didn''t see the little bee in there at first!  I love the lighting on the flower. It really highlights the details of every feather and even the "hair" on the stem stands out against the dark background.  I think this is just lovely.</td>', 'HAH!  I didn''t see the little bee in there at first!  I love the lighting on the flower. It really highlights the details of every feather and even the "hair" on the stem stands out against the dark background.  I think this is just lovely.', '2003-06-16 15:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(326853, 24798, 9295, '<td valign="top">Simply beautiful. I''m not a photographer so I''m not the best judge of technical aspects of photography, but I appreciate the art and this is just wonderful to me.</td>', 'Simply beautiful. I''m not a photographer so I''m not the best judge of technical aspects of photography, but I appreciate the art and this is just wonderful to me.', '2003-06-16 15:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(326857, 24735, 9295, '<td valign="top">This would have made a great entry for the magazine cover!  Great action shot.  I probably would have cropped out the person''s head at the bottom or included more of them.  Having just the top of their head looks a little off, but otherwise, I like it.</td>', 'This would have made a great entry for the magazine cover!  Great action shot.  I probably would have cropped out the person''s head at the bottom or included more of them.  Having just the top of their head looks a little off, but otherwise, I like it.', '2003-06-16 15:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(326858, 24771, 9295, '<td valign="top">I very much like the contrast of colors.  The lighting on the petals is very effective, bringing out nice detail.  It is soft and beautiful.</td>', 'I very much like the contrast of colors.  The lighting on the petals is very effective, bringing out nice detail.  It is soft and beautiful.', '2003-06-16 15:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326859, 24905, 3579, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space. 7.</td>', 'Good use of negative space. 7.', '2003-06-16 15:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(326861, 24776, 9295, '<td valign="top">Very romantic.  It looks as if it could be from another century. I like the lighting and your choice of keeping it in the tan tones. Much more effective than had you gone black and white or kept it in color.  I like the feeling of softness it evokes.</td>', 'Very romantic.  It looks as if it could be from another century. I like the lighting and your choice of keeping it in the tan tones. Much more effective than had you gone black and white or kept it in color.  I like the feeling of softness it evokes.', '2003-06-16 15:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(326865, 24792, 5982, '<td valign="top">the border is so green......... your photo is probably 50% better without this border.  Sorry, MHO.  Nice pics besides.</td>', 'the border is so green......... your photo is probably 50% better without this border.  Sorry, MHO.  Nice pics besides.', '2003-06-16 15:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(326866, 24966, 7857, '<td valign="top">Ah, from the thumbnail I couldn''t tell what about the picture was off-centre, but this is nice. Good capture of the spread wing, is the harsh shadow because of the natureal sunlight or the flash? A bit more focus on the bee would have been nice but I understand that it would be hard to get. A good pic, good luck with it.</td>', 'Ah, from the thumbnail I couldn''t tell what about the picture was off-centre, but this is nice. Good capture of the spread wing, is the harsh shadow because of the natureal sunlight or the flash? A bit more focus on the bee would have been nice but I understand that it would be hard to get. A good pic, good luck with it.', '2003-06-16 15:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(326869, 24744, 7857, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, conveys a sense of being alone, nice choice, nice setting. Good luck</td>', 'A nice shot, conveys a sense of being alone, nice choice, nice setting. Good luck', '2003-06-16 16:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(326873, 24799, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, great colours. A bit more focus would be good on the forward edge, but a nice unusual subject, good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice picture, great colours. A bit more focus would be good on the forward edge, but a nice unusual subject, good luck with it.', '2003-06-16 16:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(326878, 24725, 4159, '<td valign="top">This is a remarkable picture.  He looks almost guilty to be caught in the act.  Nice catch.</td>', 'This is a remarkable picture.  He looks almost guilty to be caught in the act.  Nice catch.', '2003-06-16 16:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(326880, 24962, 7857, '<td valign="top">Whoah now this really *is* off centre, a bit too much so for my taste though, doesn''t allow me to see any more detail to that interesting structure. Nice cloudcover, good luck.</td>', 'Whoah now this really *is* off centre, a bit too much so for my taste though, doesn''t allow me to see any more detail to that interesting structure. Nice cloudcover, good luck.', '2003-06-16 16:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(326883, 24493, 1041, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower and focus.  The flash created some harsh shadows and reflections though ... could you have taken this one w/out?  While this meets the challenge (subject being off-center) I can''t really feel a reason to put it off-center other than meeting the challenge, there''s nothing to counter-balance it in the empty space.</td>', 'Beautiful flower and focus.  The flash created some harsh shadows and reflections though ... could you have taken this one w/out?  While this meets the challenge (subject being off-center) I can''t really feel a reason to put it off-center other than meeting the challenge, there''s nothing to counter-balance it in the empty space.', '2003-06-16 16:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(326884, 24866, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very nice focus, stunning rose, the off-center works here (and meets the challenge).  I like the frame.  The one thing I''d change (and it''s nitpicky and for after the challenge because it''s a DPC-illegal edit, so I won''t deduct points) is the white area in the top left corner ... I would probably match it more to the background so it doesn''t distract the user away from the rose.</td>', 'Very nice focus, stunning rose, the off-center works here (and meets the challenge).  I like the frame.  The one thing I''d change (and it''s nitpicky and for after the challenge because it''s a DPC-illegal edit, so I won''t deduct points) is the white area in the top left corner ... I would probably match it more to the background so it doesn''t distract the user away from the rose.', '2003-06-16 16:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(326886, 24918, 1041, '<td valign="top">What a cute little girl!  You snapped the photo just at the right time.  I like that she''s looking into the frame, I think that feeling would be even stronger if there was something in the bottom left hand that she was looking at.  The thing that I notice the most about this photo is the blown-out water in the background.  A crop just above the little girl''s head (and maybe a little to the left so the top doesn''t need cropping quite as much) can remove the fence and the sea and (IMHO) significantly improve the photo.  Maybe even turn it into a square format ... but regardless, the key is that you clicked the shutter just as she was standing there like that and you didn''t miss the opportunity :)</td>', 'What a cute little girl!  You snapped the photo just at the right time.  I like that she''s looking into the frame, I think that feeling would be even stronger if there was something in the bottom left hand that she was looking at.  The thing that I notice the most about this photo is the blown-out water in the background.  A crop just above the little girl''s head (and maybe a little to the left so the top doesn''t need cropping quite as much) can remove the fence and the sea and (IMHO) significantly improve the photo.  Maybe even turn it into a square format ... but regardless, the key is that you clicked the shutter just as she was standing there like that and you didn''t miss the opportunity :)', '2003-06-16 16:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326887, 24941, 9337, '<td valign="top">From the thumbnail I wasn''t quite sure what this picture was about. You''ve captured a great moment here! Reminds me of my own 2 year old.</td>', 'From the thumbnail I wasn''t quite sure what this picture was about. You''ve captured a great moment here! Reminds me of my own 2 year old.', '2003-06-16 16:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326888, 24985, 3579, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and good DOF on this shot. Really gives a speedy feeling to the shot. 10.</td>', 'Nice perspective and good DOF on this shot. Really gives a speedy feeling to the shot. 10.', '2003-06-16 16:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(326891, 24992, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, this is seating? Nice position for the bike, good lighting. Good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice picture, this is seating? Nice position for the bike, good lighting. Good luck with it.', '2003-06-16 16:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(326894, 24771, 7857, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, nice crisp focus on the flower, great choice of BG colour and nice lighting. I''m sure this will do well.</td>', 'Excellent shot, nice crisp focus on the flower, great choice of BG colour and nice lighting. I''m sure this will do well.', '2003-06-16 16:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(326898, 24880, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice unusual shot, good landscape though I''m not sure the main subject holds a lot of interest. Good job anyway and good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice unusual shot, good landscape though I''m not sure the main subject holds a lot of interest. Good job anyway and good luck with it.', '2003-06-16 16:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326899, 24677, 1041, '<td valign="top">So, how many comments are you getting about how you did your border and whether it''s legal?  I trust it''s legal, I''d be curious to find out how you did it after the challenge though.  As for the photo, it meets the challenge, great b&amp;w with nice amounts of contrast, good lighting.  Good job :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-23 08:51:31.</i></td>', 'So, how many comments are you getting about how you did your border and whether it''s legal?  I trust it''s legal, I''d be curious to find out how you did it after the challenge though.  As for the photo, it meets the challenge, great b&w with nice amounts of contrast, good lighting.  Good job :)', '2003-06-16 16:28:02.000000', '2003-06-23 09:51:31.000000', 1),
(326901, 24963, 6740, '<td valign="top">Good layout and topic. It does not jump out and grab my attention but stilll a nice photo.</td>', 'Good layout and topic. It does not jump out and grab my attention but stilll a nice photo.', '2003-06-16 16:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326902, 24962, 6740, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.</td>', 'Interesting shot.', '2003-06-16 16:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326903, 24675, 3579, '<td valign="top">Great idea. I would have preferred the plum bob being a little further down in the composition, with enough DOF to capture the whole thing in focus. I find that the top being out of focus is a little distracting. The concentric circles are somewhat hypnotic :) 7.</td>', 'Great idea. I would have preferred the plum bob being a little further down in the composition, with enough DOF to capture the whole thing in focus. I find that the top being out of focus is a little distracting. The concentric circles are somewhat hypnotic :) 7.', '2003-06-16 16:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326904, 24559, 3579, '<td valign="top">Lovely macro shot! Fabulous colours and a very able model :) 10</td>', 'Lovely macro shot! Fabulous colours and a very able model :) 10', '2003-06-16 16:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(326905, 24748, 7857, '<td valign="top">Certainly an interesting subject here. I don''t really like the BG colour to be honest... since the yellow is quite predominant I might have gone for the use of blue instead.. but then I dont know what resources you had to work with, and maybe I just like blue more. Good luck with it anyway.</td>', 'Certainly an interesting subject here. I don''t really like the BG colour to be honest... since the yellow is quite predominant I might have gone for the use of blue instead.. but then I dont know what resources you had to work with, and maybe I just like blue more. Good luck with it anyway.', '2003-06-16 16:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(326906, 24975, 1041, '<td valign="top">Just one feather ;)  Great idea, meets challenge.  Love the focus and the fact you included a vertical feather in a landscape format photo.  DOF is spot-on, really like just how smooth the background gets toward the top.  Two things that could be better are the blown out white soft bits of the feather (I know how hard that''s to control, I''ve photographed feathers myself) and - something that''s easy to control - the two out of focus longest bits of grass in front of the feather.  I like that there are some in the front, but those two tall ones are just that (IMHO), too tall and detract from the feather.</td>', 'Just one feather ;)  Great idea, meets challenge.  Love the focus and the fact you included a vertical feather in a landscape format photo.  DOF is spot-on, really like just how smooth the background gets toward the top.  Two things that could be better are the blown out white soft bits of the feather (I know how hard that''s to control, I''ve photographed feathers myself) and - something that''s easy to control - the two out of focus longest bits of grass in front of the feather.  I like that there are some in the front, but those two tall ones are just that (IMHO), too tall and detract from the feather.', '2003-06-16 16:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(326907, 24965, 6740, '<td valign="top">This photo is one that I would hang on my wall. 9</td>', 'This photo is one that I would hang on my wall. 9', '2003-06-16 16:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(326910, 24833, 1041, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge, don''t you just hate it when the weather doesn''t cooperate with those bright blue skies when you want them?  One of the ways to minimize that impact is to include less sky in the photo.  In this case especially, unless there''s something in the foreground that prevents you from doing it, I would''ve included more of the grooves in the field and less of the sky (even if it was blue) to add more texture and interest.</td>', 'Fits the challenge, don''t you just hate it when the weather doesn''t cooperate with those bright blue skies when you want them?  One of the ways to minimize that impact is to include less sky in the photo.  In this case especially, unless there''s something in the foreground that prevents you from doing it, I would''ve included more of the grooves in the field and less of the sky (even if it was blue) to add more texture and interest.', '2003-06-16 16:32:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(326911, 24966, 6740, '<td valign="top">Cut back on the big frame next time. It takes away from the photo (in my opinion).<br/>Others may disagree.</td>', 'Cut back on the big frame next time. It takes away from the photo (in my opinion).Others may disagree.', '2003-06-16 16:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(326913, 24523, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, is the main subject the man or the duck? lol, but seriously, its a nice shot, good focus and the B+W looks great. I think keeping the duck and tree in was good as it helps break up the background. Good luck with it.</td>', 'Nice shot, is the main subject the man or the duck? lol, but seriously, its a nice shot, good focus and the B+W looks great. I think keeping the duck and tree in was good as it helps break up the background. Good luck with it.', '2003-06-16 16:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(326914, 24880, 6740, '<td valign="top">Is it just me or does it seem to be over-sharpened. Like it otherwise.</td>', 'Is it just me or does it seem to be over-sharpened. Like it otherwise.', '2003-06-16 16:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(326915, 25012, 6740, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, crisp, clear.</td>', 'Cool photo, crisp, clear.', '2003-06-16 16:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(326922, 24609, 1280, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and composition.</td>', 'Excellent colors and composition.', '2003-06-16 16:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(326924, 24672, 342, '<td valign="top">is this a picture of a rose or a bug?  if it is a rose it is not off-center, if it is a bug, well then it is off center,  but i will give you a high score either way</td>', 'is this a picture of a rose or a bug?  if it is a rose it is not off-center, if it is a bug, well then it is off center,  but i will give you a high score either way', '2003-06-16 16:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(326926, 24761, 1280, '<td valign="top">Pretty little cutie pie!  Good capture too!</td>', 'Pretty little cutie pie!  Good capture too!', '2003-06-16 16:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(326927, 24861, 6740, '<td valign="top">Fits the topic but a little bland.</td>', 'Fits the topic but a little bland.', '2003-06-16 16:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(326928, 24606, 8178, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Just beautiful... I love the composition, fits the challenge perfectly. My favorite shot in the whole challenge. My only comment is that the girl seems just a little soft-focused, probably because she is moving.</td>', 'Beautiful! Just beautiful... I love the composition, fits the challenge perfectly. My favorite shot in the whole challenge. My only comment is that the girl seems just a little soft-focused, probably because she is moving.', '2003-06-16 16:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(326931, 24866, 342, '<td valign="top">this is the second rose picture i have seen, nicely focused anf composed.</td>', 'this is the second rose picture i have seen, nicely focused anf composed.', '2003-06-16 16:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(326933, 24949, 342, '<td valign="top">great shot,</td>', 'great shot,', '2003-06-16 16:40:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(326935, 24493, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love botanical images.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love botanical images.', '2003-06-16 16:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(326942, 24861, 7857, '<td valign="top">A nice idea but a bit of a bland backdrop. The blue light is nice, maybe if this was seen more on the wall itself?</td>', 'A nice idea but a bit of a bland backdrop. The blue light is nice, maybe if this was seen more on the wall itself?', '2003-06-16 16:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(326943, 24602, 1041, '<td valign="top">You meet the challenge here.  I like that you haven''t just placed your subject off-center, but added something in the remaining space that balances it and gives it context.  Now, I''m assuming you took this at a concert, so you didn''t have control over the lighting or the angle, and I know concert photography is hard (at least I pretty much consistently fail to get any decent pix, but that might just be that I''m not good at concert photography :-P  ).  Anyhow, there are a number of things that don''t appeal to me personally:  Rachelle does not seem to be quite in focus, the mike seems to be pointing at her forehead rather than her mouth, the bluish light giving her the bluish skin tone and lastly the fact that she is looking away and there''s a shadow on her eye so it almost seems like there''s no iris.  I''m sorry I don''t like your photo much, I''m sure part of it is just a matter of taste and others will appreciate the blue tint etc.  I hope I pointed out some constructive things to look out for anyhow.</td>', 'You meet the challenge here.  I like that you haven''t just placed your subject off-center, but added something in the remaining space that balances it and gives it context.  Now, I''m assuming you took this at a concert, so you didn''t have control over the lighting or the angle, and I know concert photography is hard (at least I pretty much consistently fail to get any decent pix, but that might just be that I''m not good at concert photography :-P  ).  Anyhow, there are a number of things that don''t appeal to me personally:  Rachelle does not seem to be quite in focus, the mike seems to be pointing at her forehead rather than her mouth, the bluish light giving her the bluish skin tone and lastly the fact that she is looking away and there''s a shadow on her eye so it almost seems like there''s no iris.  I''m sorry I don''t like your photo much, I''m sure part of it is just a matter of taste and others will appreciate the blue tint etc.  I hope I pointed out some constructive things to look out for anyhow.', '2003-06-16 16:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(326946, 24962, 342, '<td valign="top">the title of this photo suggest that this is a picture of the clouds, which is centered, and not the dome, which then becomes incidental in this shot, but i like this and will give you a nice score</td>', 'the title of this photo suggest that this is a picture of the clouds, which is centered, and not the dome, which then becomes incidental in this shot, but i like this and will give you a nice score', '2003-06-16 16:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(326947, 24956, 1041, '<td valign="top">Meets challenge.  Good idea that works well in b&amp;w.  I wonder how this would work with the light below the mushroom so that the shadow from the stem on the underside of the cap is not there anymore.</td>', 'Meets challenge.  Good idea that works well in b&w.  I wonder how this would work with the light below the mushroom so that the shadow from the stem on the underside of the cap is not there anymore.', '2003-06-16 16:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(326949, 25003, 342, '<td valign="top">i like this shot, especially the way the sunlight is reflected off the side of the light house.  i like the contrast and i like the composition,</td>', 'i like this shot, especially the way the sunlight is reflected off the side of the light house.  i like the contrast and i like the composition,', '2003-06-16 16:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(326950, 24985, 1041, '<td valign="top">I love the angle!  You meet the challenge and you take an everyday place and show it from a totally unusual angle.  The finish line adds great interest in the foreground and from there the eyes just wander along the converging lines through the whole photo.  Awesome.  Makes me feel I''m standing at the start and I''m ready to race.</td>', 'I love the angle!  You meet the challenge and you take an everyday place and show it from a totally unusual angle.  The finish line adds great interest in the foreground and from there the eyes just wander along the converging lines through the whole photo.  Awesome.  Makes me feel I''m standing at the start and I''m ready to race.', '2003-06-16 16:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(326951, 25017, 7857, '<td valign="top">Its a nice idea and a great view, but the church itself seems to be a pretty minimal element to the picture.</td>', 'Its a nice idea and a great view, but the church itself seems to be a pretty minimal element to the picture.', '2003-06-16 16:47:50.000000', NULL, 1),
