(326955, 24954, 342, '<td valign="top">for another .75 cents can I get my 2 cents worth  nice pic</td>', 'for another .75 cents can I get my 2 cents worth  nice pic', '2003-06-16 16:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(326957, 24784, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m assuming the eyes are the object here and therefore you meet the challenge, but, to be honest, to me, it''s the whole cat that''s the subject and it pretty much fills the picture rather than being off-center, especially if I haven''t read the title.  As for the photo itself, none of the background has any strong colors so it''s not too intrusive, but I would prefer to see a cleaner or blurry background, personally.  The white fur on Charlie''s chest is very much overexposed and overpowers the image.  Maybe use something (I often use a bedsheet) to block out / reduce the strong lightsource from the right to even out the lighting ...</td>', 'I''m assuming the eyes are the object here and therefore you meet the challenge, but, to be honest, to me, it''s the whole cat that''s the subject and it pretty much fills the picture rather than being off-center, especially if I haven''t read the title.  As for the photo itself, none of the background has any strong colors so it''s not too intrusive, but I would prefer to see a cleaner or blurry background, personally.  The white fur on Charlie''s chest is very much overexposed and overpowers the image.  Maybe use something (I often use a bedsheet) to block out / reduce the strong lightsource from the right to even out the lighting ...', '2003-06-16 16:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(326959, 24890, 342, '<td valign="top">i would have preferred to see the color version of this.  it seems too dark for my taste,</td>', 'i would have preferred to see the color version of this.  it seems too dark for my taste,', '2003-06-16 16:50:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(326961, 24933, 7613, '<td valign="top">I think I know this building, this is a great picture for the colors, it looks a little like St George UT, I was there on holiday many years ago now!!</td>', 'I think I know this building, this is a great picture for the colors, it looks a little like St George UT, I was there on holiday many years ago now!!', '2003-06-16 16:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
