(326966, 25000, 3579, '<td valign="top">Not a very flattering pose - it feels like I''m looking right up the nostrils :) Interesting use of colour and props though. The lighting, exposure, and skin tones are spot on. The loose thread on the model''s left-hand glove is a little distracting, and it would have been nice for the cross to be more evenly between the two thumbs. The devil''s in the details, as they say. 8.</td>', 'Not a very flattering pose - it feels like I''m looking right up the nostrils :) Interesting use of colour and props though. The lighting, exposure, and skin tones are spot on. The loose thread on the model''s left-hand glove is a little distracting, and it would have been nice for the cross to be more evenly between the two thumbs. The devil''s in the details, as they say. 8.', '2003-06-16 16:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
