(327122, 24954, 6349, '<td valign="top">Ah, i see, a quarter nickel!  Very clever.   The focus is really awesome, almost to the point of it being slighlty oversharp when it comes to the dust and scratches.  Great tones.</td>', 'Ah, i see, a quarter nickel!  Very clever.   The focus is really awesome, almost to the point of it being slighlty oversharp when it comes to the dust and scratches.  Great tones.', '2003-06-16 20:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(327124, 24637, 6349, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea of this shot but the execution is rather poor.  It is just too dull.  You need some color or more conrast or something to bring out the clouds.</td>', 'I really like the idea of this shot but the execution is rather poor.  It is just too dull.  You need some color or more conrast or something to bring out the clouds.', '2003-06-16 20:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(327133, 25013, 6565, '<td valign="top">Having looked at all the images now, I have to say that this is one of my favorites in this competition!  I love how the unused space is actually part of a story being told by the photo.  The DOF adds interest too, makes it look like a runway for the little bird.  Well done!</td>', 'Having looked at all the images now, I have to say that this is one of my favorites in this competition!  I love how the unused space is actually part of a story being told by the photo.  The DOF adds interest too, makes it look like a runway for the little bird.  Well done!', '2003-06-16 20:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(327135, 24395, 6565, '<td valign="top">This photo is interesting, but (whether deliberate or not), I find it difficult to get my bearings looking at it.  The background is so plain, I can''t tell if this was thrown in the air or is floating on water.  I find that unsettling.</td>', 'This photo is interesting, but (whether deliberate or not), I find it difficult to get my bearings looking at it.  The background is so plain, I can''t tell if this was thrown in the air or is floating on water.  I find that unsettling.', '2003-06-16 20:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(327137, 24672, 6565, '<td valign="top">I like this one because the rose is pretty well centered, and appears to be the subject at first, but then you see the bug second.  There''s something really active about what this photo makes your eyes do to see it all.  Nice!</td>', 'I like this one because the rose is pretty well centered, and appears to be the subject at first, but then you see the bug second.  There''s something really active about what this photo makes your eyes do to see it all.  Nice!', '2003-06-16 20:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(327138, 24609, 6565, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of color and composition!  It feels like a forest of statues the way you''ve chosen to shoot them!</td>', 'Very nice use of color and composition!  It feels like a forest of statues the way you''ve chosen to shoot them!', '2003-06-16 20:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(327140, 24776, 6565, '<td valign="top">Stunning, the way the use of duotone and light have set a mood!  Great work!</td>', 'Stunning, the way the use of duotone and light have set a mood!  Great work!', '2003-06-16 20:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(327142, 24985, 6565, '<td valign="top">Would also work for a "perspective" challenge!  Great action feeling in this photo, even without any actual action!</td>', 'Would also work for a "perspective" challenge!  Great action feeling in this photo, even without any actual action!', '2003-06-16 20:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(327145, 24965, 6565, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous journalistic shot!  I like the cropping chosen here, which makes the off-centeredness of it have meaning!</td>', 'Gorgeous journalistic shot!  I like the cropping chosen here, which makes the off-centeredness of it have meaning!', '2003-06-16 20:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(327149, 24725, 6565, '<td valign="top">Fantastic!  The DOF makes this photo all the more charming.</td>', 'Fantastic!  The DOF makes this photo all the more charming.', '2003-06-16 20:24:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(327150, 24735, 6565, '<td valign="top">The top of the person''s head at the bottom kind of ruins this photo for me, because I can tell it''s been tilted (the cloud also gives it away).  With the head cropped out, I think this would be a pretty good shot!</td>', 'The top of the person''s head at the bottom kind of ruins this photo for me, because I can tell it''s been tilted (the cloud also gives it away).  With the head cropped out, I think this would be a pretty good shot!', '2003-06-16 20:26:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(327152, 24857, 6565, '<td valign="top">The way the light bounces off this leaf really makes the image interesting.  I like the graphic feel of it.  Would get the leaf-fuzzies out of the foreground if possible, as they''re distracting.</td>', 'The way the light bounces off this leaf really makes the image interesting.  I like the graphic feel of it.  Would get the leaf-fuzzies out of the foreground if possible, as they''re distracting.', '2003-06-16 20:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(327157, 24861, 6565, '<td valign="top">I don''t really feel the off-centeredness of this subject adding anything to the photo.  Might help to get closer to the wall and shoot across the clock instead of straight at it.  As it is, this image doesn''t really say a lot, in my opinion.  Maybe because everything about it is formal except the extra white space on the left?</td>', 'I don''t really feel the off-centeredness of this subject adding anything to the photo.  Might help to get closer to the wall and shoot across the clock instead of straight at it.  As it is, this image doesn''t really say a lot, in my opinion.  Maybe because everything about it is formal except the extra white space on the left?', '2003-06-16 20:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(327162, 24998, 6565, '<td valign="top">Of all the faces this week, I found this one the most interesting.  The negative space on the left looks like a dining-room table, or something that definitely indicates "home," which the title confirms.  I like how this is cropped -- you don''t feel like you are losing anything even though it''s only half of the face.</td>', 'Of all the faces this week, I found this one the most interesting.  The negative space on the left looks like a dining-room table, or something that definitely indicates "home," which the title confirms.  I like how this is cropped -- you don''t feel like you are losing anything even though it''s only half of the face.', '2003-06-16 20:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(327171, 24969, 6388, '<td valign="top">my favourite song.  extra point for making me smile.  (great shot too - like the choice to go shallow DOF on the rocks.  might have lightened it up a bit using the gamma adjustment to add detail to the rocks.)</td>', 'my favourite song.  extra point for making me smile.  (great shot too - like the choice to go shallow DOF on the rocks.  might have lightened it up a bit using the gamma adjustment to add detail to the rocks.)', '2003-06-16 20:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
