(327394, 24999, 6388, '<td valign="top">i like the composition, but you overdid the red.  the telltale signs of oversaturation (for future reference) are seen in the banding onthe roof onthe left, and the shadows beneath the structure.  the flowers on the right are extraordinarily red as well.  I wouldn''t have desaturated the greens either...they''d have been nice for contrast.</td>', 'i like the composition, but you overdid the red.  the telltale signs of oversaturation (for future reference) are seen in the banding onthe roof onthe left, and the shadows beneath the structure.  the flowers on the right are extraordinarily red as well.  I wouldn''t have desaturated the greens either...they''d have been nice for contrast.', '2003-06-17 02:54:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(327395, 24933, 3936, '<td valign="top">The colors are fanstastic.  Beautiful shot. 10!</td>', 'The colors are fanstastic.  Beautiful shot. 10!', '2003-06-17 02:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(327396, 24890, 6388, '<td valign="top">I love B&amp;W, but somehow i think this might have been better in colour.  I see green grass and trees, a blue sky, and i think the roof of that church(?) may have  a nice tone to it as well.  seems a bit drab without it.  nice composition either way.<br/> <br/>Pedro</td>', 'I love B&W, but somehow i think this might have been better in colour.  I see green grass and trees, a blue sky, and i think the roof of that church(?) may have  a nice tone to it as well.  seems a bit drab without it.  nice composition either way. Pedro', '2003-06-17 02:57:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(327397, 24359, 6388, '<td valign="top">a little more backlighting and not so much cropping under this guy''s butt, and this is a solid 8.  love the subject, and really like the negative space above.  it''s almost like the shot needs the space for his thoughts.</td>', 'a little more backlighting and not so much cropping under this guy''s butt, and this is a solid 8.  love the subject, and really like the negative space above.  it''s almost like the shot needs the space for his thoughts.', '2003-06-17 02:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
