(327759, 24931, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice feeling of openess - and lovely cloud shapes in the sky - nice light too. The perspective shift (or whatever it''s called) on the nearest goal is a little weird, and there''s a lot of jagged stepping down the vertical to the far left. Nothing quite exciting enough to really pull me in and keep me looking longer.</td>', 'Nice feeling of openess - and lovely cloud shapes in the sky - nice light too. The perspective shift (or whatever it''s called) on the nearest goal is a little weird, and there''s a lot of jagged stepping down the vertical to the far left. Nothing quite exciting enough to really pull me in and keep me looking longer.', '2003-06-17 12:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(327762, 24799, 3087, '<td valign="top">Great colours - obvious I know but that rich blue really looks great against the green. I like the curved lines created by the main petal and the choice of shallow DOF too. I don''t like that very dark stem at the left - though the pale green ones at different horizontal angles are pretty cool.</td>', 'Great colours - obvious I know but that rich blue really looks great against the green. I like the curved lines created by the main petal and the choice of shallow DOF too. I don''t like that very dark stem at the left - though the pale green ones at different horizontal angles are pretty cool.', '2003-06-17 12:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(327764, 24765, 3087, '<td valign="top">This could have worked in ''Magazine Cover'' - lots of white space (yes I know it''s black) for text etc!<br/>I like the composition - it''s nice to see just a small study of the wheel, rather than the whole.<br/>I''d like to see the same crop but taken a second later when the carriages are higher and all three are fully in frame.<br/>Nice border choice.<br/>Kavey</td>', 'This could have worked in ''Magazine Cover'' - lots of white space (yes I know it''s black) for text etc!I like the composition - it''s nice to see just a small study of the wheel, rather than the whole.I''d like to see the same crop but taken a second later when the carriages are higher and all three are fully in frame.Nice border choice.Kavey', '2003-06-17 12:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(327808, 24765, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus for a long exposure, I guess the ride was closed for the night?  Meets the challenge.  I think I would like to see a little more (not much though) of the wheel and less negative space, but that\''s just personal preference. (6)</td>', 'Nice sharp focus for a long exposure, I guess the ride was closed for the night?  Meets the challenge.  I think I would like to see a little more (not much though) of the wheel and less negative space, but that\''s just personal preference. (6)', '2003-06-17 13:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(327809, 24823, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like how your subject takes up the whole photo but the focal point is clearly off-center.  Nice tonal range, b&amp;w is a good choice.  Would be great for a catalog or something like that.</td>', 'I like how your subject takes up the whole photo but the focal point is clearly off-center.  Nice tonal range, b&w is a good choice.  Would be great for a catalog or something like that.', '2003-06-17 13:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(327861, 24829, 7653, '<td valign="top">I dont understand how you got the sky so dark near the horizon. The image looks edited/unnatural. Other than that the colors are pretty powerful, although I think saturated a tad too much.</td>', 'I dont understand how you got the sky so dark near the horizon. The image looks edited/unnatural. Other than that the colors are pretty powerful, although I think saturated a tad too much.', '2003-06-17 14:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(327862, 24559, 7653, '<td valign="top">I think the title is the weakest part of this photo. Colors and focus are perfect. The black background seems a little cold or vacant, this picture might have done better with a more ''natural'' background (grass, other flowers and such) even if faked.</td>', 'I think the title is the weakest part of this photo. Colors and focus are perfect. The black background seems a little cold or vacant, this picture might have done better with a more ''natural'' background (grass, other flowers and such) even if faked.', '2003-06-17 14:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(327863, 24395, 7653, '<td valign="top">I like the compositino and subject, the colors, especially the water, are a little too drab for my taste.</td>', 'I like the compositino and subject, the colors, especially the water, are a little too drab for my taste.', '2003-06-17 14:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(327867, 24948, 7653, '<td valign="top">This has the potential to be a very nice picture. Good hues in the blues and greens, rule of thirds works nicecly with the placement of horizon and tree. I think this could be much improved if the bottom of the tree branches didnt touch the  grass. As it now stands the leaves of the tree melt into the grass and its hard to destinguish between the two. With a slightly lower camera placement, angling more upwards, you could obtain some separation.</td>', 'This has the potential to be a very nice picture. Good hues in the blues and greens, rule of thirds works nicecly with the placement of horizon and tree. I think this could be much improved if the bottom of the tree branches didnt touch the  grass. As it now stands the leaves of the tree melt into the grass and its hard to destinguish between the two. With a slightly lower camera placement, angling more upwards, you could obtain some separation.', '2003-06-17 14:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(327874, 24559, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super colors, great clarity, interesting subject, fantastic composition. Can this shot be improved? I doubt it. 10!</td>', 'Super colors, great clarity, interesting subject, fantastic composition. Can this shot be improved? I doubt it. 10!', '2003-06-17 14:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(327875, 24455, 6870, '<td valign="top">A bird shot that''s in focus! Nice colors and background, and the off center really helps the composition here as it implies a more natural look.</td>', 'A bird shot that''s in focus! Nice colors and background, and the off center really helps the composition here as it implies a more natural look.', '2003-06-17 14:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(327877, 24639, 6870, '<td valign="top">Grotesque and cool! Nice macro work here! Composition off center really  helps this photo! Great clarity and interesting subject!</td>', 'Grotesque and cool! Nice macro work here! Composition off center really  helps this photo! Great clarity and interesting subject!', '2003-06-17 14:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(327878, 24728, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the muted tones here, and the lighting is terrific. Since the whole photo is the subject, it might be argued that it is impossible for you to have an off center subject! but I love it! 9</td>', 'I love the muted tones here, and the lighting is terrific. Since the whole photo is the subject, it might be argued that it is impossible for you to have an off center subject! but I love it! 9', '2003-06-17 14:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(327880, 24523, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice composition; the off center works well for this photo. I love the lighting and tones, too.</td>', 'Nice composition; the off center works well for this photo. I love the lighting and tones, too.', '2003-06-17 14:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(327881, 24765, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple idea magnificently done. Very nice work. Super use of negative space here.</td>', 'Simple idea magnificently done. Very nice work. Super use of negative space here.', '2003-06-17 14:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(327882, 24736, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture! I''d prefer a different background, but the bubbles and action here are very nicely done!</td>', 'This is a great capture! I''d prefer a different background, but the bubbles and action here are very nicely done!', '2003-06-17 14:48:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(327884, 24873, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really intriguing flower. Putting it off center indeed helps this photo, making it seem more natural. I like the depth of field here.</td>', 'Really intriguing flower. Putting it off center indeed helps this photo, making it seem more natural. I like the depth of field here.', '2003-06-17 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(327886, 24657, 6870, '<td valign="top">A busy street scene; I love it. I do like  how that coat gets the focus, but I also enjoy the other things that are going on here.</td>', 'A busy street scene; I love it. I do like  how that coat gets the focus, but I also enjoy the other things that are going on here.', '2003-06-17 14:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(327888, 24944, 6870, '<td valign="top">Sexy. The off center works well here; it feels very natural, as if the model is part of the scene rather than the scene itself.</td>', 'Sexy. The off center works well here; it feels very natural, as if the model is part of the scene rather than the scene itself.', '2003-06-17 14:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(327890, 24771, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the unusual and unique composition here, which is enhanced so nicely with your wonderful lighting. Super work.</td>', 'I love the unusual and unique composition here, which is enhanced so nicely with your wonderful lighting. Super work.', '2003-06-17 14:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(327892, 24984, 6870, '<td valign="top">Both the boat and its reflection are appropriately off center. I''d still like to see more of that boat, though. Or less of it. I suppose I want you to embrace either extreme! Wonderful colors, and the clarity is simply fantastic. This is a well done image!</td>', 'Both the boat and its reflection are appropriately off center. I''d still like to see more of that boat, though. Or less of it. I suppose I want you to embrace either extreme! Wonderful colors, and the clarity is simply fantastic. This is a well done image!', '2003-06-17 14:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(327894, 24985, 6870, '<td valign="top">Your title gives the finish line the focus, but my eyes are taken down the track, so there may be some clarity problems here in terms of what your subject actually is. Still, this is such a well done photo that I hardly care if the title gives me a little nudge toward the finish line. Nice work. VERY nice work.</td>', 'Your title gives the finish line the focus, but my eyes are taken down the track, so there may be some clarity problems here in terms of what your subject actually is. Still, this is such a well done photo that I hardly care if the title gives me a little nudge toward the finish line. Nice work. VERY nice work.', '2003-06-17 14:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
