(327906, 24639, 7339, '<td valign="top">Excellent, this will be my highest scoring photo this challenge. Color sharpness and background are perfect. Great shot,  I gave it a 9.</td>', 'Excellent, this will be my highest scoring photo this challenge. Color sharpness and background are perfect. Great shot,  I gave it a 9.', '2003-06-17 15:06:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(327910, 24735, 6913, '<td valign="top">Amazing... That bit at the bottom is distracting though.</td>', 'Amazing... That bit at the bottom is distracting though.', '2003-06-17 15:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(327915, 24441, 6727, '<td valign="top">The folds and shadows in the fabric are what makes this photograph so interesting. Yes, the ladybug is the center of interest - but only initially. It leads you into the great expanse of fabric in a very effective way.</td>', 'The folds and shadows in the fabric are what makes this photograph so interesting. Yes, the ladybug is the center of interest - but only initially. It leads you into the great expanse of fabric in a very effective way.', '2003-06-17 15:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(327926, 24890, 6155, '<td valign="top"><br/>this is a familiar subject, i believe we have seen this before, still a stunning shot, b/w is lends well to the mood-8</td>', 'this is a familiar subject, i believe we have seen this before, still a stunning shot, b/w is lends well to the mood-8', '2003-06-17 15:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(327928, 24969, 6155, '<td valign="top">is the house off-centre, or the rocks? or is it a double whammy? which ever it looks good -7</td>', 'is the house off-centre, or the rocks? or is it a double whammy? which ever it looks good -7', '2003-06-17 15:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(327930, 24657, 6155, '<td valign="top">picture seems cluttered, and too busy</td>', 'picture seems cluttered, and too busy', '2003-06-17 15:22:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(327934, 24559, 6155, '<td valign="top">lovely caterpillar, and flower too, and i like the smaller flower which kind of balances it out -7</td>', 'lovely caterpillar, and flower too, and i like the smaller flower which kind of balances it out -7', '2003-06-17 15:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(327936, 24758, 6155, '<td valign="top">simple and stunning - 8</td>', 'simple and stunning - 8', '2003-06-17 15:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(327978, 24923, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple, direct, and very nice!</td>', 'Simple, direct, and very nice!', '2003-06-17 16:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(327979, 24670, 6870, '<td valign="top">By putting the rose off center, this greatly enhances the feeling that the rose is part of its environment, and this is enhanced further by the other elements in your photo. So it all comes together for me pretty well here! Nice work!</td>', 'By putting the rose off center, this greatly enhances the feeling that the rose is part of its environment, and this is enhanced further by the other elements in your photo. So it all comes together for me pretty well here! Nice work!', '2003-06-17 16:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(327981, 24890, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice tones make this image very engaging to look at. Off center cropping enhances the view that this church is a part of its environment. Nice work.</td>', 'Very nice tones make this image very engaging to look at. Off center cropping enhances the view that this church is a part of its environment. Nice work.', '2003-06-17 16:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(327982, 24911, 6870, '<td valign="top">The composition and tones work so well here. Bravo!</td>', 'The composition and tones work so well here. Bravo!', '2003-06-17 16:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(327983, 24823, 6870, '<td valign="top">Simple lines and composition and nice tones! This would make a nice advertisement!</td>', 'Simple lines and composition and nice tones! This would make a nice advertisement!', '2003-06-17 16:25:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(327984, 24821, 6870, '<td valign="top">Those curving tail feathers make this image so unique and intriguing! Nice clarity and good capture.</td>', 'Those curving tail feathers make this image so unique and intriguing! Nice clarity and good capture.', '2003-06-17 16:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(327993, 24674, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, nice focus, good choice of tones, good luck.</td>', 'Nice subject, nice focus, good choice of tones, good luck.', '2003-06-17 16:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(327994, 24890, 7857, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic sky here, excellent B+W shot, should do well. Good luck</td>', 'Nice dramatic sky here, excellent B+W shot, should do well. Good luck', '2003-06-17 16:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(327996, 24728, 7857, '<td valign="top">This is a really nice shot, the colours and lighting are great... but there it seems like there are 3 main subjects and I''m just not getting an off-centred feeling from this shot (sorry). Good luck with it all the same.</td>', 'This is a really nice shot, the colours and lighting are great... but there it seems like there are 3 main subjects and I''m just not getting an off-centred feeling from this shot (sorry). Good luck with it all the same.', '2003-06-17 16:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(328004, 24992, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones in this image and how the lines lead my eye back and forth, but always back to that bike.</td>', 'I really like the tones in this image and how the lines lead my eye back and forth, but always back to that bike.', '2003-06-17 17:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(328006, 25003, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the composition here, with the lighthouse situated in the lower right and the big empty sky space in the upper left. The lighthouse looks interesting enough on this bright day that I want to see more of it and more of its details.</td>', 'I love the composition here, with the lighthouse situated in the lower right and the big empty sky space in the upper left. The lighthouse looks interesting enough on this bright day that I want to see more of it and more of its details.', '2003-06-17 17:10:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(328009, 24725, 6870, '<td valign="top">He''s a cutey! Off center works well here, because the chipmunk seems part of an environment.</td>', 'He''s a cutey! Off center works well here, because the chipmunk seems part of an environment.', '2003-06-17 17:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(328012, 24609, 6870, '<td valign="top">INteresting plants; they contrast well with the blue sky! Lights seems just a bit harsh on them, but the red is certainly vivid!</td>', 'INteresting plants; they contrast well with the blue sky! Lights seems just a bit harsh on them, but the red is certainly vivid!', '2003-06-17 17:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(328015, 24395, 6870, '<td valign="top">A simple, direct and effective image. You use off center to its advantage here, as the life preserver can "go" beyond the frame.</td>', 'A simple, direct and effective image. You use off center to its advantage here, as the life preserver can "go" beyond the frame.', '2003-06-17 17:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(328019, 24956, 6870, '<td valign="top">The mushroom looks mysterious in this light! Put off center, it appears as part of a space rather than important in and of itself.  Nice work.</td>', 'The mushroom looks mysterious in this light! Put off center, it appears as part of a space rather than important in and of itself.  Nice work.', '2003-06-17 17:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(328025, 24998, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cute girl, so extremely off center really highlights her in her world--so I''d like to see just a bit more of it behind her (or relevant things from her world). Nice work!</td>', 'Cute girl, so extremely off center really highlights her in her world--so I''d like to see just a bit more of it behind her (or relevant things from her world). Nice work!', '2003-06-17 17:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(328054, 24765, 1717, '<td valign="top">this is a stunning photo!  the focus and colors are wonderful.  i love those two flashes of light on the ferris wheel frame. they give the photo depth.  excellent work! -10- sher</td>', 'this is a stunning photo!  the focus and colors are wonderful.  i love those two flashes of light on the ferris wheel frame. they give the photo depth.  excellent work! -10- sher', '2003-06-17 18:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(328056, 24956, 1717, '<td valign="top">great photo!  looks like something from an alien landscape in this lighting.  well done!</td>', 'great photo!  looks like something from an alien landscape in this lighting.  well done!', '2003-06-17 18:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(328057, 24455, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful work.  amazing detail and DOF.  wonderful little catch light in the bird''s eye.  good work!</td>', 'beautiful work.  amazing detail and DOF.  wonderful little catch light in the bird''s eye.  good work!', '2003-06-17 18:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(328060, 25007, 1717, '<td valign="top">wow!  beautiful!</td>', 'wow!  beautiful!', '2003-06-17 18:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(328062, 24913, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love the high key lighting here...it suits the photo very well.  great composition.  very nice work!!</td>', 'i love the high key lighting here...it suits the photo very well.  great composition.  very nice work!!', '2003-06-17 18:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(328064, 25013, 1717, '<td valign="top">love the DOF.  i wish the photo was a little larger, though.  good work!</td>', 'love the DOF.  i wish the photo was a little larger, though.  good work!', '2003-06-17 18:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(328074, 24954, 1717, '<td valign="top">whoa!!  amazing detail!!  i love the tone you chose for this  great work!! -10- sher</td>', 'whoa!!  amazing detail!!  i love the tone you chose for this  great work!! -10- sher', '2003-06-17 18:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(328075, 25018, 1717, '<td valign="top">very interesting photo.  i''m not sure what it is, but i really like it.  beautiful color and detail.  nice work!</td>', 'very interesting photo.  i''m not sure what it is, but i really like it.  beautiful color and detail.  nice work!', '2003-06-17 18:43:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(328080, 24792, 1717, '<td valign="top">i love the photo...oh, but that green border!  another color is needed, in my opinion...it totally distracts from the photo.</td>', 'i love the photo...oh, but that green border!  another color is needed, in my opinion...it totally distracts from the photo.', '2003-06-17 18:53:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(328082, 24559, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition and the colors and details are amazing!  well done!  -10- sher</td>', 'beautiful composition and the colors and details are amazing!  well done!  -10- sher', '2003-06-17 18:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(328087, 24639, 1717, '<td valign="top">eeek!  very cool shot!  i know they''re benign, but they look so menacing...well done is portraying that feeling!</td>', 'eeek!  very cool shot!  i know they''re benign, but they look so menacing...well done is portraying that feeling!', '2003-06-17 18:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(328088, 24634, 4811, '<td valign="top">Really neat photo, great mood!  Love the subdued colour, I just think the contrast is a little too low with a little too much negative space (ie crop a little more closer to rose while still maintining its off-centeredness)</td>', 'Really neat photo, great mood!  Love the subdued colour, I just think the contrast is a little too low with a little too much negative space (ie crop a little more closer to rose while still maintining its off-centeredness)', '2003-06-17 18:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(328090, 24973, 1717, '<td valign="top">great photo!  my stomach turns over just thinking about that drop.  well done!</td>', 'great photo!  my stomach turns over just thinking about that drop.  well done!', '2003-06-17 18:58:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(328092, 24879, 1717, '<td valign="top">wow!  very nice!  great color and textures and the DOF is wonderful!  good job! -9- sher</td>', 'wow!  very nice!  great color and textures and the DOF is wonderful!  good job! -9- sher', '2003-06-17 18:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(328093, 24911, 4811, '<td valign="top">Really nice landscape shot of the Millenium bidge - good range of tones and interesting angle.</td>', 'Really nice landscape shot of the Millenium bidge - good range of tones and interesting angle.', '2003-06-17 18:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(328095, 24675, 1717, '<td valign="top">great work!  i love this!</td>', 'great work!  i love this!', '2003-06-17 19:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(328098, 24905, 1717, '<td valign="top">beautiful photo!  lovely colors and it has a very peaceful feeling about it.  good work.</td>', 'beautiful photo!  lovely colors and it has a very peaceful feeling about it.  good work.', '2003-06-17 19:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(328100, 24725, 1717, '<td valign="top">too cute!  very nice photo!</td>', 'too cute!  very nice photo!', '2003-06-17 19:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(328101, 24840, 8367, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.  What kind of bug is that? Looks like a ladybug without spots.</td>', 'Nice DOF.  What kind of bug is that? Looks like a ladybug without spots.', '2003-06-17 19:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(328155, 24639, 6388, '<td valign="top">beautiful detail.  too bad about the blur in the bottom right corner.</td>', 'beautiful detail.  too bad about the blur in the bottom right corner.', '2003-06-17 20:09:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(328156, 24592, 6388, '<td valign="top">too bad we''re not allowed to burn/dodge. lowering th contrast would flatten it out too much, but the light and the woman end up a bit hot for me.  beautiful composition and staging. 7</td>', 'too bad we''re not allowed to burn/dodge. lowering th contrast would flatten it out too much, but the light and the woman end up a bit hot for me.  beautiful composition and staging. 7', '2003-06-17 20:11:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(328161, 24915, 8533, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I can''t help but see that pole as being rather phallic in that position which is off putting. Other than that, nice shot.</td>', 'I''m afraid I can''t help but see that pole as being rather phallic in that position which is off putting. Other than that, nice shot.', '2003-06-17 20:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(328164, 25017, 8533, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2003-06-17 20:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(328165, 24918, 8533, '<td valign="top">This might work better with a tighter crop to remove the poles in the background which are distracting.</td>', 'This might work better with a tighter crop to remove the poles in the background which are distracting.', '2003-06-17 20:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(328166, 24643, 8533, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t really seem to be any subject to this image.</td>', 'There doesn''t really seem to be any subject to this image.', '2003-06-17 20:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(328167, 24606, 8533, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice movement, I like this a lot.</td>', 'Nice composition, nice movement, I like this a lot.', '2003-06-17 20:44:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(328168, 24761, 8533, '<td valign="top">Although this is a very clear and interesting image it seems the black to the right is there simply to have it meet the challenge. I think the image would work better with a smaller expanse of nothing.</td>', 'Although this is a very clear and interesting image it seems the black to the right is there simply to have it meet the challenge. I think the image would work better with a smaller expanse of nothing.', '2003-06-17 20:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(328185, 24931, 6388, '<td valign="top">tremendous colour.  gamma correction would lighten up the trees on the left a bit without spoiling the contrast.</td>', 'tremendous colour.  gamma correction would lighten up the trees on the left a bit without spoiling the contrast.', '2003-06-17 21:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(328194, 24978, 5486, '<td valign="top">you see hennie pennie, i can always tell the photos  that are yours by the subjects that you choose. first mikey rene. and now this... its a good thing that he''s cute and that you are a good photog because i''d feel bad about giving you a sucky score...but then again my vote doesn''t count anyway because i am not a member. you get a 10 for being cute too!!</td>', 'you see hennie pennie, i can always tell the photos  that are yours by the subjects that you choose. first mikey rene. and now this... its a good thing that he''s cute and that you are a good photog because i''d feel bad about giving you a sucky score...but then again my vote doesn''t count anyway because i am not a member. you get a 10 for being cute too!!', '2003-06-17 21:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(328238, 24979, 4159, '<td valign="top">Very cool capture.  I might''ve cropped out a bit more on the right; there''s the added bonus with that of having a bigger submission, too.</td>', 'Very cool capture.  I might''ve cropped out a bit more on the right; there''s the added bonus with that of having a bigger submission, too.', '2003-06-17 22:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(328239, 24954, 4159, '<td valign="top">Ha!  *ahem*  Nice composition, and good detail for a macro.  I like the gradient in the top right corner - nice trick of the light.  I really wish I had the camera with a decent macro mechanism...with mine, it''s zoom in as far as possible, hold it as close as possible, and hope the autofocus can handle it.</td>', 'Ha!  *ahem*  Nice composition, and good detail for a macro.  I like the gradient in the top right corner - nice trick of the light.  I really wish I had the camera with a decent macro mechanism...with mine, it''s zoom in as far as possible, hold it as close as possible, and hope the autofocus can handle it.', '2003-06-17 22:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(328240, 24734, 7556, '<td valign="top">That''s the same butterfly I shot this past weekend...very good pose/profile, nice DOF &amp; the whites came out good too...good job...<br/>JB</td>', 'That''s the same butterfly I shot this past weekend...very good pose/profile, nice DOF & the whites came out good too...good job...JB', '2003-06-17 22:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(328242, 24857, 7556, '<td valign="top">nice shot, I like the pattern, that stuff on the edges is distracting though, that curly stuff, without that it would be super...</td>', 'nice shot, I like the pattern, that stuff on the edges is distracting though, that curly stuff, without that it would be super...', '2003-06-17 22:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(328243, 24606, 7556, '<td valign="top">Great capture! I lke the way you caught her in the air &amp; the curves really make it even more elegant...very nice...<br/>JB</td>', 'Great capture! I lke the way you caught her in the air & the curves really make it even more elegant...very nice...JB', '2003-06-17 22:33:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(328244, 24966, 7556, '<td valign="top">Nice bee shot, the pink is pretty too, nice composition...<br/>JB</td>', 'Nice bee shot, the pink is pretty too, nice composition...JB', '2003-06-17 22:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(328246, 24954, 7556, '<td valign="top">Great macro, love the composition, the curve from the left corner down to the right corner, great detail...<br/>JB</td>', 'Great macro, love the composition, the curve from the left corner down to the right corner, great detail...JB', '2003-06-17 22:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(328247, 24948, 7556, '<td valign="top">Beautiful simple shot, love the blue sky with the clouds (I love clouds) &amp; the green hills/grass/tree, great composition &amp; use of thirds...<br/>JB</td>', 'Beautiful simple shot, love the blue sky with the clouds (I love clouds) & the green hills/grass/tree, great composition & use of thirds...JB', '2003-06-17 22:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(328270, 24969, 7707, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to have seen the house in focus and the rocks blurred.</td>', 'I would have liked to have seen the house in focus and the rocks blurred.', '2003-06-18 00:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(328272, 24985, 7556, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective...</td>', 'I like the perspective...', '2003-06-18 00:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(328287, 24725, 1829, '<td valign="top">A perfect score for you.  Excellent image, one of my fav''s for the week.  Colours, dof, composition, clarity and overall image is briliant.  Excellent work and GL in this weeks challenge!!   10:)</td>', 'A perfect score for you.  Excellent image, one of my fav''s for the week.  Colours, dof, composition, clarity and overall image is briliant.  Excellent work and GL in this weeks challenge!!   10:)', '2003-06-18 00:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(328291, 24734, 1829, '<td valign="top">WOW WOW WOW unreal.  What more can I say????? 10:)</td>', 'WOW WOW WOW unreal.  What more can I say????? 10:)', '2003-06-18 00:35:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(328293, 24639, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very good DoF, color definition/lighting, and level of detail in his face.  I''ve never seen a praying mantis that close before, and hope to keep it that way - this photograph shows good enough detail to vaildate that.... nice work.</td>', 'Very good DoF, color definition/lighting, and level of detail in his face.  I''ve never seen a praying mantis that close before, and hope to keep it that way - this photograph shows good enough detail to vaildate that.... nice work.', '2003-06-18 00:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(328294, 24975, 2000, '<td valign="top">It''s off-center, but i think it could be a bit more interestingly shot.  The lighting is dramatic, feather well-detailed, but I think the light at the bottom (glare?) is a bit too bright.</td>', 'It''s off-center, but i think it could be a bit more interestingly shot.  The lighting is dramatic, feather well-detailed, but I think the light at the bottom (glare?) is a bit too bright.', '2003-06-18 00:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(328303, 24609, 1829, '<td valign="top">Excellent colours, reds, yellows, blues etc.  Composition is really good too!  Overall a nice creative image.</td>', 'Excellent colours, reds, yellows, blues etc.  Composition is really good too!  Overall a nice creative image.', '2003-06-18 00:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(328328, 24901, 656, '<td valign="top">A riot of colours.. .  Funky movements that bring to mind a jammin atmosphere.  Electric blue and electric guitars - certainly ''off center'' for the main DPC style and makes me feel more is happening to the viewer''s left.  Might have moved to keep the three lights/reflections at the top away from the subject.</td>', 'A riot of colours.. .  Funky movements that bring to mind a jammin atmosphere.  Electric blue and electric guitars - certainly ''off center'' for the main DPC style and makes me feel more is happening to the viewer''s left.  Might have moved to keep the three lights/reflections at the top away from the subject.', '2003-06-18 01:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(328332, 24734, 656, '<td valign="top">very well executed fore/mid ground macro though the background could be hugely improved by taking some more care to present a less distracting blurred result.  The brown/ white elements jar with the blue/white and brown elements in the foreground and form a distracting merger with the feelers.  Could probably be made almost seamless with some movement to bring the green leaves to cover the rear of the composition and might make for a much stronger final result.</td>', 'very well executed fore/mid ground macro though the background could be hugely improved by taking some more care to present a less distracting blurred result.  The brown/ white elements jar with the blue/white and brown elements in the foreground and form a distracting merger with the feelers.  Could probably be made almost seamless with some movement to bring the green leaves to cover the rear of the composition and might make for a much stronger final result.', '2003-06-18 01:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(328571, 24879, 2361, '<td valign="top">I like this very much and I''ll score it an 8.  However, I think having two subjects is a problem for meeting  the challenge.</td>', 'I like this very much and I''ll score it an 8.  However, I think having two subjects is a problem for meeting  the challenge.', '2003-06-18 02:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(328576, 24948, 2361, '<td valign="top">I would score this a lot higher had the horizon not cut across the tree in quite the manner it does.  Jak  6</td>', 'I would score this a lot higher had the horizon not cut across the tree in quite the manner it does.  Jak  6', '2003-06-18 02:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(329037, 24412, 6870, '<td valign="top">Subject is off center, which is  nice because as this swimmer moves, it gives him space to go in the frame, as it were. I love the color of the water, too, and the shadows made by the water. I wish the lighting were more interesting on the swimmer himself, though, and I also wish it were in focus.</td>', 'Subject is off center, which is  nice because as this swimmer moves, it gives him space to go in the frame, as it were. I love the color of the water, too, and the shadows made by the water. I wish the lighting were more interesting on the swimmer himself, though, and I also wish it were in focus.', '2003-06-18 10:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(329040, 24745, 6870, '<td valign="top">That beam of light works well for me, as does the lighting in general. I wish the chair, at least, were in focus.</td>', 'That beam of light works well for me, as does the lighting in general. I wish the chair, at least, were in focus.', '2003-06-18 10:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(329044, 24602, 6870, '<td valign="top">Looks like this was a good concert? NIce lighting on the face. The harsh shadows and highlights increase the "in the moment" feel. Too bad she''s  not quite in focus. Nice composition, too.</td>', 'Looks like this was a good concert? NIce lighting on the face. The harsh shadows and highlights increase the "in the moment" feel. Too bad she''s  not quite in focus. Nice composition, too.', '2003-06-18 10:52:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(329047, 24963, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun shot! The ice berg is certainly an incredible feature here, and the composition makes a split focus between the berg and the boat, which I find okay. The lighting is a bit harsh and uninteresting, though, and the whole would be improved just a tad at a different time of day perhaps.</td>', 'Fun shot! The ice berg is certainly an incredible feature here, and the composition makes a split focus between the berg and the boat, which I find okay. The lighting is a bit harsh and uninteresting, though, and the whole would be improved just a tad at a different time of day perhaps.', '2003-06-18 10:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(329049, 24702, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clever idea for an interesting perspective. Depth of field works well, and lighting is pretty good, too. I think that technically, this is a pretty good shot. I don''t find the subject all that engaging, though. Still, some interesting work here, and well done.</td>', 'Clever idea for an interesting perspective. Depth of field works well, and lighting is pretty good, too. I think that technically, this is a pretty good shot. I don''t find the subject all that engaging, though. Still, some interesting work here, and well done.', '2003-06-18 10:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(329053, 24508, 6870, '<td valign="top">The grid pattern works well to set off the lizard, though I wish there were just a bit more detail on the lizard itself. As a sillouette, however, it has interest.</td>', 'The grid pattern works well to set off the lizard, though I wish there were just a bit more detail on the lizard itself. As a sillouette, however, it has interest.', '2003-06-18 10:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(329056, 24637, 6870, '<td valign="top">Intriguing idea, especially the direction of the propellers! I like this shot a lot. I think it would improve with more tonal range. It all seems gray now; I''d like to see whites in the clouds and darker grays in the sky, etc. to add some more interest and drama.</td>', 'Intriguing idea, especially the direction of the propellers! I like this shot a lot. I think it would improve with more tonal range. It all seems gray now; I''d like to see whites in the clouds and darker grays in the sky, etc. to add some more interest and drama.', '2003-06-18 10:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(329064, 25013, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cute little bird! Placement works very well here, suggesting the bird can "go" somewhere in the frame, while also suggesting that this is just part of a larger picture or environment. Depth of field may be just a little narrow, as it appears its head is just out of focus.</td>', 'Cute little bird! Placement works very well here, suggesting the bird can "go" somewhere in the frame, while also suggesting that this is just part of a larger picture or environment. Depth of field may be just a little narrow, as it appears its head is just out of focus.', '2003-06-18 11:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(329072, 24958, 6870, '<td valign="top">INteresting architecture! You''ve captured the lines and shadows of this unique building quite well, though the light is somewhat harsh, blowing out your whites and causing harsh shadows in your darks. It seems that this building is almost centered, but I can see it does occupy more space to the right, though I''m sure others will complain.... Nice use of line and point of view here.</td>', 'INteresting architecture! You''ve captured the lines and shadows of this unique building quite well, though the light is somewhat harsh, blowing out your whites and causing harsh shadows in your darks. It seems that this building is almost centered, but I can see it does occupy more space to the right, though I''m sure others will complain.... Nice use of line and point of view here.', '2003-06-18 11:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(329079, 25018, 6870, '<td valign="top">Intriguing abstract. It looks like sand and something else that is somewhat transparent with cracks in it? Hmmm. I like abstracts, but this has clues that indicate that you might be communicating more, so I''m just a tad confused. Still, I enjoy the colors and textures of this photo very much, as well as its dark, brooding mood.</td>', 'Intriguing abstract. It looks like sand and something else that is somewhat transparent with cracks in it? Hmmm. I like abstracts, but this has clues that indicate that you might be communicating more, so I''m just a tad confused. Still, I enjoy the colors and textures of this photo very much, as well as its dark, brooding mood.', '2003-06-18 11:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(329185, 24950, 5313, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot!  Looks like "somewhere in England" and I think it would be a nice "calendar photo".</td>', 'Lovely shot!  Looks like "somewhere in England" and I think it would be a nice "calendar photo".', '2003-06-18 11:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
