(329640, 25003, 1135, '<td valign="top">I like this photo but it lacks clarity as though there was a haze over it. Could be the lighting or maybe levels and contrast adjustment would correct. Beautiful place either way.</td>', 'I like this photo but it lacks clarity as though there was a haze over it. Could be the lighting or maybe levels and contrast adjustment would correct. Beautiful place either way.', '2003-06-18 13:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(329673, 24734, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great capture, good off-center.  I know how darn hard butterflies are to capture, but I''ll say it anyhow ... if your background was less distracting (e.g., more evenly green) you''d score even higher with me.  Did you get a chance to move around the butterfly and see if there are nicer backgrounds?</td>', 'Great capture, good off-center.  I know how darn hard butterflies are to capture, but I''ll say it anyhow ... if your background was less distracting (e.g., more evenly green) you''d score even higher with me.  Did you get a chance to move around the butterfly and see if there are nicer backgrounds?', '2003-06-18 14:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(329675, 24958, 1041, '<td valign="top">Ok, I guess I''m not sure what your subject is.  To me, it''s the building and it''s pretty much in the middle of your photo and taking up a lot of it.  Just the fact it touches the right hand side and not the left isn''t sufficient.  As for the photo, I love the sky, the building''s pretty interesting, but overall a bit soft.  I''m also wondering what other (less obvious) angles you could''ve chosen rather than straight on.  You are probably somewhat restricted by the water ...</td>', 'Ok, I guess I''m not sure what your subject is.  To me, it''s the building and it''s pretty much in the middle of your photo and taking up a lot of it.  Just the fact it touches the right hand side and not the left isn''t sufficient.  As for the photo, I love the sky, the building''s pretty interesting, but overall a bit soft.  I''m also wondering what other (less obvious) angles you could''ve chosen rather than straight on.  You are probably somewhat restricted by the water ...', '2003-06-18 14:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(329745, 24573, 7010, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, love the contrast between the red flower and green background. The big leaves on the left and the smaller flower on the right are a bit distracting, though. The picture itself is a bit too small to see the details, and that''s a bit pity. Regards, Marco</td>', 'Nice shot, love the contrast between the red flower and green background. The big leaves on the left and the smaller flower on the right are a bit distracting, though. The picture itself is a bit too small to see the details, and that''s a bit pity. Regards, Marco', '2003-06-18 15:21:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(329772, 24772, 7010, '<td valign="top">This shot is full of contradictions, I love it!! You sure know your way with symbolism. The shot itself: composition is very strong; it completely breathes out the atmosphere of the topic. Afew elements are a bit distracting though. e.g. the reflection in the window. A tad more contrast an a bit more focus would also have served the image well imho. Overall a very good shot! Regards, Marco</td>', 'This shot is full of contradictions, I love it!! You sure know your way with symbolism. The shot itself: composition is very strong; it completely breathes out the atmosphere of the topic. Afew elements are a bit distracting though. e.g. the reflection in the window. A tad more contrast an a bit more focus would also have served the image well imho. Overall a very good shot! Regards, Marco', '2003-06-18 15:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(329781, 24508, 7010, '<td valign="top">Great capture of the moment! The background is a bit distracting. Also a bit pity of the converging lines.You could have prevented it by positioning yourself a bit lower and right. Regards, Marco</td>', 'Great capture of the moment! The background is a bit distracting. Also a bit pity of the converging lines.You could have prevented it by positioning yourself a bit lower and right. Regards, Marco', '2003-06-18 15:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(329789, 24925, 7010, '<td valign="top">Okay, let me take a wild guess: you tried to pull the attention to the floor downstairs by focusing on it, and making it, by the unusual composition the off-centered object, right? Well... I must admit that the large blurry foreground makes it a little unconfortable for me to look at the image, but certainly not less interesting. It''s a very original approach on the stairs-theme, and it gives me a ''special FX-feel''. Welldone!!</td>', 'Okay, let me take a wild guess: you tried to pull the attention to the floor downstairs by focusing on it, and making it, by the unusual composition the off-centered object, right? Well... I must admit that the large blurry foreground makes it a little unconfortable for me to look at the image, but certainly not less interesting. It''s a very original approach on the stairs-theme, and it gives me a ''special FX-feel''. Welldone!!', '2003-06-18 15:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(329820, 24672, 6597, '<td valign="top">Great the way you captured the bug and the rose is beautiful too. I like flowers and especially roses</td>', 'Great the way you captured the bug and the rose is beautiful too. I like flowers and especially roses', '2003-06-18 16:04:19.000000', NULL, 1),
