(330045, 24944, 3032, '<td valign="top">Don''t have time to vote, but this one really jumped out from the thumbnails and I just had too look at it. Not disappointed at all. Great silhouette with wonderful toning of the glass, great pose. Like it a lot, would score it a 10, make it a fav and perhaps hang it on the wall. :)</td>', 'Don''t have time to vote, but this one really jumped out from the thumbnails and I just had too look at it. Not disappointed at all. Great silhouette with wonderful toning of the glass, great pose. Like it a lot, would score it a 10, make it a fav and perhaps hang it on the wall. :)', '2003-06-18 18:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
