(330053, 25012, 5391, '<td valign="top">The absolute best bird shot I''ve ever seen.  Phenomenal.  Gorgeous saturated colors, fits the challenge well, great simple overall composition and tack sharp.  Congrats.  10</td>', 'The absolute best bird shot I''ve ever seen.  Phenomenal.  Gorgeous saturated colors, fits the challenge well, great simple overall composition and tack sharp.  Congrats.  10', '2003-06-18 18:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(330060, 24985, 5391, '<td valign="top">One of the most creative shots of this week''s challenge, I think.  Fabulous use of wide-angle to add depth to an image, and the tilt is just right to make this really catch your eye and fit in with the challenge.  Wonderful!  10</td>', 'One of the most creative shots of this week''s challenge, I think.  Fabulous use of wide-angle to add depth to an image, and the tilt is just right to make this really catch your eye and fit in with the challenge.  Wonderful!  10', '2003-06-18 18:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(330068, 24915, 5391, '<td valign="top">This is a really great shot.  Perfect exposure and tones, great sharpness, and the look of concentration on her face is wonderful.  I love where she''s placed in the frame, making for a good dynamic composition as well as meeting the challenge in every way.  Congrats.  10</td>', 'This is a really great shot.  Perfect exposure and tones, great sharpness, and the look of concentration on her face is wonderful.  I love where she''s placed in the frame, making for a good dynamic composition as well as meeting the challenge in every way.  Congrats.  10', '2003-06-18 18:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(330101, 24725, 6504, '<td valign="top">What a FANTASTIC shot!!  I have never seen a squirrel with its cheeks so full.<br/>This gets a 10, and is the winner in my book.</td>', 'What a FANTASTIC shot!!  I have never seen a squirrel with its cheeks so full.This gets a 10, and is the winner in my book.', '2003-06-18 19:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
