(330144, 24784, 6504, '<td valign="top">I would say more than slightly.  Charlie''s a beauty though.  Good shot.  I would like to see it a little bit more sharp and it would be perfect.</td>', 'I would say more than slightly.  Charlie''s a beauty though.  Good shot.  I would like to see it a little bit more sharp and it would be perfect.', '2003-06-18 19:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
