(333387, 24735, 7969, '<td valign="top">hmm, now i am sure that you knew there was a bit of dirt and persons partial head at bottom, and certainly proves to show the angle of the bike bit more.  Great capture, very clear and focused still for a moving object.</td>', 'hmm, now i am sure that you knew there was a bit of dirt and persons partial head at bottom, and certainly proves to show the angle of the bike bit more.  Great capture, very clear and focused still for a moving object.', '2003-06-20 20:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(333388, 24950, 7969, '<td valign="top">This shot appeals to me, probably cuz i am always taking shots of things through other things. I however have a hard time getting my fore and backgrounds in focus which you have done very well.  The color in the flowers somehow makes this old world feeling a little more modern and i like the contrast between the two worlds.  Very pleasing shot in my opinion.</td>', 'This shot appeals to me, probably cuz i am always taking shots of things through other things. I however have a hard time getting my fore and backgrounds in focus which you have done very well.  The color in the flowers somehow makes this old world feeling a little more modern and i like the contrast between the two worlds.  Very pleasing shot in my opinion.', '2003-06-20 20:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(333391, 25014, 7969, '<td valign="top">i think it is a bit over processed, though it seems so on purpose, adding to the effect. I like the shot, In particular the curves over the stairs and at the bottom of the stairs, very nice.</td>', 'i think it is a bit over processed, though it seems so on purpose, adding to the effect. I like the shot, In particular the curves over the stairs and at the bottom of the stairs, very nice.', '2003-06-20 20:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(333392, 25013, 4411, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love the tight DoF on this. The strip of grass in front of the bird is fantastic - looks like you''ve marked out the path it will follow. Maybe too close to the edge of frame? Dunno. I reckon it would look superb either way. 10</td>', 'I absolutely love the tight DoF on this. The strip of grass in front of the bird is fantastic - looks like you''ve marked out the path it will follow. Maybe too close to the edge of frame? Dunno. I reckon it would look superb either way. 10', '2003-06-20 20:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(333395, 24971, 7969, '<td valign="top">great capture-- i love action shots!</td>', 'great capture-- i love action shots!', '2003-06-20 20:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(333398, 24918, 7969, '<td valign="top">beautiful subject, too bad the white is over-exposed.  I would like to see the white cropped out.</td>', 'beautiful subject, too bad the white is over-exposed.  I would like to see the white cropped out.', '2003-06-20 20:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
