(333951, 24931, 7628, '<td valign="top">that is quite some green and blue.  Having the goal posts off center leads the viewer into the photo nicely.</td>', 'that is quite some green and blue.  Having the goal posts off center leads the viewer into the photo nicely.', '2003-06-21 09:41:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333953, 24977, 6155, '<td valign="top">the red backgorung is overpowering,</td>', 'the red backgorung is overpowering,', '2003-06-21 09:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(333954, 24493, 7628, '<td valign="top">your lighting really carves out the petals nicely.  I wish that just one bloom was hanging from the top right corner not the buds too.  It would be even more dramatic.  I wonder how it would look with a different background color - say green or yellow to contrast with the flower''s colors?</td>', 'your lighting really carves out the petals nicely.  I wish that just one bloom was hanging from the top right corner not the buds too.  It would be even more dramatic.  I wonder how it would look with a different background color - say green or yellow to contrast with the flower''s colors?', '2003-06-21 09:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(333956, 24606, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - the rings of stone and the girl''s figure crossing into them as she atempts flight - good use of off center - conveys action and potential.</td>', 'Nice composition - the rings of stone and the girl''s figure crossing into them as she atempts flight - good use of off center - conveys action and potential.', '2003-06-21 09:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(333959, 25003, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the solitary feeling the off center composition brings.  Fit well with the subject.  I wish I could see more of the water (at first the beach looked more like a parking lot to me)  It is also a bit dark - but it looks like it was taken as the sun was coming up or down.</td>', 'I like the solitary feeling the off center composition brings.  Fit well with the subject.  I wish I could see more of the water (at first the beach looked more like a parking lot to me)  It is also a bit dark - but it looks like it was taken as the sun was coming up or down.', '2003-06-21 09:52:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(333963, 24602, 7628, '<td valign="top">Interesting silouette.  The blue light is eerie. and not being able to see her iris adds to that. Is that a microphone - top left?  Where is she, what is she doing? Wish the image were sharper, and your intent clearer.</td>', 'Interesting silouette.  The blue light is eerie. and not being able to see her iris adds to that. Is that a microphone - top left?  Where is she, what is she doing? Wish the image were sharper, and your intent clearer.', '2003-06-21 09:58:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(333965, 25013, 7628, '<td valign="top">Baby blue jay!  The dof works so well here - the clear path in the grass where the bird is looking guides both the flying lesson and the viewers eye.  lovely.</td>', 'Baby blue jay!  The dof works so well here - the clear path in the grass where the bird is looking guides both the flying lesson and the viewers eye.  lovely.', '2003-06-21 10:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(333970, 24961, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice idea!  Good stopped motion.  You never feel quite so off center as when you are jumping from a swing:)  I like the hand against the cloud, and the climbing structure sphere  looks a little like a planet that your subject is orbitting,  but the rest of the background is distracting.  IS there another angles you could have taken the pic from to minimize the houses?  Probably not it looks like a full neighborhood.  How about at night with a flash - the building would be dark?</td>', 'Nice idea!  Good stopped motion.  You never feel quite so off center as when you are jumping from a swing:)  I like the hand against the cloud, and the climbing structure sphere  looks a little like a planet that your subject is orbitting,  but the rest of the background is distracting.  IS there another angles you could have taken the pic from to minimize the houses?  Probably not it looks like a full neighborhood.  How about at night with a flash - the building would be dark?', '2003-06-21 10:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(333972, 24395, 7628, '<td valign="top">Tossed in the air - on the way to saving someone.  Nice action - good use of off center.  Wisht the light were more compelling.  The image seems flat - A cloudy day?  A deffinite direction to the light would help the viewers sense of up and down and the action of the life saver.</td>', 'Tossed in the air - on the way to saving someone.  Nice action - good use of off center.  Wisht the light were more compelling.  The image seems flat - A cloudy day?  A deffinite direction to the light would help the viewers sense of up and down and the action of the life saver.', '2003-06-21 10:08:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333980, 24768, 7628, '<td valign="top">Novel idea - compellingly executed.  Red is a good color choice - makes you feel the frustration at the indeciferable (ouch! my spelling!) jumble of letters.  The blackness works with this too.</td>', 'Novel idea - compellingly executed.  Red is a good color choice - makes you feel the frustration at the indeciferable (ouch! my spelling!) jumble of letters.  The blackness works with this too.', '2003-06-21 10:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(333985, 24833, 7628, '<td valign="top">The barn really pops out of this misty background.  Wish it were a bit more of a traditional looking barn  - the architecture is odd to me, and the bold lettering distracts from the quiet feel of the barn and field subject.  But the barn off center, surrounded by fields and trees and sky works well for me.</td>', 'The barn really pops out of this misty background.  Wish it were a bit more of a traditional looking barn  - the architecture is odd to me, and the bold lettering distracts from the quiet feel of the barn and field subject.  But the barn off center, surrounded by fields and trees and sky works well for me.', '2003-06-21 10:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(333990, 24736, 7628, '<td valign="top">NIce to have the bubbles blown into the picture - good off center.  I like the reflection of the trees in the bubbles.  Wisht the background were either sharp , or better, really out of focus so the bubbles would show up better.</td>', 'NIce to have the bubbles blown into the picture - good off center.  I like the reflection of the trees in the bubbles.  Wisht the background were either sharp , or better, really out of focus so the bubbles would show up better.', '2003-06-21 10:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(333995, 24378, 7628, '<td valign="top">While I like the composition and choice of yellow and blue, I have a hard time understanding what this is.  And is it really off center?</td>', 'While I like the composition and choice of yellow and blue, I have a hard time understanding what this is.  And is it really off center?', '2003-06-21 10:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(333998, 24748, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun.  Lovely detail of the paint job on the larger doll.  Wish I could see more the the dolls - a whole line up as they get smaller and smaller?  Why stop at two?  The yellow background clashes a little with the gold and I wish the lighting were less flat.</td>', 'Fun.  Lovely detail of the paint job on the larger doll.  Wish I could see more the the dolls - a whole line up as they get smaller and smaller?  Why stop at two?  The yellow background clashes a little with the gold and I wish the lighting were less flat.', '2003-06-21 10:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(334003, 24962, 7628, '<td valign="top">Dramatic.  I like the contrast between the man-made, balanced architecture of the golden dome and the chaotic gray of the clouds.  Man is off-center in the world of nature?</td>', 'Dramatic.  I like the contrast between the man-made, balanced architecture of the golden dome and the chaotic gray of the clouds.  Man is off-center in the world of nature?', '2003-06-21 10:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(334005, 24673, 7628, '<td valign="top">I love structures soaring into the blue sky glowing with the dramatic low light of evening.  The details of the architectures are so distinct.  The crop a a little harsh wish I could see the spire - or at least feel my eyes had a satisfying stopping point - an obvious edge in the tower for the crop to intersect.</td>', 'I love structures soaring into the blue sky glowing with the dramatic low light of evening.  The details of the architectures are so distinct.  The crop a a little harsh wish I could see the spire - or at least feel my eyes had a satisfying stopping point - an obvious edge in the tower for the crop to intersect.', '2003-06-21 10:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(334007, 24592, 7628, '<td valign="top">The lighting and the off center composition give a feeling of loneliness and mystery to the figure on the bench.  There are from distracting elements - the garbage can, the bits of something highlighted in the darkness beyond the figure.  I might even crop from the sides and top (even crop out the light) to tighten the focus thematically.</td>', 'The lighting and the off center composition give a feeling of loneliness and mystery to the figure on the bench.  There are from distracting elements - the garbage can, the bits of something highlighted in the darkness beyond the figure.  I might even crop from the sides and top (even crop out the light) to tighten the focus thematically.', '2003-06-21 10:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(334012, 25012, 7628, '<td valign="top">Great subject , great composition, great blue sky -  OOps let me get out my thesaurus - great... terrific, wonderful...  No really I love these two - the spikes of their feathers and the points of their beaks.   The expression on their faces - contemplating that big blue sky, while remaining for the time being grounded on that block of concrete.</td>', 'Great subject , great composition, great blue sky -  OOps let me get out my thesaurus - great... terrific, wonderful...  No really I love these two - the spikes of their feathers and the points of their beaks.   The expression on their faces - contemplating that big blue sky, while remaining for the time being grounded on that block of concrete.', '2003-06-21 10:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(334017, 24952, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice,  I like it.  Would also fit in "Low Key" challenge.</td>', 'Nice,  I like it.  Would also fit in "Low Key" challenge.', '2003-06-21 11:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(334018, 24931, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautfully simple composition.   The colors play a major role here and are vibrant and rich.  Good work!</td>', 'Beautfully simple composition.   The colors play a major role here and are vibrant and rich.  Good work!', '2003-06-21 11:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(334020, 24816, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, peaceful scene.</td>', 'Beautiful, peaceful scene.', '2003-06-21 11:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(334023, 24917, 1280, '<td valign="top">We photographers need to watch the details.  Up in the left corner is a mark that adds no virtue to this image, but is distracting.  My eyes wander right to it.</td>', 'We photographers need to watch the details.  Up in the left corner is a mark that adds no virtue to this image, but is distracting.  My eyes wander right to it.', '2003-06-21 11:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(334024, 24985, 1280, '<td valign="top">Excellent job here! Your composition is superb, creating an abstract quality.  A straight-forward shot wouldn''t have been nearly as succesful.   Commendable!!!</td>', 'Excellent job here! Your composition is superb, creating an abstract quality.  A straight-forward shot wouldn''t have been nearly as succesful.   Commendable!!!', '2003-06-21 11:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(334025, 24673, 1280, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand why you cut the top of the steeple off.  The color and lighting are both good, but because of the crop it loses a lot.</td>', 'I don''t understand why you cut the top of the steeple off.  The color and lighting are both good, but because of the crop it loses a lot.', '2003-06-21 11:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334027, 25015, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and vg use of diagonals</td>', 'Nice composition and vg use of diagonals', '2003-06-21 11:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(334033, 24854, 1280, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. The boy is obviously enjoying this.  A bit too much shadow on his face.</td>', 'Great action shot. The boy is obviously enjoying this.  A bit too much shadow on his face.', '2003-06-21 12:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(334035, 24784, 1280, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwww too cute!!!</td>', 'Awwwwwww too cute!!!', '2003-06-21 12:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(334063, 24978, 4090, '<td valign="top">my wife like this photo - 9/10</td>', 'my wife like this photo - 9/10', '2003-06-21 12:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(334066, 24523, 4090, '<td valign="top">if it was sharper to me it would ne a ten ---- 8/10</td>', 'if it was sharper to me it would ne a ten ---- 8/10', '2003-06-21 12:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(334067, 24725, 4090, '<td valign="top">had no one ever feed him .... LOL - a tad sharper would have been a ten 9/10</td>', 'had no one ever feed him .... LOL - a tad sharper would have been a ten 9/10', '2003-06-21 12:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(334069, 24768, 4090, '<td valign="top">Hi I''m dyslexia and that makes a word to me ..... 10/10</td>', 'Hi I''m dyslexia and that makes a word to me ..... 10/10', '2003-06-21 12:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(334072, 24948, 4090, '<td valign="top">If you had take this photo from a lower angle is would be great .. 8/10</td>', 'If you had take this photo from a lower angle is would be great .. 8/10', '2003-06-21 12:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(334073, 24971, 4090, '<td valign="top">Bet this wasn''t the first take ... 7/10</td>', 'Bet this wasn''t the first take ... 7/10', '2003-06-21 12:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(334074, 24926, 4090, '<td valign="top">pity you could re -enter it for this weeks challange - 7/10</td>', 'pity you could re -enter it for this weeks challange - 7/10', '2003-06-21 12:58:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(334075, 24911, 4090, '<td valign="top">is this newcastle .. England .... 7/10</td>', 'is this newcastle .. England .... 7/10', '2003-06-21 13:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(334079, 24735, 4517, '<td valign="top">Good capture and i guess you`ve been told a hundred times already to crop the head out.</td>', 'Good capture and i guess you`ve been told a hundred times already to crop the head out.', '2003-06-21 13:06:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(334094, 24799, 7711, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the bottom of the petal on this one, too. The colours are very rich and lovely. :)</td>', 'I would have liked to see the bottom of the petal on this one, too. The colours are very rich and lovely. :)', '2003-06-21 13:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(334095, 24979, 7711, '<td valign="top">great shot, good colours and motion. Might also have worked as a portrait presentation with more of the branch.</td>', 'great shot, good colours and motion. Might also have worked as a portrait presentation with more of the branch.', '2003-06-21 13:29:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(334096, 25013, 7711, '<td valign="top">Great shot -- the bird has somewhere to go, but the DOF seems too shallow. You can see the strip that is in focus, and the head of the bird is outside that range.</td>', 'Great shot -- the bird has somewhere to go, but the DOF seems too shallow. You can see the strip that is in focus, and the head of the bird is outside that range.', '2003-06-21 13:34:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(334097, 24913, 7711, '<td valign="top">off centre but balanced. Well done. Like how we lose your spoon in the high key. Lovely.</td>', 'off centre but balanced. Well done. Like how we lose your spoon in the high key. Lovely.', '2003-06-21 13:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(334099, 24776, 7711, '<td valign="top">your model seems to have lovely skin. I wish you both were not so modest that she was covered up, this shot would be a wonderful monument to renaissance art and beauty. :) Kudos to you. 9</td>', 'your model seems to have lovely skin. I wish you both were not so modest that she was covered up, this shot would be a wonderful monument to renaissance art and beauty. :) Kudos to you. 9', '2003-06-21 13:38:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(334101, 24965, 7711, '<td valign="top">great use of space, and off centre with a purpose! :)</td>', 'great use of space, and off centre with a purpose! :)', '2003-06-21 13:39:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(334133, 24954, 7711, '<td valign="top">wow, amazing macro of a nickel. You can see all the nicks and scratches. I like the tones as well. I''m jealous of your lens.</td>', 'wow, amazing macro of a nickel. You can see all the nicks and scratches. I like the tones as well. I''m jealous of your lens.', '2003-06-21 14:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(334161, 24969, 2634, '<td valign="top">I do like soft focus, but i think i would have liked the rocks or the house a drop sharper to let me know which is the main subject. Photo is a touch too blue, you might want to play with adjusting the hue. Nice composition overall....</td>', 'I do like soft focus, but i think i would have liked the rocks or the house a drop sharper to let me know which is the main subject. Photo is a touch too blue, you might want to play with adjusting the hue. Nice composition overall....', '2003-06-21 14:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(334162, 24905, 2634, '<td valign="top">The framing is overpowering this photo. Otherwise, nice composition.</td>', 'The framing is overpowering this photo. Otherwise, nice composition.', '2003-06-21 14:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334164, 24997, 2634, '<td valign="top">the lighting is too harsh on the ground. It is taking away from the main subject here.</td>', 'the lighting is too harsh on the ground. It is taking away from the main subject here.', '2003-06-21 14:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(334166, 24643, 2634, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what your subject is here. Therefore i''m not sure if it''s off center:)</td>', 'I''m not sure what your subject is here. Therefore i''m not sure if it''s off center:)', '2003-06-21 14:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(334168, 24965, 2634, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Like the bit of land that you left in. Would have prefered a shorter DOF to blur the trees more, but thats just me. Your sharpness on the biker is excellent.</td>', 'Great shot. Like the bit of land that you left in. Would have prefered a shorter DOF to blur the trees more, but thats just me. Your sharpness on the biker is excellent.', '2003-06-21 14:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(334169, 25014, 2634, '<td valign="top">I like your abstract composition and your use of grain here. Most DPC''rs don''t like grain(they are sure it''s by accident) so good luck with this. It is very artistic...</td>', 'I like your abstract composition and your use of grain here. Most DPC''rs don''t like grain(they are sure it''s by accident) so good luck with this. It is very artistic...', '2003-06-21 14:43:56.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(334171, 24780, 2634, '<td valign="top">you borrowed my cat! I have a cat that looks just like yours....<br/>This photo has some pixelation problems, and is not in crisp focus...keep trying!</td>', 'you borrowed my cat! I have a cat that looks just like yours....This photo has some pixelation problems, and is not in crisp focus...keep trying!', '2003-06-21 14:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(334172, 24395, 2634, '<td valign="top">nice shot...good job on the whites.</td>', 'nice shot...good job on the whites.', '2003-06-21 14:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(334174, 24516, 2634, '<td valign="top">nice sky colors...</td>', 'nice sky colors...', '2003-06-21 14:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(334175, 24998, 2634, '<td valign="top">would have prefered this with a blank background. the blown out background is distracting to an adorable model.</td>', 'would have prefered this with a blank background. the blown out background is distracting to an adorable model.', '2003-06-21 14:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334176, 25015, 2634, '<td valign="top">lighting is too harsh here. Needed to try taking it in the early or late hours of the day</td>', 'lighting is too harsh here. Needed to try taking it in the early or late hours of the day', '2003-06-21 14:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(334180, 24944, 2634, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot! To make this perfect, rotate a touch so that the vertical line of the window is straight with the side, and clone out(after contest) that tiny something(doorknob?) on the right lower third.<br/>Idea, composition and execution are excellent!</td>', 'Very nice shot! To make this perfect, rotate a touch so that the vertical line of the window is straight with the side, and clone out(after contest) that tiny something(doorknob?) on the right lower third.Idea, composition and execution are excellent!', '2003-06-21 14:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(334183, 24879, 4090, '<td valign="top">wow .... love it 10/10 hope you scoring well</td>', 'wow .... love it 10/10 hope you scoring well', '2003-06-21 14:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(334184, 24559, 2634, '<td valign="top">nice caterpillar...though I don''t prefer the use of black as the background. Would have loved to see this against blurred green grass. Something about having a 2nd bloom there also takes away from the main focus.</td>', 'nice caterpillar...though I don''t prefer the use of black as the background. Would have loved to see this against blurred green grass. Something about having a 2nd bloom there also takes away from the main focus.', '2003-06-21 15:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(334185, 24725, 2634, '<td valign="top">cute shot...here sure looks like he is packing it away! Could be a touch stronger on the focus on his face, but I love the angle here, and the DOF!</td>', 'cute shot...here sure looks like he is packing it away! Could be a touch stronger on the focus on his face, but I love the angle here, and the DOF!', '2003-06-21 15:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(334188, 24926, 2634, '<td valign="top">nice colors, but too sharp.</td>', 'nice colors, but too sharp.', '2003-06-21 15:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(334190, 24914, 2634, '<td valign="top">a little too much sharpening here, i can see it in the sky...</td>', 'a little too much sharpening here, i can see it in the sky...', '2003-06-21 15:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334191, 25016, 2634, '<td valign="top">why do I have a feeling that this was shot by one of the bunch that met in NYC?</td>', 'why do I have a feeling that this was shot by one of the bunch that met in NYC?', '2003-06-21 15:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(334192, 24973, 2634, '<td valign="top">great action on this one!</td>', 'great action on this one!', '2003-06-21 15:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(334244, 24677, 7628, '<td valign="top">Love the tilt to the frame - good for off center.Nice B&amp;W - a good range of grays from black to white - and a great face.  Very enjoyable</td>', 'Love the tilt to the frame - good for off center.Nice B&W - a good range of grays from black to white - and a great face.  Very enjoyable', '2003-06-21 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(334246, 24984, 7628, '<td valign="top">I noticed this in the thumbnails and enjoyed it even before I noticed it is Icelandic!  I love the red and the blue and the calm of the water.  Good off-center also.  The only thing I''d do is to crop a little on the left and at the bottom  - to lose the white thing in the corner - but NOT the great reflection of the radio tower. 9</td>', 'I noticed this in the thumbnails and enjoyed it even before I noticed it is Icelandic!  I love the red and the blue and the calm of the water.  Good off-center also.  The only thing I''d do is to crop a little on the left and at the bottom  - to lose the white thing in the corner - but NOT the great reflection of the radio tower. 9', '2003-06-21 18:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(334248, 24979, 7628, '<td valign="top">congratulations for catching a lovely image of something that must have been very difficult to do!  The color on the nesk and the detail of the feathers there is marvelous.  Nice off center too - must be a crop of a larger pic?  It is pixleated - but it succeeds regardless. 8</td>', 'congratulations for catching a lovely image of something that must have been very difficult to do!  The color on the nesk and the detail of the feathers there is marvelous.  Nice off center too - must be a crop of a larger pic?  It is pixleated - but it succeeds regardless. 8', '2003-06-21 18:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(334253, 24901, 6696, '<td valign="top">This is a treat to view and interpret.  You have captured not only the motions and sounds of this musician, but what one would imagine to be the energy of the moment and the surrounding environment.  I''m impressed with the range of hues you were able to capture - this is not always easy in these settings.  The saturation and contrast really provide the subject with an aura of sorts.  The more I look at this shot, the more I understand that it is a harmonious union of vertical and horizontal lines.  The window edge, mic stand, guitar strings, and shirt stripes all playing against the horizontal window blings, guitar frets.  Wow - great job!  Oh, by the way John, I like the PBase title better.</td>', 'This is a treat to view and interpret.  You have captured not only the motions and sounds of this musician, but what one would imagine to be the energy of the moment and the surrounding environment.  I''m impressed with the range of hues you were able to capture - this is not always easy in these settings.  The saturation and contrast really provide the subject with an aura of sorts.  The more I look at this shot, the more I understand that it is a harmonious union of vertical and horizontal lines.  The window edge, mic stand, guitar strings, and shirt stripes all playing against the horizontal window blings, guitar frets.  Wow - great job!  Oh, by the way John, I like the PBase title better.', '2003-06-21 18:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(334254, 24965, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp capture of the motion.  The bit of dirt in the bottom is perfect - we can see the landing.  The trees make a great backdrop - a sense of the place but not distracting.  9</td>', 'Nice crisp capture of the motion.  The bit of dirt in the bottom is perfect - we can see the landing.  The trees make a great backdrop - a sense of the place but not distracting.  9', '2003-06-21 18:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(334285, 24606, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture! The curving lines really accentuate the lines of the dancer. Well done.</td>', 'Very nice capture! The curving lines really accentuate the lines of the dancer. Well done.', '2003-06-21 19:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(334287, 24951, 6870, '<td valign="top">I really lilke the off white flowers that add just a touch of peaceful whites to your shot. The Buddha seems to be the same tones as the tree.</td>', 'I really lilke the off white flowers that add just a touch of peaceful whites to your shot. The Buddha seems to be the same tones as the tree.', '2003-06-21 19:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(334289, 24979, 6870, '<td valign="top">These are fun little critters to capture on film. Nice work and nice cropping.</td>', 'These are fun little critters to capture on film. Nice work and nice cropping.', '2003-06-21 19:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(334290, 24759, 6870, '<td valign="top">Swell composition here, and the gentle tones are so soothing. The only distracation is that fence post on the left. Very nice work.</td>', 'Swell composition here, and the gentle tones are so soothing. The only distracation is that fence post on the left. Very nice work.', '2003-06-21 19:47:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(334292, 24978, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. The background adds interest, too.</td>', 'Nice lighting. The background adds interest, too.', '2003-06-21 19:48:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(334293, 24674, 6870, '<td valign="top">Cool subject, and the tones and clarity of this photo are very nice!</td>', 'Cool subject, and the tones and clarity of this photo are very nice!', '2003-06-21 19:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(334294, 24918, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how the white of the girl contrast with the saturated colors of the grass and flowers.</td>', 'I like how the white of the girl contrast with the saturated colors of the grass and flowers.', '2003-06-21 19:49:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(334295, 24966, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Light seems slightly harsh. Colors all go nicely together. Super composition.</td>', 'Nice capture. Light seems slightly harsh. Colors all go nicely together. Super composition.', '2003-06-21 19:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(334296, 24761, 6870, '<td valign="top">Do you mean Thai? Cute girl. The off centeredness here creates a void that suggests she is a deep person, and that this is only a part of her that you could capture. Nice work!</td>', 'Do you mean Thai? Cute girl. The off centeredness here creates a void that suggests she is a deep person, and that this is only a part of her that you could capture. Nice work!', '2003-06-21 19:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(334297, 25000, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure of the significance of the title, but this is a dramatic, engaging photograph. Her pose seems appropriate for her garb, and reveals her in an odd way. Nice work!</td>', 'I''m not sure of the significance of the title, but this is a dramatic, engaging photograph. Her pose seems appropriate for her garb, and reveals her in an odd way. Nice work!', '2003-06-21 19:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(334299, 24558, 6870, '<td valign="top">You bring life and interest to this every day object by putting it off center, but also by tilting the frame. Nice work.</td>', 'You bring life and interest to this every day object by putting it off center, but also by tilting the frame. Nice work.', '2003-06-21 19:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(334300, 24953, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition. It''s as if the flower were opening to something on the left, though we don''t know what it is. Light is just a tad harsh, but please feel pleased with this nice shot.</td>', 'Wonderful composition. It''s as if the flower were opening to something on the left, though we don''t know what it is. Light is just a tad harsh, but please feel pleased with this nice shot.', '2003-06-21 19:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(334301, 24776, 6870, '<td valign="top">Super composition. The quiet tones and architectural hints are suberbly minimalistic. Her pose is also fantastic. 10</td>', 'Super composition. The quiet tones and architectural hints are suberbly minimalistic. Her pose is also fantastic. 10', '2003-06-21 19:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(334305, 24677, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing/border here. The off centeredness here suggests that this guy--you--has more to him than the photograph could portray, so you''ve created a negative space. Does that make sense? Well, nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting framing/border here. The off centeredness here suggests that this guy--you--has more to him than the photograph could portray, so you''ve created a negative space. Does that make sense? Well, nice shot.', '2003-06-21 19:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(334306, 24962, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wow is that dome off center! I like the drastic, exaggerated composition. It sure makes the sky take the stage! The clouds are quite grainy, though. This happens to me when I fiddle with it too much in Photoshop! Nice work.</td>', 'Wow is that dome off center! I like the drastic, exaggerated composition. It sure makes the sky take the stage! The clouds are quite grainy, though. This happens to me when I fiddle with it too much in Photoshop! Nice work.', '2003-06-21 19:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(334309, 24917, 6870, '<td valign="top">The use of off center here suggests that your communication goes beyond this glass and this phemonenon, so you''ve used it to your advantage here. I''m not so sure about the split background, though; the two colors don''t seem to enhance anything you''re trying to get at here.</td>', 'The use of off center here suggests that your communication goes beyond this glass and this phemonenon, so you''ve used it to your advantage here. I''m not so sure about the split background, though; the two colors don''t seem to enhance anything you''re trying to get at here.', '2003-06-21 20:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(334310, 24910, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot! Off center seems natural here because of the perfect point of view you''ve chosen.</td>', 'Very cool shot! Off center seems natural here because of the perfect point of view you''ve chosen.', '2003-06-21 20:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(334375, 24998, 1280, '<td valign="top">Isn''t she cute!</td>', 'Isn''t she cute!', '2003-06-21 20:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(334377, 24725, 9542, '<td valign="top">I love squirels, and such :)  Today I had one try to pickup 3 peanuts at once...very funny but this is great.</td>', 'I love squirels, and such :)  Today I had one try to pickup 3 peanuts at once...very funny but this is great.', '2003-06-21 20:42:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(334384, 24840, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this very much.  It''s a nice, simple composition with beautiful soft colors. The focus is a bit soft, especially on the ladybug.  The other thing is the top of the weed is cut off.  If you had gone up a bit higher you could have (maybe) gotten the top in the frame, and the lady bug would (maybe)  be in the lower third.  Just something to consider.  <br/>Overall I like this!  :-)</td>', 'I like this very much.  It''s a nice, simple composition with beautiful soft colors. The focus is a bit soft, especially on the ladybug.  The other thing is the top of the weed is cut off.  If you had gone up a bit higher you could have (maybe) gotten the top in the frame, and the lady bug would (maybe)  be in the lower third.  Just something to consider.  Overall I like this!  :-)', '2003-06-21 21:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(334389, 24674, 1280, '<td valign="top">Cute and well photographed.</td>', 'Cute and well photographed.', '2003-06-21 21:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(334391, 25007, 1280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2003-06-21 21:38:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(334394, 24792, 7190, '<td valign="top">very intresting sculpture and strong graphic but that green frame takes away and distracts from the bold statement od the piece.</td>', 'very intresting sculpture and strong graphic but that green frame takes away and distracts from the bold statement od the piece.', '2003-06-21 21:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(334400, 24880, 1280, '<td valign="top">Yep...hay now while the sun is shining!  Been there before!  You captured the wonderful patterns and colors.</td>', 'Yep...hay now while the sun is shining!  Been there before!  You captured the wonderful patterns and colors.', '2003-06-21 22:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(334402, 24728, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice still life.</td>', 'Very nice still life.', '2003-06-21 22:02:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(334407, 24969, 1280, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful!  The rocks really make this stand out, and the wilderness feel of isolation.  So nice! I''d like to see this cropped from the bottom up to around the bottom of the first rock in from our left. That would place the structure that much further down from the horizontal center.   But it is really just fine as it is.  Great picture.  Good job!  Is this Iceland?</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful!  The rocks really make this stand out, and the wilderness feel of isolation.  So nice! I''d like to see this cropped from the bottom up to around the bottom of the first rock in from our left. That would place the structure that much further down from the horizontal center.   But it is really just fine as it is.  Great picture.  Good job!  Is this Iceland?', '2003-06-21 22:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(334412, 24455, 1280, '<td valign="top">Awww this is so sweet.  I love birds, and animals, and all manner of wildlife.  Birds contribute so much to this world that we share.  This is just beautiful!  So well focused and the texture is fine.  Keep up the great work!  10</td>', 'Awww this is so sweet.  I love birds, and animals, and all manner of wildlife.  Birds contribute so much to this world that we share.  This is just beautiful!  So well focused and the texture is fine.  Keep up the great work!  10', '2003-06-21 22:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(334413, 24523, 1280, '<td valign="top">Nice, simple, effective.</td>', 'Nice, simple, effective.', '2003-06-21 22:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(334414, 24932, 1280, '<td valign="top">Geeee this is beautiful!  Toucans always remind me of my Dad, who died 6 years ago.  He used to tell us that he carved his initials into the beak of one at the Bronx Zoo.  For years we believed him,  when we were children.<br/>You captured a nice, curious expression.  Your dof is good too.  Nice work.</td>', 'Geeee this is beautiful!  Toucans always remind me of my Dad, who died 6 years ago.  He used to tell us that he carved his initials into the beak of one at the Bronx Zoo.  For years we believed him,  when we were children.You captured a nice, curious expression.  Your dof is good too.  Nice work.', '2003-06-21 22:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(334417, 24905, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is wonderfully soft-colored.  The simple composition is terrific.</td>', 'This is wonderfully soft-colored.  The simple composition is terrific.', '2003-06-21 22:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(334420, 24602, 1280, '<td valign="top">Definetely a bazaar look to it.  I\''m sure that\''s what you were going for, and in that sense it\''s successful.  I don''t personally find it appealing because the blue color is very cool, even cold.  I like to associate warmth with people,  and the blue seems to say "Stand back, don''t touch me."   Just my opinion of course, but I appreciate when people critique my art so I know how it affects others.  I hope you''ll understand.</td>', 'Definetely a bazaar look to it.  I\''m sure that\''s what you were going for, and in that sense it\''s successful.  I don''t personally find it appealing because the blue color is very cool, even cold.  I like to associate warmth with people,  and the blue seems to say "Stand back, don''t touch me."   Just my opinion of course, but I appreciate when people critique my art so I know how it affects others.  I hope you''ll understand.', '2003-06-21 22:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(334424, 24675, 1280, '<td valign="top">Sharp, clear image. Good job.</td>', 'Sharp, clear image. Good job.', '2003-06-21 22:57:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(334430, 24559, 1280, '<td valign="top">Wow!  The colors are magnificent!   Good texture and Good choice of bg. 10</td>', 'Wow!  The colors are magnificent!   Good texture and Good choice of bg. 10', '2003-06-21 23:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(334433, 24725, 1280, '<td valign="top">This is so cute!  I had gotten some video footage of an Eastern Chipmunk stuffing his cheeks with bird food.  His/her cheeks became much wider than his body!  I loved every minute of it, probably more than he did.  I really love them.  Florida supposedly has them, but I have never seen one here.   One of the things I miss about upstate New York.<br/>You captured this beautifully.  You must have gotten down pretty low to get this perspective.  Good job!  Well composed and exposed, and perfect saturation.  10</td>', 'This is so cute!  I had gotten some video footage of an Eastern Chipmunk stuffing his cheeks with bird food.  His/her cheeks became much wider than his body!  I loved every minute of it, probably more than he did.  I really love them.  Florida supposedly has them, but I have never seen one here.   One of the things I miss about upstate New York.You captured this beautifully.  You must have gotten down pretty low to get this perspective.  Good job!  Well composed and exposed, and perfect saturation.  10', '2003-06-21 23:15:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(334477, 24840, 3287, '<td valign="top">Color and lighting are very nice, the background is a little distracting-9</td>', 'Color and lighting are very nice, the background is a little distracting-9', '2003-06-22 00:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
