(334641, 24963, 3084, '<td valign="top">Great shot, it reminds me of the entrance to St. John''s Harbour in Newfoundland from up on the bluffs at Cape Spear.  Love the bergy-bit (or growler, if you prefer) 9  Morgan</td>', 'Great shot, it reminds me of the entrance to St. John''s Harbour in Newfoundland from up on the bluffs at Cape Spear.  Love the bergy-bit (or growler, if you prefer) 9  Morgan', '2003-06-22 09:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(334643, 24675, 3084, '<td valign="top">Your image really appeals to me.  I like it.  Maybe it is the way my mind works, but it is wonderful.  Great lighting, positioning, and drama.  9  Morgan</td>', 'Your image really appeals to me.  I like it.  Maybe it is the way my mind works, but it is wonderful.  Great lighting, positioning, and drama.  9  Morgan', '2003-06-22 09:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(334658, 24890, 7628, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite. The glow of the church (the church has both the whitest white and blackest black in the picture - nice) brings your eye right to it, The simplicity of the surroundings frames it perfectly - the soft grass, the billowing clouds all in a nice range of grays- are a peaceful aurasurrounding the building.  Technically everything is sharp, nice range from black to white. 10</td>', 'This is my favorite. The glow of the church (the church has both the whitest white and blackest black in the picture - nice) brings your eye right to it, The simplicity of the surroundings frames it perfectly - the soft grass, the billowing clouds all in a nice range of grays- are a peaceful aurasurrounding the building.  Technically everything is sharp, nice range from black to white. 10', '2003-06-22 09:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(334663, 24829, 7628, '<td valign="top">I thought I had seen my favorite of the challenge and then this!  The bold yellow of the sign against the dark blue clouds.  Not only is the sign off center - it directs the viewer off the road that is leading to the dark horizon - diverting the eye to the bright sky above.  The photo makes us off center by looking at it.  I love the golden light, the dramatic contrasts.  Everything works here! 10</td>', 'I thought I had seen my favorite of the challenge and then this!  The bold yellow of the sign against the dark blue clouds.  Not only is the sign off center - it directs the viewer off the road that is leading to the dark horizon - diverting the eye to the bright sky above.  The photo makes us off center by looking at it.  I love the golden light, the dramatic contrasts.  Everything works here! 10', '2003-06-22 09:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(334672, 24637, 3540, '<td valign="top">Interesting illusion.  I think the framing could''ve been better to not have so much dead area at the top of the frame.  Not a lot either... I think trimming this to 1.5:1 aspect would''ve done the job.  The focus could''ve been just a little better.  The greyscale is interesting.  Great idea.</td>', 'Interesting illusion.  I think the framing could''ve been better to not have so much dead area at the top of the frame.  Not a lot either... I think trimming this to 1.5:1 aspect would''ve done the job.  The focus could''ve been just a little better.  The greyscale is interesting.  Great idea.', '2003-06-22 09:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(334675, 24798, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great sky color.  Hate the sunflares.  Nothing personal, just never liked them.  I don''t like the way the trees have the little highlight sparkles on them.  Makes them look plastic.  I do however think the framing is very good with the trees on the corners and the clouds on one side.  I like the asymmetry to this pic.  Good work</td>', 'Great sky color.  Hate the sunflares.  Nothing personal, just never liked them.  I don''t like the way the trees have the little highlight sparkles on them.  Makes them look plastic.  I do however think the framing is very good with the trees on the corners and the clouds on one side.  I like the asymmetry to this pic.  Good work', '2003-06-22 09:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(334677, 24734, 3540, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have put this guys head dead center in the middle of the frame for this challenge, but I''m not going to count that against you.  Nice detail in the butterfly.  If this wasn''t the off-center challenge, I''d have cut some of the leaf off.   DOF is just a little too shallow for this pic.  Needs just a little more to bring the back wing into semifocus.   Overall nice pic</td>', 'I wouldn''t have put this guys head dead center in the middle of the frame for this challenge, but I''m not going to count that against you.  Nice detail in the butterfly.  If this wasn''t the off-center challenge, I''d have cut some of the leaf off.   DOF is just a little too shallow for this pic.  Needs just a little more to bring the back wing into semifocus.   Overall nice pic', '2003-06-22 09:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(334680, 24759, 3540, '<td valign="top">compositionally I''d say this would''ve been more successful with more "heads" than "tails"  Good exposure and nice colors.  I''d have cut out any sky on this one since it isn''t a very appealing color, not being blue at all.</td>', 'compositionally I''d say this would''ve been more successful with more "heads" than "tails"  Good exposure and nice colors.  I''d have cut out any sky on this one since it isn''t a very appealing color, not being blue at all.', '2003-06-22 09:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(334681, 24979, 3540, '<td valign="top">This was a valiant effort.  I don''t think it worked out as well as you hoped though.  The focus is pretty soft.  The subject looks oversharpened and the whole pic looks oversaturated.  I''m seeing pixelation in the greens on the bottom Left corner.  I really wish this would''ve worked out a little better for you.</td>', 'This was a valiant effort.  I don''t think it worked out as well as you hoped though.  The focus is pretty soft.  The subject looks oversharpened and the whole pic looks oversaturated.  I''m seeing pixelation in the greens on the bottom Left corner.  I really wish this would''ve worked out a little better for you.', '2003-06-22 09:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(334684, 24508, 3540, '<td valign="top">Something needs to be in focus in this picture.  I would venture to say that it should be the lizard.</td>', 'Something needs to be in focus in this picture.  I would venture to say that it should be the lizard.', '2003-06-22 09:49:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(334685, 24933, 3540, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Love the building.  Great color, love the sky on this one.  Well framed too.  Looks oversharpened though is my only problem with this one.</td>', 'Great composition.  Love the building.  Great color, love the sky on this one.  Well framed too.  Looks oversharpened though is my only problem with this one.', '2003-06-22 09:50:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(334686, 25000, 3540, '<td valign="top">Stunning how sharp this photo is.  Wish the model was looking somewhere near the camera.  excellent light, exposure, framing.  9</td>', 'Stunning how sharp this photo is.  Wish the model was looking somewhere near the camera.  excellent light, exposure, framing.  9', '2003-06-22 09:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(334689, 25003, 3540, '<td valign="top">This photo needs to be quite a bit sharper.  Its a little underexposed but you wouldn''t want to go too far with it or you''d lose this nice blue sky.  A couple of wispy clouds would''ve been a good addition though.  Good idea, just a soft picture where it should''ve been sharper.</td>', 'This photo needs to be quite a bit sharper.  Its a little underexposed but you wouldn''t want to go too far with it or you''d lose this nice blue sky.  A couple of wispy clouds would''ve been a good addition though.  Good idea, just a soft picture where it should''ve been sharper.', '2003-06-22 09:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(334690, 25012, 3540, '<td valign="top">The sky is fake blue.  I don''t like it.  The subjects are awesome.  They are pin sharp, no doubt.  Very well done with the exception of the sky color</td>', 'The sky is fake blue.  I don''t like it.  The subjects are awesome.  They are pin sharp, no doubt.  Very well done with the exception of the sky color', '2003-06-22 09:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(334691, 24914, 3540, '<td valign="top">I like the corner to corner framing of this one.  One possible way to improve this is to get a little more contrast between the bird and the sky.  Its actually not bad, better than most of my seagulls or other birds come out.</td>', 'I like the corner to corner framing of this one.  One possible way to improve this is to get a little more contrast between the bird and the sky.  Its actually not bad, better than most of my seagulls or other birds come out.', '2003-06-22 09:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(334694, 24873, 3540, '<td valign="top">Intense picture.  Awesome colors, great negative space, a classic 1/3rds picture.  Awesome.  10</td>', 'Intense picture.  Awesome colors, great negative space, a classic 1/3rds picture.  Awesome.  10', '2003-06-22 09:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(334697, 24771, 3540, '<td valign="top">Pixelation in the background is really distracting.  The flower looks half dead.  It is really very sharp and exposed perfectly.  This has the potential to be a winner, but for the reasons aforementioned, probably won''t be.</td>', 'Pixelation in the background is really distracting.  The flower looks half dead.  It is really very sharp and exposed perfectly.  This has the potential to be a winner, but for the reasons aforementioned, probably won''t be.', '2003-06-22 10:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
