(334975, 24734, 8911, '<td valign="top">I love the crisp detail on your subject, down to the antennae and the body being very clear. Nicely off-center, and it works well with the wings balancing it out of the picture and only the antennae extending in. I especially like that your off-center subject is clearly the subject despite not being in the center, because of the focus.</td>', 'I love the crisp detail on your subject, down to the antennae and the body being very clear. Nicely off-center, and it works well with the wings balancing it out of the picture and only the antennae extending in. I especially like that your off-center subject is clearly the subject despite not being in the center, because of the focus.', '2003-06-22 20:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(334978, 25017, 8911, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty church, very clear in the shot - but I admit I find it hard to keep my eyes on it. The vivid yellowing in the foreground makes it where my eyes are drawn, even if it wasn''t the intended subject.... Not much to be done about that, I don''t think, with all those lights there.</td>', 'It''s a pretty church, very clear in the shot - but I admit I find it hard to keep my eyes on it. The vivid yellowing in the foreground makes it where my eyes are drawn, even if it wasn''t the intended subject.... Not much to be done about that, I don''t think, with all those lights there.', '2003-06-22 20:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
