(335102, 24639, 6900, '<td valign="top">Great detail - it''s unfortunate that the bottom 1/10th of the pic is so OoF, but everything else is exceptional.  I wouldn''t be surprised if it''s top 3.  10</td>', 'Great detail - it''s unfortunate that the bottom 1/10th of the pic is so OoF, but everything else is exceptional.  I wouldn''t be surprised if it''s top 3.  10', '2003-06-22 21:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(335103, 24768, 6900, '<td valign="top">One of the most off center shots in the challenge.  I like the cubes outside the area of light - and that the light beams across the center from corner to corner.  Awesome shot. 10</td>', 'One of the most off center shots in the challenge.  I like the cubes outside the area of light - and that the light beams across the center from corner to corner.  Awesome shot. 10', '2003-06-22 21:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(335104, 24735, 6900, '<td valign="top">Crop 2 mm from the bottom to get the head out of there.  Everything else is superb.  9</td>', 'Crop 2 mm from the bottom to get the head out of there.  Everything else is superb.  9', '2003-06-22 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(335105, 24675, 7474, '<td valign="top">awesome idea for the theme,<br/>and i like that you implemented the colors<br/>into the framing too :) well done !</td>', 'awesome idea for the theme,and i like that you implemented the colorsinto the framing too :) well done !', '2003-06-22 21:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(335107, 24965, 6900, '<td valign="top">One of the few shots in the challenge where the challenge itself was important to the picture.  I like how this person is flying into and down towards the center.  It''s great. 9</td>', 'One of the few shots in the challenge where the challenge itself was important to the picture.  I like how this person is flying into and down towards the center.  It''s great. 9', '2003-06-22 21:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(335108, 24441, 6900, '<td valign="top">Wish the focus was a bit better, but I like the texture and the trek forward.  9</td>', 'Wish the focus was a bit better, but I like the texture and the trek forward.  9', '2003-06-22 21:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(335110, 24759, 7474, '<td valign="top">perfect shot for the theme and<br/>so beautiful :) well done</td>', 'perfect shot for the theme andso beautiful :) well done', '2003-06-22 21:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(335111, 24677, 6900, '<td valign="top">Glad to see it got put back in!  Good luck!  7</td>', 'Glad to see it got put back in!  Good luck!  7', '2003-06-22 21:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(335113, 24953, 7474, '<td valign="top">beautiful sharp macro and<br/>perfect color composition :)</td>', 'beautiful sharp macro andperfect color composition :)', '2003-06-22 21:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(335116, 24954, 7474, '<td valign="top">beautiful macro, simple and effective :)</td>', 'beautiful macro, simple and effective :)', '2003-06-22 21:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(335121, 24857, 5044, '<td valign="top">i like it but those string things are distracting.</td>', 'i like it but those string things are distracting.', '2003-06-22 21:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(335130, 24736, 1031, '<td valign="top">A good photo for the Mirror Project too!</td>', 'A good photo for the Mirror Project too!', '2003-06-22 22:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(335138, 24958, 3080, '<td valign="top">On this shot, my eyes are draws right to the center of the photo, which to me seems to be the main focal point.  Particularily where the triangle part on the right meets the rectangle part on the left.  This is barely off centered.  It''s a good photo, and technically well done.  Focus and clarity are good.  Lighting conditions are good, and it looks good on the sky.  Just not ''off center'' enough for me.  Not to worry though, doesn''t effect the score as much as some people do.</td>', 'On this shot, my eyes are draws right to the center of the photo, which to me seems to be the main focal point.  Particularily where the triangle part on the right meets the rectangle part on the left.  This is barely off centered.  It''s a good photo, and technically well done.  Focus and clarity are good.  Lighting conditions are good, and it looks good on the sky.  Just not ''off center'' enough for me.  Not to worry though, doesn''t effect the score as much as some people do.', '2003-06-22 23:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(335139, 24948, 3080, '<td valign="top">Your border isn''t equal all around.  it''s thinner at the top than on the other 3 sides.  I like this shot, but seems to be some blotchyness in the sky.  Colors are ok, nice off centered subject.  Good juse of negative space.</td>', 'Your border isn''t equal all around.  it''s thinner at the top than on the other 3 sides.  I like this shot, but seems to be some blotchyness in the sky.  Colors are ok, nice off centered subject.  Good juse of negative space.', '2003-06-22 23:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(335141, 24677, 3080, '<td valign="top">You got DQ there for a bit, but I see it''s back.  What nice luck!  You are definately off centered, but the subject here really doesn''t do much for me.  I was able to read your description and think this would make a good shot for something like what you were going to do, but individually, it''s not too interesting.  Lighting is good, and focus and clarity are good.  Don''t care for the border.  Oh, your DQ request wasn''t for the border, it was for technique used to make you look short.  Guess they thought editing could have been used.  And it COULD have, but glad that wasn''t the case. :)<br/>~Heather~</td>', 'You got DQ there for a bit, but I see it''s back.  What nice luck!  You are definately off centered, but the subject here really doesn''t do much for me.  I was able to read your description and think this would make a good shot for something like what you were going to do, but individually, it''s not too interesting.  Lighting is good, and focus and clarity are good.  Don''t care for the border.  Oh, your DQ request wasn''t for the border, it was for technique used to make you look short.  Guess they thought editing could have been used.  And it COULD have, but glad that wasn''t the case. :)~Heather~', '2003-06-22 23:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(335142, 24954, 8637, '<td valign="top">Incredibly sharp and beautiful mcro.  thanks</td>', 'Incredibly sharp and beautiful mcro.  thanks', '2003-06-22 23:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(335143, 24833, 8637, '<td valign="top">Great vision and wonderful humor...neat shot.  thanks</td>', 'Great vision and wonderful humor...neat shot.  thanks', '2003-06-22 23:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(335145, 24950, 2667, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. Nicely done.</td>', 'Lovely composition. Nicely done.', '2003-06-22 23:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(335147, 24559, 2667, '<td valign="top">Those critters just look so wild! Good clean composition... very nice.</td>', 'Those critters just look so wild! Good clean composition... very nice.', '2003-06-22 23:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(335149, 24992, 2667, '<td valign="top">Great composition an lovely tone.</td>', 'Great composition an lovely tone.', '2003-06-22 23:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(335150, 24493, 5044, '<td valign="top">Wow! I can feel the velvety texture of those petals! Awesome detail and crisp focus. But...the positioning of the flower is forced into this challenge. There is far too much negative space that makes me wonder why?</td>', 'Wow! I can feel the velvety texture of those petals! Awesome detail and crisp focus. But...the positioning of the flower is forced into this challenge. There is far too much negative space that makes me wonder why?', '2003-06-23 00:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(335151, 24675, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice clean graphic. Very cool looking!</td>', 'Nice clean graphic. Very cool looking!', '2003-06-23 00:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(335154, 24985, 2667, '<td valign="top">This is just sweet. The whole photo seems to be askew, making it one of my top picks for this challenge.</td>', 'This is just sweet. The whole photo seems to be askew, making it one of my top picks for this challenge.', '2003-06-23 00:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(335155, 24839, 2667, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. And one heck of neat looking pool!</td>', 'Nice shot. And one heck of neat looking pool!', '2003-06-23 00:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(335156, 24735, 5044, '<td valign="top">HOw can there be 2 shots like this in the same challenge? Imagine the surprise.  Anyway, i see that you left some person and ground at the bottom of the shot to give perspective, but IMO there is too little to be effective. I would rather have seen it with just the blue sky, it would have given the impression that he was flying. Still a great shot.</td>', 'HOw can there be 2 shots like this in the same challenge? Imagine the surprise.  Anyway, i see that you left some person and ground at the bottom of the shot to give perspective, but IMO there is too little to be effective. I would rather have seen it with just the blue sky, it would have given the impression that he was flying. Still a great shot.', '2003-06-23 00:05:35.000000', NULL, 1);
