(335213, 24901, 5044, '<td valign="top">Wow! what the hell happened here. How did you end up near the bottom with this shot? People just don''t get it. Although I knew it would not win, I had this in my top 10. <br/>Oh well...Live and learn. Great shot John.</td>', 'Wow! what the hell happened here. How did you end up near the bottom with this shot? People just don''t get it. Although I knew it would not win, I had this in my top 10. Oh well...Live and learn. Great shot John.', '2003-06-23 01:31:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(335214, 24833, 5391, '<td valign="top">I loved the tranquility of this shot.  I''m sorry I didn''t get around to commenting during voting (crazy week...) but just wanted to let you know.  I gave it a 9...  It''s gorgeous.  The misty background is everything.  Really makes the barn "pop" out at you.</td>', 'I loved the tranquility of this shot.  I''m sorry I didn''t get around to commenting during voting (crazy week...) but just wanted to let you know.  I gave it a 9...  It''s gorgeous.  The misty background is everything.  Really makes the barn "pop" out at you.', '2003-06-23 01:36:27.000000', NULL, 0),
