(335221, 24523, 6349, '<td valign="top">hey.  we both did pretty good this challenge!  You did a lot better than you thought you were gonna do.  Bet you were pleased!  I''m just glad mine didn''t stay dq''d...rock on</td>', 'hey.  we both did pretty good this challenge!  You did a lot better than you thought you were gonna do.  Bet you were pleased!  I''m just glad mine didn''t stay dq''d...rock on', '2003-06-23 01:48:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(335229, 24958, 6349, '<td valign="top">just wanted to be the first to tell you that you got screwed by the challenge interpreters.  I thought this was off center enough to not lower your score.  I''m very surprised to see it so low, as I thought it was an excellent shot.  Great colors and focus and a very interesting subject which itself is very off center.</td>', 'just wanted to be the first to tell you that you got screwed by the challenge interpreters.  I thought this was off center enough to not lower your score.  I''m very surprised to see it so low, as I thought it was an excellent shot.  Great colors and focus and a very interesting subject which itself is very off center.', '2003-06-23 01:55:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(335232, 24956, 2586, '<td valign="top">Great picture, scab-lab. It doesn''t have the scablabby colors but even in B&amp;W this guy does great stuff. This image hits me in the gut!</td>', 'Great picture, scab-lab. It doesn''t have the scablabby colors but even in B&W this guy does great stuff. This image hits me in the gut!', '2003-06-23 02:00:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(335233, 24962, 6349, '<td valign="top">Hey now.  Adding this to my favorites.  People were pretty harsh on you saying that your subject was the clouds.  I mean, come on...</td>', 'Hey now.  Adding this to my favorites.  People were pretty harsh on you saying that your subject was the clouds.  I mean, come on...', '2003-06-23 02:00:45.000000', NULL, 0),
