(335239, 25012, 6349, '<td valign="top">Hey.  Great showing.  Came back to add this to my favs.</td>', 'Hey.  Great showing.  Came back to add this to my favs.', '2003-06-23 02:07:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(335244, 24759, 6388, '<td valign="top">I disagree that this would have been better with heads rather than tails.  I like the fact that I get to steal a private moment with the foal up front...mom doesn''t even know we''re here. :)  Agree that cropping the sky out would do no harm, and might help, though I''m not sure how. 7 before and 7 now.</td>', 'I disagree that this would have been better with heads rather than tails.  I like the fact that I get to steal a private moment with the foal up front...mom doesn''t even know we''re here. :)  Agree that cropping the sky out would do no harm, and might help, though I''m not sure how. 7 before and 7 now.', '2003-06-23 02:15:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(335262, 24559, 4159, '<td valign="top">So close to 8 - it should''ve passed it, I think.  Very nice work.</td>', 'So close to 8 - it should''ve passed it, I think.  Very nice work.', '2003-06-23 02:29:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(335292, 24916, 2110, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and fits the challange well. Perhaps while shooting if you were shootong it from a little left, yu could have avoided the interference with the flowers below. But then you would have lost the central portion of the flower...the main elemet of interest! Tough situation. I guess given the circumstances, it is a good shot. May be the same flower in side lighting could have created a more dramatic effect.</td>', 'Nice composition and fits the challange well. Perhaps while shooting if you were shootong it from a little left, yu could have avoided the interference with the flowers below. But then you would have lost the central portion of the flower...the main elemet of interest! Tough situation. I guess given the circumstances, it is a good shot. May be the same flower in side lighting could have created a more dramatic effect.', '2003-06-23 02:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(335303, 24673, 2110, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition..Perhaps allowing to see a little more at the bottom could have helped..Very nice lighting. The contrast between the background and the steeple can be increased by reducing the lightless of the blue...</td>', 'Interesting composition..Perhaps allowing to see a little more at the bottom could have helped..Very nice lighting. The contrast between the background and the steeple can be increased by reducing the lightless of the blue...', '2003-06-23 02:53:02.000000', NULL, 0),
