(335503, 24768, 5391, '<td valign="top">I found this to be an extremely interesting photo and was one of the ones who gave this a 9.  I think that it didn''t score a 6 or higher because it''s a shot that belongs in an art show in a gallery or museum - one that the viewer needs to study and appreciate.  Extremely clever.  Perhaps too clever for the casual voter who looks for a second and a half before voting and bases everything on a "wow" factor.  <br/> <br/>Regardless, be proud of this shot.  It''s a winner in my book!</td>', 'I found this to be an extremely interesting photo and was one of the ones who gave this a 9.  I think that it didn''t score a 6 or higher because it''s a shot that belongs in an art show in a gallery or museum - one that the viewer needs to study and appreciate.  Extremely clever.  Perhaps too clever for the casual voter who looks for a second and a half before voting and bases everything on a "wow" factor.   Regardless, be proud of this shot.  It''s a winner in my book!', '2003-06-23 09:29:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(335512, 24962, 2195, '<td valign="top">I agree, If it weren''t for the off-centered dome, it would be a pretty boring shot. Turbulence was a spur-of the moment Title, I didn''t want "untitled" so I went with that. Now I like it, as the dome creates a nice contrast to the sky.<br/> <br/>Thank you to all who comented.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-23 08:52:48.</i></td>', 'I agree, If it weren''t for the off-centered dome, it would be a pretty boring shot. Turbulence was a spur-of the moment Title, I didn''t want "untitled" so I went with that. Now I like it, as the dome creates a nice contrast to the sky. Thank you to all who comented.', '2003-06-23 09:49:39.000000', '2003-06-23 09:52:48.000000', 0),
