(335675, 25018, 1143, '<td valign="top">This is a glass float for a fishing net. I had it sitting on sand and used a flashlight to shine light through. I noticed the snowflake-looking crystal formation on the inside of the glass and focused on it instead of showing the whole globe. The blue is natural. I just adjusted levels a tad but didn''t change the coloring.</td>', 'This is a glass float for a fishing net. I had it sitting on sand and used a flashlight to shine light through. I noticed the snowflake-looking crystal formation on the inside of the glass and focused on it instead of showing the whole globe. The blue is natural. I just adjusted levels a tad but didn''t change the coloring.', '2003-06-23 13:52:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(335717, 24873, 9363, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe this didn''t finish in the top 3!  This photo and the Finish Line were my top picks for this challenge...I''m just in disbelief.  This is a wonderful photograph! It makes me want to crawl inside on the softness of the petal and go down to the core and check out what''s going on down there!</td>', 'I can''t believe this didn''t finish in the top 3!  This photo and the Finish Line were my top picks for this challenge...I''m just in disbelief.  This is a wonderful photograph! It makes me want to crawl inside on the softness of the petal and go down to the core and check out what''s going on down there!', '2003-06-23 14:48:45.000000', NULL, 0),
