(335725, 24741, 6900, '<td valign="top">Unofficial Crit Comment<br/> <br/>First off, I agree that it looks like lens flare.<br/> <br/>Second of all, you broke 4, so you passed the "anything is better than Mav''s 3.9" mark.<br/> <br/>Third - the lights seem off center for the purpose of being off center, not because it adds to the picture.<br/> <br/>Happy shooting!</td>', 'Unofficial Crit Comment First off, I agree that it looks like lens flare. Second of all, you broke 4, so you passed the "anything is better than Mav''s 3.9" mark. Third - the lights seem off center for the purpose of being off center, not because it adds to the picture. Happy shooting!', '2003-06-23 15:08:43.000000', NULL, 0),
