(335728, 24378, 1031, '<td valign="top">Here''s a link to the original from which I created my entry. The off-center subject is the dark spot on the projected image of the sun, just like the title says ....<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=25800" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Original <img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/25800.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/25800.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/1031/thumb/25800.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Here''s a link to the original from which I created my entry. The off-center subject is the dark spot on the projected image of the sun, just like the title says .... Original ', '2003-06-23 15:15:33.000000', NULL, 0),
