(336130, 24559, 8760, '<td valign="top">Toutes mes félicitations de la part d''un habitant du bord du même lac qui débute dans la photographie digitale et qui souhaite parvenir...(un jour peut-être) au même niveau que vos magnifiques photos... Bravo ! P.S. : Je n''ai de cesse d''admirer le portrait du vigneron dénommée "A critical eye on his liquids" qui est vraiment magnifique et qui aurait mérité une meilleure place dans son concours respectif.<br/> <br/>Congratulations from an inhabitant from the same lake coast in Switzerland who''s beginning in digital photography and hopes to be able (...one day)to take such great pictures as you do... P.S. : I can''t stop admirating the picture "A critical eye on his liquids" which is absolutely stunning for me. It deserved a better place<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-06-24 04:15:55.</i></td>', 'Toutes mes félicitations de la part d''un habitant du bord du même lac qui débute dans la photographie digitale et qui souhaite parvenir...(un jour peut-être) au même niveau que vos magnifiques photos... Bravo ! P.S. : Je n''ai de cesse d''admirer le portrait du vigneron dénommée "A critical eye on his liquids" qui est vraiment magnifique et qui aurait mérité une meilleure place dans son concours respectif. Congratulations from an inhabitant from the same lake coast in Switzerland who''s beginning in digital photography and hopes to be able (...one day)to take such great pictures as you do... P.S. : I can''t stop admirating the picture "A critical eye on his liquids" which is absolutely stunning for me. It deserved a better place', '2003-06-24 05:10:23.000000', '2003-06-24 05:15:55.000000', 0),
(336183, 24675, 4285, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments all. I''m a surveyor by trade so that''s where the inspiration came from. I also took a page out of Jacko''s book and used a printed page as the background/foreground; the target/concentric circles were drawn in AutoCad and printed out on my inkjet. I''m very pleased with my final score; my wife was disappointed though , she thought I should have ribbonned but then she has alterior motives - she wanted to be able to say, "See, now what do u need a Canon EOS10D for?" :)<br/> <br/>Owen <br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks for the comments all. I''m a surveyor by trade so that''s where the inspiration came from. I also took a page out of Jacko''s book and used a printed page as the background/foreground; the target/concentric circles were drawn in AutoCad and printed out on my inkjet. I''m very pleased with my final score; my wife was disappointed though , she thought I should have ribbonned but then she has alterior motives - she wanted to be able to say, "See, now what do u need a Canon EOS10D for?" :) Owen  ', '2003-06-24 07:10:17.000000', NULL, 0),
