(336291, 24758, 2344, '<td valign="top">It''s a shame most of the people on here can''t look past that one little speck on your image. It''s super minor and doesn''t warrant lowering the score they would have given you (I dont know if any of them took the speck into consideration though).  I thought this was a pretty good image deserving of 6.2... The only thing I would alter is the lighting on the guitar itself. Moving the light to cast shadows from the strings,etc would help give it a little more dimension and really give it that extra bump to make this a top 10 shot.<br/>Great job</td>', 'It''s a shame most of the people on here can''t look past that one little speck on your image. It''s super minor and doesn''t warrant lowering the score they would have given you (I dont know if any of them took the speck into consideration though).  I thought this was a pretty good image deserving of 6.2... The only thing I would alter is the lighting on the guitar itself. Moving the light to cast shadows from the strings,etc would help give it a little more dimension and really give it that extra bump to make this a top 10 shot.Great job', '2003-06-24 11:17:20.000000', NULL, 0),
