(4693920, 24508, 86447, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this... the grid and the lizard really make a good scene.  I took the liberty of downloading it and playing with it (deleted it right afterwards) and think it would have scored much higher with some Shadow/Highlights and contrast... perhaps even Black and White...  to make the lizard more of a silhouette and the background to be less noticeable, but still be an interesting background.   Good shooting, for sure.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this... the grid and the lizard really make a good scene.  I took the liberty of downloading it and playing with it (deleted it right afterwards) and think it would have scored much higher with some Shadow/Highlights and contrast... perhaps even Black and White...  to make the lizard more of a silhouette and the background to be less noticeable, but still be an interesting background.   Good shooting, for sure.', '2008-05-10 12:40:41.000000', NULL, 0),
